":["como usar pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","o que é insônia","ferramentas de IA para saúde","pwa-audit-sunnahsleep alternative","pwa-audit-sunnahsleep vs outros tratamentos","instalar pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","guia de configuração do pwa-audit-sunnahsleep"],"ru":["как использовать pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","что такое бессонница","ИИ Агенты для здоровья","альтернатива pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","pwa-audit-sunnahsleep vs другие методы лечения","установка pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","руководство по настройке pwa-audit-sunnahsleep"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","ما هو الأرق","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للصحة","بديل pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","pwa-audit-sunnahsleep مقابل علاجات أخرى","تثبيت pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","دليل إعداد pwa-audit-sunnahsleep"]}},"owner":"codingshot","repo":"sunnahsleep","repoPath":"codingshot/sunnahsleep","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.023Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"pwa-audit-sunnahsleep","description":"Audits PWA aspects of SunnahSleep. Use when working on offline support, service worker, manifest, caching, or install flow. Covers vite-plugin-pwa, Workbox, and PWA best practices.","bodyPreview":"# PWA Audit\n\n## Current Setup\n\n- **Build:** vite-plugin-pwa\n- **Manifest:** public/manifest.webmanifest (or generated)\n- **Service Worker:** Workbox (via plugin)\n- **Offline:** Quran audio cached\n\n## Audit Checklist\n\n### Manifest\n\n- [ ] name, short_name, description\n- [ ] icons: 192x192, 512x512\n- [ ] start_url, display: standalone\n- [ ] theme_color, background_color\n- [ ] scope\n\n### Service Worker\n\n- [ ] Precache app shell (HTML, JS, CSS)\n- [ ] Runtime cache for API responses (prayer times—shor","body":"# PWA Audit\n\n## Current Setup\n\n- **Build:** vite-plugin-pwa\n- **Manifest:** public/manifest.webmanifest (or generated)\n- **Service Worker:** Workbox (via plugin)\n- **Offline:** Quran audio cached\n\n## Audit Checklist\n\n### Manifest\n\n- [ ] name, short_name, description\n- [ ] icons: 192x192, 512x512\n- [ ] start_url, display: standalone\n- [ ] theme_color, background_color\n- [ ] scope\n\n### Service Worker\n\n- [ ] Precache app shell (HTML, JS, CSS)\n- [ ] Runtime cache for API responses (prayer times—short TTL)\n- [ ] Cache Quran audio (cdn.islamic.network)\n- [ ] Offline fallback page\n- [ ] Skip waiting / update prompt for new versions\n\n### Caching Strategy\n\n| Resource | Strategy | Notes |\n|----------|----------|-------|\n| App shell | precache | StaleWhileRevalidate |\n| Quran audio | runtime cache | CacheFirst, long TTL |\n| Prayer API | network first | Short cache, fallback to stale |\n| Images | cache first | Static assets |\n\n### Install\n\n- [ ] beforeinstallprompt handled (if desired)\n- [ ] /install page with platform-specific instructions\n- [ ] Display mode: standalone works on home screen\n\n### Performance\n\n- [ ] Lazy load routes where possible\n- [ ] Image optimization (WebP, sizes)\n- [ ] Font loading (Amiri, Inter) – preload critical\n\n## Common Issues\n\n1. **Cache invalidation** – New deploy must update SW; use Workbox’s skipWaiting\n2. **API in SW** – Fetch from SW can have different CORS behavior\n3. **Storage** – localStorage available; IndexedDB for larger data if needed\n4. **Notifications** – Require user permission; document in privacy policy\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:13:17.638Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring comprehensive PWA auditing and optimization for Islamic insomnia cure applications","zh":"适用于需要全面PWA审核和优化的Islamic insomnia cure应用的Web开发代理","ja":"Web開発エージェントが包括的なPWA監査とIslamic insomnia cureアプリケーションの最適化を必要とする場合に最適","ko":"웹 개발 에이전트가 종합적인 PWA 감사 및 Islamic insomnia cure 애플리케이션 최적화를 요구하는 경우에 적합","es":"Ideal para agentes de desarrollo web que requieren una auditoría y optimización de PWA exhaustivas para aplicaciones de cura de insomnio islámico","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de développement Web nécessitant une audit et une optimisation de PWA complètes pour les applications de cure d''insomnie islamique","de":"Ideal für Web-Entwicklungsagenten, die eine umfassende PWA-Auditorie und -Optimierung für islamische Insomnie-Heil-Anwendungen erfordern","pt":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring comprehensive PWA auditing and optimization for Islamic insomnia cure applications","ru":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring comprehensive PWA auditing and optimization for Islamic insomnia cure applications","ar":"Ideal for Web Development Agents requiring comprehensive PWA auditing and optimization for Islamic insomnia cure applications"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to perform thorough audits of Progressive Web Apps, utilizing vite-plugin-pwa, Workbox, and manifest.webmanifest, ensuring seamless offline Quran audio caching and optimized service worker configuration for prayer times and other API responses","zh":"赋予代理商利用vite-plugin-pwa、Workbox和manifest.webmanifest进行全面PWA监査，确保无缝离线Quran音频缓存和优化的服务工作配置，适用于祈祷时间和其他API响应","ja":"vite-plugin-pwa、Workbox、manifest.webmanifestを使用して包括的なPWA監査を実行し、セームレスなオフラインQuranオーディオキャッシュと最適化されたサービスワーカー構成を提供することで、エージェントが祈祷時間や他のAPIレスポンスをサポートできる","ko":"vite-plugin-pwa, Workbox 및 manifest.webmanifest를 사용하여 종합적인 PWA 감사를 수행하여 에이전트가 祈祷 시간 및 기타 API 응답을 지원할 수 있도록 無縫な 오프라인 Quran 오디오 캐싱 및 최적화된 서비스 작업자 구성이 가능하도록 함","es":"Habilita a los agentes a realizar auditorías exhaustivas de Progressive Web Apps, utilizando vite-plugin-pwa, Workbox y manifest.webmanifest, garantizando una caché de audio del Corán sin conexión y una configuración de servicio de trabajo optimizada para horarios de oración y otras respuestas de API","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer des audits approfondis de Progressive Web Apps, en utilisant vite-plugin-pwa, Workbox et manifest.webmanifest, assurant ainsi une mise en cache audio du Coran hors ligne et une configuration de service de travail optimisée pour les horaires de prière et d''autres réponses d''API","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, umfassende Audits von Progressive Web Apps du