u anderen Tools","anviloop-nightly-Anleitung"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","anviloop-nightly","execuções noturnas","automatização de processos","desenvolvimento de software","guias de instalação","configuração de ferramentas"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","anviloop-nightly","ночные запуски","автоматизация процессов","разработка программного обеспечения","руководства по установке","настройка инструментов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","anviloop-nightly","التشغيل الليلي","أتمتة العمليات","تطوير البرمجيات","دليل التثبيت","ضبط الأدوات"]}},"owner":"MoniVibe","repo":"HeadlessRebuildTool","repoPath":"MoniVibe/HeadlessRebuildTool","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.039Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"anviloop-nightly","description":"Run the Anviloop nightly protocol: disk gate, cleanup, required daemons, validity checks, chain-of-custody, and stop rules. Use when planning or executing nightly cycles.","bodyPreview":"# Anviloop Nightly Protocol\r\n\r\n## Gates and cleanup (do first)\r\n\r\n- Disk gate: `pwsh -NoProfile -Command \"''C_free_GB='' + [math]::Round((Get-PSDrive C).Free/1GB,1)\"`\r\n  - Stop builds if < 40 GB.\r\n- Queue cleanup: `pwsh -NoProfile -File Polish/cleanup_queue.ps1 -QueueRoot \"C:/polish/queue\" -RetentionDays 7 -KeepLastPerScenario 3 -Apply`\r\n\r\n## Required daemons\r\n\r\n- WSL runner: `./Polish/WSL/wsl_runner.sh --queue /mnt/c/polish/queue --daemon --print-summary --status-interval 60`\r\n- Intel ingest: `Po","body":"# Anviloop Nightly Protocol\r\n\r\n## Gates and cleanup (do first)\r\n\r\n- Disk gate: `pwsh -NoProfile -Command \"''C_free_GB='' + [math]::Round((Get-PSDrive C).Free/1GB,1)\"`\r\n  - Stop builds if < 40 GB.\r\n- Queue cleanup: `pwsh -NoProfile -File Polish/cleanup_queue.ps1 -QueueRoot \"C:/polish/queue\" -RetentionDays 7 -KeepLastPerScenario 3 -Apply`\r\n\r\n## Required daemons\r\n\r\n- WSL runner: `./Polish/WSL/wsl_runner.sh --queue /mnt/c/polish/queue --daemon --print-summary --status-interval 60`\r\n- Intel ingest: `Polish/Intel/anviloop_intel.py`\r\n- Scoreboard/headline: `Polish/Goals/scoreboard.py`\r\n\r\n## Nightly structure\r\n\r\n- Cycle 0 sentinel once (FTL); proof in `out/player.log` contains `[Anviloop][FTL] FTL_JUMP` with `tick >= 30`.\r\n- Exactly one concept goal per night.\r\n- Do not change scenario and code in the same cycle (code-only first).\r\n\r\n## Validity + chain-of-custody\r\n\r\n- INVALID if telemetry missing/truncated, invariants missing, or oracle keys missing.\r\n- Keep commits only with headless proof.\r\n- Commit in artifact manifest must match result `meta.json`.\r\n\r\n## Stop/switch rules\r\n\r\n- If the same failure signature repeats twice, consult the ledger first.\r\n- If disk drops below gate, stop builds and switch to analysis/doc.\r\n\r\n## References\r\n\r\n- `C:/Dev/unity_clean/headlessrebuildtool/Polish/Docs/NIGHTLY_PROTOCOL.md`\r\n- `C:/Dev/unity_clean/headlessrebuildtool/Polish/Docs/MORNING_VIEW.md`\r\n- `C:/Dev/unity_clean/headlessrebuildtool/Polish/Docs/ANVILOOP_RECURRING_ERRORS.md`\r\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:22:06.603Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Automation Agents requiring nightly disk space management and queue cleanup protocols","zh":"适用于需要每晚磁盘空间管理和队列清理协议的自动化代理","ja":"毎晩のディスク空き容量管理とキューのクリーンアッププロトコルを必要とする自動化エージェントに適しています","ko":"매일 밤 디스크 공간 관리 및 큐 정리 프로토콜이 필요한 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para agentes de automatización que requieren un manejo de espacio de disco nocturno y protocolos de limpieza de cola","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''automatisation qui nécessitent une gestion d''espace disque nocturne et des protocoles de nettoyage de file d''attente","de":"Ideal für Automatisierungsagenten, die ein Nachtliches Management von Diskplatz und Queue-Reinigungsprotokollen benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação que requerem gerenciamento de espaço em disco noturno e protocolos de limpeza de fila","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Автоматизации, требующих ночного управления свободным пространством на диске и протоколов очистки очереди","ar":"يستخدم Agent المثلي للغيارات التي تتطلب إدارة المساحة في القرص الليلي وبروتوكولات تنظيف الفيل "},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce disk gates, stopping builds when free space falls below 40 GB, and automates queue cleanup using PowerShell scripts like cleanup_queue.ps1, ensuring efficient resource allocation and data retention","zh":"赋予代理执行磁盘门控，停止构建时空闲空间低于40 GB，并使用PowerShell脚本（如cleanup_queue.ps1）自动执行队列清理，确保高效的资源分配和数据保留","ja":"エージェントにディスクゲートの適用、空き容量が40 GB未満の場合ビルドを停止し、PowerShellスクリプト（例：cleanup_queue.ps1）を使用したキューのクリーンアップを自動化する機能を提供し、効率的なリソース割り当てとデータ保留を実現する","ko":"에이전트가 디스크 게이트를 강제하고, 사용 가능한 공간이 40GB 미만일 때 빌드를 중지하며, PowerShell 스크립트(cleanup_queue.ps1 등)를 사용하여 큐 정리를 자동화하여, 효율적인 리소스 할당 및 데이터 보존을 보장합니다","es":"Empodera a los agentes para que apliquen puertas de disco, deteniendo las compilaciones cuando el espacio libre cae por debajo de 40 GB, y automatiza la limpieza de cola utilizando scripts de PowerShell como cleanup_queue.ps1, garantizando una asignación de recursos y una retención de datos eficientes","fr":"Empodera a los agentes para que apliquen puertas de disco, deteniendo las compilaciones cuando el espacio libre cae por debajo de 40 GB, y automatiza la limpieza de cola utilizando scripts de PowerShell como cleanup_queue.ps1, garantizando una asignación de recursos y una retención de datos eficientes","de":"Empodera a los agentes para que apliquen puertas de disco, deteniendo las compilaciones cuando el espacio libre cae por debajo de 40 GB, y automatiza la limpieza de cola utilizando scripts de PowerShell como cleanup_queue.ps1, garantizando una asignación de recursos y una retención de datos eficientes","pt":"Empowers agents to enforce disk gates, stopping builds when free space falls below 40 GB, and automates queue cleanup using PowerShell scripts like cleanup_queue.ps1, ensuring efficient resource allocation and data retention","ru":"Empowers agents to enforce disk gates, stopping builds when free space falls below 40 GB, and automates queue cleanup using PowerShell scripts like cleanup_queue.ps1, ensuring efficient resource allocation and data retention","ar":"Empowers agents to enforce disk gates, stopping builds when free space falls below 40 GB, and automates queue cleanup using PowerShell scripts like cleanup_queue.ps1, ensuring efficient resource allocation and data retention"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating disk space checks for nightly builds","Scheduling queue cleanup with retention policies","Ensuring WSL runner and Intel ingest daemon stability"],"zh":["为每晚构建自动执行磁盘空间检查","使用保留策略安排队列清理","确保WSL运行器和Intel摄取守护程序的稳定性"],"ja":["毎晩のビルドのディスク空き容量チェックを自動化する","保留ポリシーを使用してキューのクリーンアップをスケジュールする","WSLランナーとIntelインジェストデーモンの安定性を確保する"],"ko":["매일 밤 빌드에 대한 디스크 공간 체크 자동화","보존 정책을 사용한 큐 정리 예약","WSL 러너 및 Intel 인제스트 데몬의 안정성 보장"],"es":["Automatizar comprobaciones de espacio de disco para compilaciones nocturnas","Programar la limpieza de cola con políticas de retención","Garantizar la estabilidad del WSL runner y del Intel ingest daemon"],"fr":["Automatiser les vérifications d''espace disque pour les compilations nocturnes","Planifier la limpieza de la file d''attente avec des politiques de rétention","Garantir la stabilité du WSL runner et du Intel ingest daemon"],"de":["Automatisieren von Plattenplatz-Prüfungen für Nacht-Compilierungen","Planen der Queue-Reinigung mit Aufbewahrungsrichtlinien","Sicherstellen der Stabilität des WSL runner und des Intel ingest daemon"],"pt":["Automating disk space checks for nightly builds","Scheduling queue cleanup with retention policies","Ensuring WSL runner and Intel ingest daemon stability"],"ru":["Автоматизация проверок свободного пространства на диске для ночных сборок","Scheduling queue cleanup with retention policies","Ensuring WSL runner and Intel ingest daemon stability"],"ar":["تأملية الفضاء في القرص للغيارات الليلية","Scheduling queue cleanup with retention policies","Ensuring WSL runner and Intel ingest daemon stability"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires PowerShell compatibility","Dependent on specific directory structures like C:/polish/queue","Limited to 7-day retention and 3 last builds per scenario"],"zh":["需要PowerShell兼容性","依赖于特定的目录结构，如C:/polish/queue","仅限7天保留和每个场景的最后3个构建"],"ja":["PowerShellの互換性が必要","特定のディレクトリ構造（例：C:/polish/queue）に依存する","7日間の保留とシナリオごとの最後の3つのビルドに限定される"],"ko":["PowerShell 호환성 필요","특정 디렉토리 구조(C:/polish/queue 등) 의존","7일 보존 및 시나리오당 마지막 3개의 빌드 제한"],"es":["Requiere compatibilidad con PowerShell","Dependiente de estructuras de directorio específicas como C:/polish/queue","Limitado a una retención de 7 días y 3 últimas compilaciones por escenario"],"fr":["Requiere compatibilidad con PowerShell","Dependiente de estructuras de directorio específicas como C:/polish/queue","Limitado a una retención de 7 días y 3 últimas compilaciones por escenario"],"de":["Requiere compatibilidad con PowerShell","Dependiente de estructuras de directorio específicas como C:/polish/queue","Limitado a una retención de 7 días y 3 últimas compilaciones por escenario"],"pt":["Requires PowerShell compatibility","Dependent on specific directory structures like C:/polish/queue","Limited to 7-day retention and 3 last builds per scenario"],"ru":["Requires PowerShell compatibility","Dependent on specific directory structures like C:/polish/queue","Limited to 7-day retention and 3 last builds per scenario"],"ar":["Requires PowerShell compatibility","Dependent on specific directory structures like C:/polish/queue","Limited to 7-day retention and 3 last builds per scenario"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"363e1bb827aa4dcb7c645fac9defca0a6010e27846ce7e91fbee254625e3feef","qualityScore":21}');
