t Agent"],"pt":["Entrega de aplicações web com confiança","Escalabilidade e segurança","Integração com React, Python e Node.js","CLI para desenvolvedores","Suporte a Agentes de IA"],"ru":["Доставка веб-приложений с уверенностью","Масштабируемость и безопасность","Интеграция с React, Python и Node.js","CLI для разработчиков","Поддержка ИИ Агентов"],"ar":["إيصال التطبيقات الوب مع الثقة","القدرة على التوسع والأمن","التكامل مع React, Python و Node.js","CLI للمطورين","دعم أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用reference-core","什么是AI智能工具","reference-core替代品","reference-core与竞争对手的比较","reference-core安装","reference-core设置指南","Web应用开发","AI智能优化"],"ja":["reference-coreの使い方","AIエージェントとは","reference-coreの代替","reference-coreと競合製品の比較","reference-coreのインストール","reference-coreの設定ガイド","Webアプリの開発","AIエージェントによる最適化"],"ko":["reference-core 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","reference-core 대체","reference-core와 경쟁사 비교","reference-core 설치","reference-core 설정 가이드","웹 애플리케이션 개발","AI 에이전트 최적화"],"es":["cómo utilizar herramientas de referencia-core","qué es la referencia-core","alternativa a herramientas de referencia-core","herramientas de referencia-core vs competidores","instalación de herramientas de referencia-core","guía de configuración de herramientas de referencia-core","desarrollo de aplicaciones web con React y Python"],"fr":["comment utiliser des outils de référence-core","qu''est-ce que la référence-core","alternative aux outils de référence-core","outils de référence-core vs concurrents","installation des outils de référence-core","guide de configuration des outils de référence-core","développement d''applications web avec React et Python"],"de":["wie man Referenz-Core-Tools verwendet","was ist Referenz-Core","Alternative zu Referenz-Core-Tools","Referenz-Core-Tools vs Wettbewerber","Installation von Referenz-Core-Tools","Konfigurationsanleitung für Referenz-Core-Tools","Entwicklung von Webanwendungen mit React und Python"],"pt":["como usar reference-core","o que é reference-core","reference-core alternativa","reference-core vs outros","instalar reference-core","guia de configuração do reference-core"],"ru":["как использовать reference-core","что такое reference-core","reference-core альтернатива","reference-core vs другие","установить reference-core","руководство по настройке reference-core"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام reference-core","ما هو reference-core","بديل reference-core","reference-core مقابل الآخرين","تثبيت reference-core","دليل إعداد reference-core"]}},"owner":"angular","repo":"angular","repoPath":"angular/angular","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.084Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"reference-core","description":"Explains the mental model and architecture of the code under `packages/core`. You MUST use this skill any time you plan to work with code in `packages/core`","bodyPreview":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.","body":"# Angular Core (`packages/core`) Mental Model\n\nThis document outlines the architecture and mental model for `packages/core`, the heart of the Angular framework.\n\n## 1. High-Level Architecture\n\n`packages/core` contains the runtime logic for Angular. Its primary responsibilities are:\n\n1.  **Rendering (Ivy/Render3)**: Transforming templates into DOM updates.\n2.  **Dependency Injection (DI)**: Managing object creation and lifetime.\n3.  **Change Detection**: Synchronizing the model with the view.\n4.  **Reactivity**: Signals and Zone.js integration.\n\n## 2. Rendering Engine (Ivy / Render3)\n\nThe rendering engine (located in `packages/core/src/render3`) uses an **instruction-based** approach.\n\n### Key Concepts\n\n- **Instructions**: The Angular compiler transforms templates into a sequence of instruction calls (e.g., `ɵɵelementStart`, `ɵɵtext`, `ɵɵproperty`). These instructions are executed at runtime to create and update the view.\n  - _Location_: `packages/core/src/render3/instructions`\n\n- **LView (Logical View)**: An array containing the _state_ of a specific view instance. It holds:\n  - DOM nodes (`RElement`, `RText`).\n  - Binding values (for change detection).\n  - Directive/Component instances.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **TView (Template View)**: An array containing the _static structure_ of a view. It is shared across all instances (`LView`s) of the same component/template. It holds:\n  - Property names for bindings.\n  - Node relationship information.\n  - Compiled directive definitions.\n  - _Context_: `packages/core/src/render3/interfaces/view.ts`\n\n- **Memory Layout**: `LView` and `TView` are parallel arrays. Index `i` in `LView` corresponds to metadata at index `i` in `TView`.\n  - `HEADER`: Fixed size, contains context (Parent, Host, etc.).\n  - `DECLS`: Static nodes (elements, text, pipes).\n  - `VARS`: Binding values.\n  - `EXPANDO`: Dynamic data (host bindings, injectors).\n\n### The Render Cycle\n\n1.  **Creation Mode**: Instructions create DOM nodes and store them in `LView`.\n2.  **Update Mode**: Instructions check current values against previous values stored in `LView`. If changed, they update the DOM.\n\n## 3. Dependency Injection (DI)\n\nDI in Angular is hierarchical and split into two systems that interact:\n\n### Module Injector (`R3Injector`)\n\n- Configured via `@NgModule.providers` or `providedIn: ''root''`.\n- Stored in a hierarchy of `R3Injector` instances.\n- _Location_: `packages/core/src/di/r3_injector.ts`\n\n### Node Injector\n\n- Configured via `@Component.providers` or `@Directive.providers`.\n- **Not a class**, but a data structure embedded in the `LView` (\"Expando\" section).\n- Uses **Bloom Filters** (`TView.data`) to quickly check if a token is present at a specific node index before traversing up the tree.\n- Resolves tokens starting from the current node, walking up the view tree (Element Injector hierarchy), and falling back to the Module Injector if not found.\n\n## 4. Change Detection\n\n- **Dirty Checking**: Angular checks if values bound in templates have changed.\n- **Strategies**:\n  - `Default`: Checks everything.\n  - `OnPush`: Checks only if inputs change, events fire, or signals update.\n- **Signals**: The new reactivity primitive. Signals notify the scheduler when they change, potentially allowing for fine-grained updates (Zoneless).\n\n## 5. Key Directories to Know\n\n- `src/render3`: The Ivy rendering engine.\n  - `instructions`: The runtime instructions called by compiled code.\n  - `interfaces`: `LView`, `TView`, `TNode` definitions.\n- `src/di`: Dependency injection system.\n- `src/change_detection`: Change detection logic.\n- `src/zone`: Zone.js integration.\n- `src/signal`: Signals implementation (if present in this version, otherwise likely in `primitives`).\n\n## 6. Conventions & Gotchas\n\n- **Prefixes**: Private/Internal exports often start with `ɵ`.\n- **Global State**: Ivy relies heavily on global state (e.g., `getLView()`) during instruction execution to avoid passing context arguments everywhere. This is for performance and code size.\n- **Performance**: The code is highly optimized for performance and memory. You will see arrays used instead of objects, bitmasks, and manual memory management patterns. **Respect these patterns.**\n\n## 7. How to Modify Core\n\n1.  **Understand the Instruction**: If modifying runtime behavior, find the corresponding instruction in `src/render3/instructions`.\n2.  **Check `LView`/`TView` Impact**: If adding state, understand where it fits in the `LView` array.\n3.  **Tests**: Core has extensive tests. Run them using Bazel.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:25.064Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing in-depth Angular framework understanding, particularly with Ivy/Render3 and Dependency Injection (DI).","zh":"非常适合需要深入理解Angular框架的前端代理，特别是Ivy/Render3和依赖注入（DI）","ja":"Angularフレームワークを深く理解しているフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。特にIvy/Render3とDependency Injection（DI）","ko":"Angular 프레임워크를 깊이 이해해야 하는 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 특히 Ivy/Render3와 의존성 주입(DI)","es":"Perfecto para Agentes Frontend que necesitan una comprensión en profundidad del framework Angular, particularmente con Ivy/Render3 y Inyección de Dependencias (DI).","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin d''une compréhension approfondie du framework Angular, en particulier avec Ivy/Render3 et l''Injection de Dépendances (DI).","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agenten, die ein tiefes Verständnis des Angular-Frameworks benötigen, insbesondere mit Ivy/Render3 und Abhängigkeitsinjektion (DI).","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de compreensão aprofundada do framework Angular, particularmente com Ivy/Render3 e Injeção de Dependência (DI).","ru":"Идеально для фронтенд-агентов, которым требуется глубокое понимание фреймворка Angular, особенно с Ivy/Render3 и Внедрением Зависимостей (DI).","ar":"مثالي لعميل واجهة المستخدم الذي يحتاج إلى فهم عميق لطراز Angular، خاصة مع Ivy/Render3 و الحقن التابع (DI)."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to deliver web apps with confidence by mastering the Angular Core mental model, leveraging rendering, dependency injection, and change detection capabilities, and utilizing protocols like DOM updates.","zh":"通过掌握Angular Core的心理模型，利用渲染、依赖注入和更改检测功能，并使用诸如DOM更新的协议，赋予代理在Web应用程序交付中充满信心的能力","ja":"Angular Coreの心的モデルをマスターし、レンダリング、依存性注入、変更検出機能を利用し、DOM更新などのプロトコルを使用して、Webアプリケーションの提供で自信を持ってエージェントを提供する力を与える","ko":"Angular Core的心理 모델을 마스터하고 렌더링, 의존성 주입, 변경 검색 기능을 활용하고 DOM 업데이트와 같은 프로토콜을 사용하여 웹 애플리케이션 제공에서 자신감을 갖고 에이전트를 제공할 수 있는 능력을 부여","es":"Habilita a los agentes a entregar aplicaciones web con confianza al dominar el modelo mental de Angular Core, aprovechando la renderización, la inyección de dependencias y las capacidades de detección de cambios, y utilizando protocolos como actualizaciones de DOM.","fr":"Permet aux agents de livrer des applications Web avec confiance en maîtrisant le modèle mental d''Angular Core, en exploitant le rendu, l''injection de dépendances et les capacités de détection de changements, et en utilisant des protocoles tels que des mises à jour de DOM.","de":"Ermöglicht es den Agenten, Webanwendungen mit Vertrauen zu liefern, indem sie das mentale Modell von Angular Core beherrschen, die Rendering-, Abhängigkeitsinjektions- und Änderungserkennungsfunktionen nutzen und Protokolle wie DOM-Updates verwenden.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a entregar aplicativos web com confiança, dominando o modelo mental do Angular Core, aproveitando a renderização, injeção de dependência e capacidades de detecção de alterações, e utilizando protocolos como atualizações do DOM.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью доставлять веб-приложения с уверенностью, осваивая умственную модель Angular Core, используя рендеринг, внедрение зависимостей и возможности обнаружения изменений, и используя протоколы, такие как обновления DOM.","ar":"يمكّن الوكيل من تسليم تطبيقات الويب بثقة من خلال إتقان نموذج Angular Core العقلي، واستخدام العرض والتوجيه التابع وقدرات اكتشاف التغيير، واستخدام بروتوكولات مثل تحديثات DOM."},"useCases":{"en":["Debugging complex template rendering issues","Optimizing dependency injection for improved performance","Implementing efficient change detection strategies"],"zh":["调试复杂模板渲染问题","优化依赖注入以提高性能","实施高效的更改检测策略"],"ja":["複雑なテンプレートレンダリングの問題をデバッグ","パフォーマンスの向上のために依存性注入を最適化","効率的な変更検出戦略を実装"],"ko":["복잡한 템플릿 렌더링 문제 디버깅","성능 개선을 위한 의존성 주입 최적화","효율적인 변경 검색 전략 구현"],"es":["Depuración de problemas de renderizado de plantillas complejas","Optimización de la inyección de dependencias para un mejor rendimiento","Implementación de estrategias de detección de cambios eficientes"],"fr":["Débogage de problèmes de rendu de modèles complexes","Optimisation de l''injection de dépendances pour une meilleure performance","Mise en œuvre de stratégies de détection de changements efficaces"],"de":["Fehlerbehebung bei komplexen Template-Renderproblemen","Optimierung der Abhängigkeitsinjektion für eine bessere Leistung","Implementierung effizienter Änderungserkennungsstrategien"],"pt":["Depuração de problemas de renderização de modelos complexos","Otimização da injeção de dependência para melhor desempenho","Implementação de estratégias de detecção de alterações eficientes"],"ru":["Отладка сложных проблем рендеринга шаблонов","Оптимизация внедрения зависимостей для улучшения производительности","Реализация эффективных стратегий обнаружения изменений"],"ar":["تصحيح أخطاء عرض القوالب المعقدة","تحسين الحقن التابع من أجل أداء أفضل","تنفيذ استراتيجيات اكتشاف التغييرات بشكل فعال"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires knowledge of Angular framework","Limited to Angular Core (packages/core) functionality"],"zh":["需要Angular框架的知识","仅限于Angular Core（packages/core）功能"],"ja":["Angularフレームワークの知識が必要","Angular Core（packages/core）機能に限定"],"ko":["Angular 프레임워크에 대한 지식이 필요","Angular Core（packages/core）기능에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere conocimiento del framework Angular","Limitado a la funcionalidad de Angular Core (packages/core)"],"fr":["Nécessite des connaissances du framework Angular","Limité à la fonctionnalité d''Angular Core (packages/core)"],"de":["Benötigt Kenntnisse des Angular-Frameworks","Begrenzt auf die Funktionalität von Angular Core (packages/core)"],"pt":["Exige conhecimento do framework Angular","Limitado à funcionalidade do Angular Core (packages/core)"],"ru":["Требует знания фреймворка Angular","Ограничен функциональностью Angular Core (packages/core)"],"ar":["يتطلب معرفة بإطار Angular","محدود بالوظائف الأساسية ل Angular (packages/core)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"c4c1c69569c62394fd6727ed0d09ca281d842fe48fd812d766e56b11320239d6","qualityScore":21}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('flutter/flutter-intellij/triage-helper', 'community', 'flutter', 'flutter-intellij', 'flutter/flutter-intellij', 'triage-helper', 0, 0, 21, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.085Z', '2026-03-02T03:29:46.306Z', '1e680800adb1a9e060dfd749d2652e3721183ff60afac59329e8ec01b70bf884', '{"id":"flutter/flutter-intellij/triage-helper","name":"triage-helper","description":{"zh":"triage-helper是为IntelliJ开发的Flutter插件，用于提高开发效率","ja":"triage-helperはIntelliJ用のFlutterプラグインで、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"triage-helper는 IntelliJ용 플러터 플러그인으로 개발 효율을 향상시킵니다","es":"El plugin de triage para IntelliJ es una herramienta para desarrolladores de Flutter que ayuda a simplificar el proceso de depuración y solución de problemas.","fr":"Le plugin de triage pour IntelliJ est un outil pour les développeurs Flutter qui aide à simplifier le processus de débogage et de résolution de problèmes.","de":"Das Triage-Plugin für IntelliJ ist ein Tool für Flutter-Entwickler, das dabei hilft, den Prozess der Fehlersuche und -behebung zu vereinfachen.","pt":"O Triage-Helper é um plugin para IntelliJ que facilita o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter","ru":"Triage-Helper - плагин для IntelliJ, упрощающий разработку приложений Flutter с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"Triage-Helper هو إضافة لIntelliJ تسهل تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","en":"Flutter Plugin for IntelliJ"},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AI智能工具：triage-helper Flutter插件","ja":"AIエージェント：triage-helper Flutterプラグイン","ko":"AI 에이전트: triage-helper 플러터 플러그인","es":"Herramienta de triage para Flutter - Ayuda para desarroll...","fr":"Outil de triage pour Flutter - Aide pour les développeurs","de":"Triage-Tool für Flutter - Hilfe für Entwickler","pt":"Ferramenta de Triagem para Flutter - Triage-Helper","ru":"ИИ Агент для Flutter - Triage-Helper","ar":"أداة فحص مسبق لFlutter - Triage-Helper","en":"triage-helper"},"description":{"zh":"triage-helper是为IntelliJ开发的Flutter插件，用于提高开发效率","ja":"triage-helperはIntelliJ用のFlutterプラグインで、開発効率を向上させる","ko":"triage-helper는 IntelliJ용 플러터 플러그인으로 개발 효율을 향상시킵니다","es":"El plugin de triage para IntelliJ es una herramienta para desarrolladores de Flutter que ayuda a simplificar el proceso de depuración y solución de problemas.","fr":"Le plugin de triage pour IntelliJ est un outil pour les développeurs Flutter qui aide à simplifier le processus de débogage et de résolution de problèmes.","de":"Das Triage-Plugin für IntelliJ ist ein Tool für Flutter-Entwickler, das dabei hilft, den Prozess der Fehlersuche und -behebung zu vereinfachen.","pt":"O Triage-Helper é um plugin para IntelliJ que facilita o desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter","ru":"Triage-Helper - плагин для IntelliJ, упрощающий разработку приложений Flutter с помощью ИИ Агентов","ar":"Triage-Helper هو إضافة لIntelliJ تسهل تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","en":"Flutter Plugin for IntelliJ"},"definition":{"en":"Flutter Plugin for IntelliJ"},"features":{"zh":["提高代码质量","提高开发效率","支持IntelliJ","Flutter插件","AI智能辅助","简化开发流程"],"ja":["コード品質の向上","開発効率の向上","IntelliJ対応","Flutterプラグイン","AIエージェントによる支援","開発プロセスの簡素化"],"ko":["코드 품질 향상","개발 효율 향상","IntelliJ 지원","플러터 플러그인","AI 에이전트 지원","개발 프로세스 단순화"],"es":["Integración con IntelliJ","Análisis de código automatizado","Priorización de problemas","Informes detallados","Personalización de reglas de triage"],"fr":["Intégration avec IntelliJ","Analyse de code automatisée","Priorisation des problèmes","Rapports détaillés","Personnalisation des règles de triage"],"de":["Integration mit IntelliJ","Automatisierte Code-Analyse","Priorisierung von Problemen","Detaillierte Berichte","Anpassung von Triage-Regeln"],"pt":["Plugin para IntelliJ","Desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter","Ferramenta de triagem para identificar problemas","Integração com o ecossistema Flutter","Melhoria da produtividade do desenvolvedor"],"ru":["Плагин для IntelliJ","Разработка приложений Flutter с помощью ИИ Агентов","Инструмент для выявления проблем","Интеграция с экосистемой Flutter","Повышение производительности разработчика"],"ar":["إضافة لIntelliJ","تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","أداة فحص مسبق لتحديد المشاكل","التكامل مع نظام Flutter","تحسين إنتاجية المطور"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用triage-helper","什么是triage-helper","triage-helper替代品","triage-helper与其他工具的比较","triage-helper安装","triage-helper设置指南","Flutter开发工具","IntelliJ插件"],"ja":["triage-helperの使い方","triage-helperとは","triage-helperの代替","triage-helperと他のツールの比較","triage-helperのインストール","triage-helperの設定ガイド","Flutter開発ツール","IntelliJプラグイン"],"ko":["triage-helper 사용법","triage-helper란","triage-helper 대체","triage-helper와 다른 도구의 비교","triage-helper 설치","triage-helper 설정 가이드","플러터 개발 도구","IntelliJ 플러그인"],"es":["herramienta de triage","plugin de triage para IntelliJ","desarrollo de Flutter","depuración de código","solución de problemas","cómo usar el plugin de triage","alternativas al plugin de triage"],"fr":["outil de triage","plugin de triage pour IntelliJ","développement Flutter","débogage de code","résolution de problèmes","comment utiliser le plugin de triage","alternatives au plugin de triage"],"de":["Triage-Tool","Triage-Plugin für IntelliJ","Flutter-Entwicklung","Fehlersuche im Code","Problembehebung","wie man das Triage-Plugin verwendet","Alternativen zum Triage-Plugin"],"pt":["como usar Triage-Helper","o que é Triage-Helper","Triage-Helper alternativa","Triage-Helper vs outros plugins","instalar Triage-Helper","guia de configuração do Triage-Helper","desenvolvimento de aplicativos Flutter","plugin para IntelliJ"],"ru":["как использовать Triage-Helper","что такое Triage-Helper","Triage-Helper альтернатива","Triage-Helper vs другие плагины","установить Triage-Helper","руководство по настройке Triage-Helper","разработка приложений Flutter с помощью ИИ Агентов","плагин для IntelliJ"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Triage-Helper","ما هو Triage-Helper","بديل Triage-Helper","Triage-Helper مقابل إضافات أخرى","تثبيت Triage-Helper","دليل إعداد Triage-Helper","تطوير تطبيقات Flutter","إضافة لIntelliJ"]}},"owner":"flutter","repo":"flutter-intellij","repoPath":"flutter/flutter-intellij","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.085Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"triage-helper","description":"Assistance with triage of unprioritized issues. Use when the user asks for help with triage.","bodyPreview":"When a user asks for help in the CLI:\n- Find the latest open issues in the https://github.com/flutter/flutter-intellij/ repo that don''t have a priority label.\n- If you encounter authentication issues, guide the user to check their `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` depending on available tools.\n- Reference `docs/Triaging.md` for detailed setup instructions.\n- Consider the most recently updated issues first. Start presenting issues one at a time to the user, with the issue URL and othe","body":"When a user asks for help in the CLI:\n- Find the latest open issues in the https://github.com/flutter/flutter-intellij/ repo that don''t have a priority label.\n- If you encounter authentication issues, guide the user to check their `github-mcp-server` setup or `gh auth status` depending on available tools.\n- Reference `docs/Triaging.md` for detailed setup instructions.\n- Consider the most recently updated issues first. Start presenting issues one at a time to the user, with the issue URL and other relevant information.\n- For each issue, give suggestions such as:\n    - Close the issue if it''s not relevant anymore (e.g. it''s been fixed, the code it''s referencing is outdated, etc.)\n    - Suggest how to reproduce if it looks like it may be easy to reproduce locally\n    - Ask for a reproduction with a small project if reproduction may be hard locally\n    - Ask for more information and apply a waiting for response label\n    - Note a code pointer for the issue if it could be a good first issue for an external contributor\n    - Suggest a priority and other labels that may be relevant along with reasoning for the priority\n- Then wait for user feedback before continuing on to the next issue.\n\nAvoid executing tasks on GitHub directly, such as making comments, applying labels, or closing issues.\n\nThere is additional context on our issue triage process in docs/Triaging.md."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:29:46.306Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Python Analysis Agents needing advanced issue triage capabilities.","zh":"适用于需要高级问题诊断功能的Python分析代理。","ja":"Python分析エージェントが高度な問題のトリアージ機能を必要とする場合に適しています。","ko":"고급 문제 진단 기능이 필요한 Python 분석 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de análisis de Python que necesitan capacidades de triage de problemas avanzadas.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''analyse Python nécessitant des capacités de triage de problèmes avancées.","de":"Ideal für Python-Analyse-Agents, die erweiterte Fähigkeiten zur Problemtriage benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Análise Python que necessitam de capacidades avançadas de triagem de problemas.","ru":"Идеально для агентов анализа Python, которым необходимы расширенные возможности триажа проблем.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل بايثون الذي يحتاج إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لترياق المشكلات."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to analyze and prioritize open issues in the Flutter plugin for IntelliJ repository using GitHub API, without requiring manual authentication checks or priority label management. It provides issue filtering and prioritization.","zh":"赋予代理分析和优先处理GitHub API中的Flutter插件IntelliJ存储库中的打开问题的能力，而无需手动身份验证检查或优先级标签管理。它提供问题过滤和优先级排序。","ja":"GitHub APIを使用して、Flutterプラグインfor IntelliJリポジトリ内のオープン問題を分析および優先順位付けするエージェントを可能にします。手動での認証チェックや優先順位付けラベルの管理は不要です。問題のフィルタリングや優先順位付けが提供されます。","ko":"GitHub API를 사용하여 Flutter 플러그인 for IntelliJ 저장소의 열린 문제를 분석 및 우선순위 지정할 수 있는 에이전트를 가능하게 합니다. 수동 인증 확인 또는 우선순위 지정 레이블 관리가 필요 없습니다. 문제 필터링 및 우선순위 지정이 제공됩니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para analizar y priorizar problemas abiertos en el repositorio del plugin de Flutter para IntelliJ utilizando GitHub API, sin requerir comprobaciones de autenticación manuales o gestión de etiquetas de prioridad. Proporciona filtrado y priorización de problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''analyser et de prioriser les problèmes ouverts dans le référentiel du plugin Flutter pour IntelliJ en utilisant l''API GitHub, sans nécessiter de vérifications d''authentification manuelles ou de gestion d''étiquettes de priorité. Il fournit un filtrage et une priorisation des problèmes.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, offene Probleme im Flutter-Plugin-Repository für IntelliJ mithilfe von GitHub API zu analysieren und zu priorisieren, ohne manuelle Authentifizierungsprüfungen oder Prioritätslabelverwaltung zu erfordern. Es bietet Problemfilterung und -priorisierung.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a analisar e priorizar problemas abertos no repositório do plugin Flutter para IntelliJ usando a API do GitHub, sem exigir verificações de autenticação manuais ou gerenciamento de rótulos de prioridade. Ele fornece filtragem e priorização de problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью анализировать и расставлять приоритеты открытых проблем в репозитории плагина Flutter для IntelliJ с помощью API GitHub, не требуя ручных проверок аутентификации или управления метками приоритета. Он обеспечивает фильтрацию и расстановку приоритетов проблем.","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من خلالها من تحليل ومتابعة المشكلات المفتوحة في مستودع ملحقات Flutter لبرنامج IntelliJ باستخدام واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub، دون الحاجة إلى عمليات التحقق اليدوية أو إدارة علامات الأولوية. كما يوفر تصفية وتحديد أولويات المشكلات."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue triage for newly reported issues","Generating issue reports for recently updated issues","Debugging authentication issues in the GitHub API"],"zh":["自动执行新报告问题的问题诊断","生成最近更新问题的问题报告","调试GitHub API中的身份验证问题"],"ja":["新しく報告された問題の問題トリアージを自動化する","最近更新された問題の問題レポートを生成する","GitHub API内の認証問題をデバッグする"],"ko":["신규 보고된 문제의 문제 진단을 자동화하는 것","최근 업데이트된 문제의 문제 보고서를 생성하는 것","GitHub API 내의 인증 문제를 디버깅하는 것"],"es":["Automatización del triage de problemas para problemas informados recientemente","Generación de informes de problemas para problemas actualizados recientemente","Depuración de problemas de autenticación en la API de GitHub"],"fr":["Automatisation du triage des problèmes pour les problèmes signalés récemment","Génération de rapports de problèmes pour les problèmes mis à jour récemment","Débogage des problèmes d''authentification dans l''API GitHub"],"de":["Automatisierung des Problem-Triags für neu gemeldete Probleme","Erstellung von Problemberichten für kürzlich aktualisierte Probleme","Fehlerbehebung bei Authentifizierungsproblemen in der GitHub-API"],"pt":["Automatizar a triagem de problemas para problemas recém-relatados","Gerar relatórios de problemas para problemas atualizados recentemente","Depurar problemas de autenticação na API do GitHub"],"ru":["Автоматизировать триаж проблем для новооткрытых проблем","Генерировать отчеты о проблемах для недавно обновленных проблем","Отлаживать проблемы аутентификации в API GitHub"],"ar":["الاستفادة من آليّة ترياق المشكلات لأولئك الذين تم الإبلاغ عنهم مؤخرا","إنتاج تقارير عن المشكلات التي تم تحديثها مؤخرا","تصحيح مشاكل المصادقة في واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub API access","Limited to issues in the Flutter plugin for IntelliJ repository"],"zh":["需要GitHub API访问","仅限于Flutter插件for IntelliJ存储库中的问题"],"ja":["GitHub APIへのアクセスが必要","Flutterプラグインfor IntelliJリポジトリ内の問題のみ"],"ko":["GitHub API 액세스가 필요함","Flutter 플러그인 for IntelliJ 저장소의 문제에만 محدود"],"es":["Requiere acceso a la API de GitHub","Limitado a problemas en el repositorio del plugin de Flutter para IntelliJ"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à l''API GitHub","Limité aux problèmes dans le référentiel du plugin Flutter pour IntelliJ"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf die GitHub-API","Begrenzt auf Probleme im Flutter-Plugin-Repository für IntelliJ"],"pt":["Exige acesso à API do GitHub","Limitado a problemas no repositório do plugin Flutter para IntelliJ"],"ru":["Требует доступа к API GitHub","Ограничен проблемами в репозитории плагина Flutter для IntelliJ"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى واجهة برمجة تطبيقات GitHub","محدود بالمشكلات في مستودع ملحقات Flutter لبرنامج IntelliJ"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1e680800adb1a9e060dfd749d2652e3721183ff60afac59329e8ec01b70bf884","qualityScore":21}');
