aywright-test-...","en":"coverage-master"},"description":{"zh":"Coverage Master是用于提高代码测试效率的AI智能工具，基于playwright-test-dashboard","ja":"Coverage Masterはコードテストの効率を向上させるAIエージェントで、playwright-test-dashboardをベースに開発","ko":"Coverage Master는 코드 테스트 효율성을 향상시키는 AI 에이전트로 playwright-test-dashboard 기반으로 개발","es":"Coverage-master es una herramienta que utiliza playwright-test-dashboard para mejorar la cobertura de tus pruebas","fr":"Coverage-master est un outil qui utilise playwright-test-dashboard pour améliorer la couverture de vos tests","de":"Coverage-master ist ein Tool, das playwright-test-dashboard verwendet, um die Abdeckung Ihrer Tests zu verbessern","pt":"O coverage-master é uma ferramenta de teste avançada para playwright-test-dashboard, oferecendo recursos de teste automatizado","ru":"coverage-master — это продвинутый инструмент тестирования для playwright-test-dashboard, предлагающий функции автоматизированного тестирования","ar":"coverage-master هو أداة اختبار متقدمة لplaywright-test-dashboard، تقدم ميزات اختبار آلي","en":"playwright-test-dashboard"},"definition":{"en":"playwright-test-dashboard"},"features":{"zh":["基于playwright-test-dashboard","提高代码测试效率","支持多种测试框架","提供详细的测试报告","易于集成和使用","支持CLI命令"],"ja":["playwright-test-dashboardをベースに開発","コードテストの効率を向上させる","複数のテストフレームワークをサポート","詳細なテストレポートを提供","簡単に統合および使用可能","CLIコマンドをサポート"],"ko":["playwright-test-dashboard 기반으로 개발","코드 테스트 효율성을 향상시킵니다","다수의 테스트 프레임워크를 지원","상세한 테스트 보고서를 제공","쉽게 통합 및 사용 가능","CLI 명령어를 지원"],"es":["Integración con playwright-test-dashboard","Análisis de cobertura de código","Informes detallados de pruebas","Optimización de pruebas automatizadas","Soporte para múltiples frameworks de testing"],"fr":["Intégration avec playwright-test-dashboard","Analyse de la couverture de code","Rapports détaillés de tests","Optimisation des tests automatisés","Prise en charge de plusieurs frameworks de testing"],"de":["Integration mit playwright-test-dashboard","Analyse der Codeabdeckung","Detaillierte Testberichte","Optimierung von automatisierten Tests","Unterstützung für mehrere Testing-Frameworks"],"pt":["Recursos de teste automatizado","Integração com playwright-test-dashboard","Relatórios de teste detalhados","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes de teste","Otimização de desempenho de teste"],"ru":["Функции автоматизированного тестирования","Интеграция с playwright-test-dashboard","Детальные отчеты о тестировании","Поддержка нескольких тестовых сред","Оптимизация производительности тестирования"],"ar":["ميزات اختبار آلي","التكامل مع playwright-test-dashboard","تقارير اختبار مفصلة","دعم بيئات اختبار متعددة","تحسين أداء الاختبار"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Coverage Master","什么是AI智能工具","Coverage Master替代品","Coverage Master vs Jest","Coverage Master安装","Coverage Master设置指南","playwright-test-dashboard教程","代码测试效率优化"],"ja":["Coverage Masterの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Coverage Masterの代替","Coverage Master vs Jest","Coverage Masterのインストール","Coverage Masterの設定ガイド","playwright-test-dashboardのチュートリアル","コードテストの効率化"],"ko":["Coverage Master 사용법","AI 에이전트란","Coverage Master 대안","Coverage Master vs Jest","Coverage Master 설치","Coverage Master 설정 가이드","playwright-test-dashboard 튜토리얼","코드 테스트 효율성 향상"],"es":["cómo usar coverage-master","herramientas de testing","playwright-test-dashboard","alternativas a coverage-master","instalación de coverage-master","guía de configuración de coverage-master"],"fr":["comment utiliser coverage-master","outils de testing","playwright-test-dashboard","alternatives à coverage-master","installation de coverage-master","guide de configuration de coverage-master"],"de":["wie man coverage-master verwendet","Testing-Tools","playwright-test-dashboard","Alternativen zu coverage-master","Installation von coverage-master","Konfigurationsanleitung für coverage-master"],"pt":["como usar coverage-master","o que é coverage-master","coverage-master vs playwright","instalar coverage-master","guia de configuração do coverage-master","alternativas ao coverage-master"],"ru":["как использовать coverage-master","что такое coverage-master","coverage-master vs playwright","установить coverage-master","руководство по настройке coverage-master","альтернативы coverage-master"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام coverage-master","ما هو coverage-master","coverage-master مقابل playwright","تثبيت coverage-master","دليل إعداد coverage-master","بديل coverage-master"]}},"owner":"shvydak","repo":"yshvydak-test-dashboard","repoPath":"shvydak/yshvydak-test-dashboard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.092Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"coverage-master","description":"Test Coverage Analyst. Enforces testing standards and identifies gaps.","bodyPreview":"# Coverage Master Protocol\n\nYou are the **Test Enforcer**. Your goal is to ensure no code goes untested.\n\n## 🎯 Targets\n\n- **Reporter:** 90% (Critical - Test ID generation)\n- **Server:** 80%\n- **Web:** 70%\n\n## 🔄 Workflow\n\n1.  **Analyze Context:**\n    - Look at the files created/modified in the last turn (or by `git diff`).\n    - Identify: Did we add a new Service? A new Endpoint? A new Utility?\n\n2.  **Gap Detection:**\n    - For every `*.service.ts`, check if `__tests__/*.service.test.ts` exists","body":"# Coverage Master Protocol\n\nYou are the **Test Enforcer**. Your goal is to ensure no code goes untested.\n\n## 🎯 Targets\n\n- **Reporter:** 90% (Critical - Test ID generation)\n- **Server:** 80%\n- **Web:** 70%\n\n## 🔄 Workflow\n\n1.  **Analyze Context:**\n    - Look at the files created/modified in the last turn (or by `git diff`).\n    - Identify: Did we add a new Service? A new Endpoint? A new Utility?\n\n2.  **Gap Detection:**\n    - For every `*.service.ts`, check if `__tests__/*.service.test.ts` exists.\n    - For every `*.controller.ts`, check if an integration test exists.\n    - Use `run_shell_command(\"ls ...\")` to verify file existence.\n\n3.  **Coverage Check (Optional):**\n    - If requested, run `npm run test:coverage` (Warning: this is slow).\n    - Prefer targetted testing: `npm test -- related_file.ts`.\n\n4.  **Action:**\n    - **Missing Test?** -> \"⚠️ Created `UserService` but found no test. Creating test skeleton...\"\n    - **Write Test:** Use `write_file` to create the missing test following the patterns in `packages/*/src/__tests__/`.\n\n## 🧪 Best Practices\n\n- Mock external dependencies (Database, WebSocket).\n- Test edge cases (null, empty arrays, errors).\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:31:57.771Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Test Automation Agents requiring comprehensive code coverage analysis and enforcement","zh":"适用于需要全面代码覆盖分析和执行的测试自动化代理","ja":"包括React、Pythonなどのコードの包括的なカバレッジ分析と適用が必要なテスト自動化エージェントに適しています","ko":"전체 코드 커버리지 분석 및 적용이 필요한 테스트 자동화 에이전트에 적합합니다","es":"Ideal para Test Automation Agents que requieren análisis y aplicación exhaustiva de la cobertura de código","fr":"Idéal pour les Test Automation Agents nécessitant une analyse et une application complètes de la couverture de code","de":"Ideal für Test Automation Agents, die eine umfassende Analyse und Durchsetzung der Codeabdeckung benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Automação de Testes que exigem análise e aplicação abrangentes de cobertura de código","ru":"Идеально для агентов автоматизации тестирования, требующих всестороннего анализа и обеспечения покрытия кода","ar":"مثالي لعميل تلقيم اختبار التلقائي الذي يتطلب تحليل وتطبيق شاملي لتغطية الشفرة"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce 90% test coverage for critical components like Reporter, utilizing protocols such as the Coverage Master Protocol, and integrating with tools like playwright-test-dashboard to ensure thorough testing of Services, Endpoints, and Utilities, via gap detection in __tests__ directories","zh":"赋予代理执行关键组件（如Reporter）90%的测试覆盖率，利用Coverage Master Protocol等协议，并集成playwright-test-dashboard等工具，以确保对Services、Endpoints和Utilities进行彻底的测试，通过在__tests__目录中检测缺口","ja":"エージェントに、レポーターなどの重要なコンポーネントに対して90%のテストカバレッジを適用させることができます。Coverage Master Protocolなどのプロトコルを利用し、playwright-test-dashboardなどのツールと統合して、Services、Endpoints、Utilitiesなどのテストを徹底的に行い、__tests__ディレクトリ内のギャップを検出します","ko":"에이전트에 Reporter와 같은 중요한 구성 요소에 대해 90%의 테스트 커버리지 적용을 가능하게 함으로써 Coverage Master Protocol과 같은 프로토콜을 사용하고 playwright-test-dashboard와 같은 도구와 통합하여 서비스, 엔드ポイント 및 유틸리티에 대한 철저한 테스트를 보장하며 __tests__ 디렉토리에서 격차를 감지함","es":"Permite a los agents aplicar una cobertura de pruebas del 90% para componentes críticos como Reporter, utilizando protocolos como el Coverage Master Protocol e integrando con herramientas como playwright-test-dashboard para garantizar pruebas exhaustivas de Services, Endpoints y Utilities, mediante la detección de brechas en directorios __tests__","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer une couverture de tests de 90 % pour les composants critiques comme Reporter, en utilisant des protocoles tels que le Coverage Master Protocol et en s''intégrant à des outils comme playwright-test-dashboard pour assurer des tests approfondis des Services, Endpoints et Utilities, via la détection des lacunes dans les répertoires __tests__","de":"Ermöglicht Agents die Durchsetzung einer Testabdeckung von 90 % für kritische Komponenten wie Reporter unter Verwendung von Protokollen wie dem Coverage Master Protocol und der Integration mit Tools wie playwright-test-dashboard, um gründliche Tests von Services, Endpoints und Utilities durch Erkennung von Lücken in __tests__-Verzeichnissen sicherzustellen","pt":"Habilita agentes a aplicar 90% de cobertura de testes para componentes críticos como Reporter, utilizando protocolos como o Coverage Master Protocol, e integrando com ferramentas como playwright-test-dashboard para garantir testes abrangentes de Serviços, Endpoints e Utilitários, via detecção de lacunas em diretórios __tests__","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить 90% покрытия тестов для критических компонентов, таких как Reporter, используя протоколы, такие как Coverage Master Protocol, и интегрируя с инструментами, такими как playwright-test-dashboard, для обеспечения тщательного тестирования Служб, Конечных точек и Утилит, посредством обнаружения пробелов в директориях __tests__","ar":"يتمكن العملاء من تطبيق 90% من تغطية الاختبار للعناصر الحيوية مثل Reporter، باستخدام بروتوكولات مثل بروتوكول Coverage Master ، ودمجها مع أدوات مثل playwright-test-dashboard لضمان اختبار شامل للخدمات والنقاط النهائية والمرافق، من خلال اكتشاف الفجوات في مجلدات __tests__"},"useCases":{"en":["Enforcing test coverage thresholds for new Services and Endpoints","Automating gap detection in test suites for Utilities and Servers","Analyzing code modifications to ensure adequate test coverage"],"zh":["执行新服务和端点的测试覆盖率阈值","自动检测测试套件中的Utilities和Servers的缺口","分析代码修改以确保足够的测试覆盖率"],"ja":["新しいサービスやエンドポイントのテストカバレッジのしきい値を適用する","テストスイートのUtilitiesやServersのギャップを自動で検出する","コードの変更を分析して十分なテストカバレッジを確保する"],"ko":["新的 서비스 및 엔드ポイント에 대한 테스트 커버리지 임계값 적용","테스트 스위트에서 유틸리티 및 서버의 격차 자동 감지","코드 변경 분석을 통해 충분한 테스트 커버리지 보장"],"es":["Aplicación de umbrales de cobertura de pruebas para nuevos Services y Endpoints","Automatización de la detección de brechas en suites de pruebas para Utilities y Servers","Análisis de modificaciones de código para garantizar una cobertura de pruebas adecuada"],"fr":["Application des seuils de couverture de tests pour les nouveaux Services et Endpoints","Automatisation de la détection des lacunes dans les suites de tests pour les Utilities et Servers","Analyse des modifications de code pour assurer une couverture de tests adéquate"],"de":["Durchsetzung von Testabdeckungs-Schwellenwerten für neue Services und Endpoints","Automatisierung der Lückenerkennung in Testsuites für Utilities und Servers","Analyse von Codeänderungen zur Sicherstellung einer angemessenen Testabdeckung"],"pt":["Aplicar limites de cobertura de testes para novos Serviços e Endpoints","Automatizar detecção de lacunas em conjuntos de testes para Utilitários e Servidores","Analisar modificações de código para garantir cobertura de testes adequada"],"ru":["Обеспечить пороги покрытия тестов для новых Служб и Конечных точек","Автоматизировать обнаружение пробелов в наборах тестов для Утилит и Серверов","Анализировать изменения кода для обеспечения достаточного покрытия тестов"],"ar":["تطبيق حدود تغطية الاختبار للخدمات والنقاط النهائية الجديدة","تحسين اكتشاف الفجوات في مجموعات الاختبار للبرامج والخادم","تحليل تعديلات الشفرة لضمان تغطية اختبار كافية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to code repositories and version control systems like git","Limited to specific test coverage targets (e.g., 90% for Reporter, 80% for Server)"],"zh":["需要访问代码仓库和版本控制系统，如git","仅限于特定的测试覆盖率目标（例如，Reporter为90%，Server为80%）"],"ja":["コードリポジトリやgitなどのバージョン管理システムへのアクセスが必要","特定のテストカバレッジの目標（例：レポーターは90%、サーバーは80%）に限定される"],"ko":["코드 저장소 및 버전 관리 시스템인 git와 같은 시스템에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다.","특정 테스트 커버리지 목표(예: Reporter는 90%, Server는 80%)에 한정됨"],"es":["Requiere acceso a repositorios de código y sistemas de control de versiones como git","Limitado a objetivos de cobertura de pruebas específicos (por ejemplo, 90 % para Reporter, 80 % para Server)"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès aux dépôts de code et aux systèmes de contrôle de version comme git","Limité à des objectifs de couverture de tests spécifiques (par exemple, 90 % pour Reporter, 80 % pour Server)"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf Code-Repositories und Versionskontrollsysteme wie git","Beschränkt auf spezifische Testabdeckungsziele (z. B. 90 % für Reporter, 80 % für Server)"],"pt":["Exige acesso a repositórios de código e sistemas de controle de versão como git","Limitado a objetivos de cobertura de testes específicos (por exemplo, 90% para Reporter, 80% para Servidor)"],"ru":["Требует доступа к хранилищам кода и системам контроля версий, таким как git","Ограничен конкретными целями покрытия тестов (например, 90% для Reporter, 80% для Сервера)"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مستودعات الشفرة وأنظمة التحكم في الإصدار مثل جيت","محدود بأهداف تغطية الاختبار المحددة (على سبيل المثال 90% لمُبلّغ، 80% للخادم)"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"8720692d8833859f021dab15bf61b0edf5a801cb5131e17e107a354e34ed8d90","qualityScore":21}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sf-bcca/Kith/kith-ux-polisher', 'community', 'sf-bcca', 'Kith', 'sf-bcca/Kith', 'kith-ux-polisher', 0, 0, 21, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.093Z', '2026-03-02T03:32:18.861Z', '4936dd91d11dc69c2995d6b623aa11d07722c8fbcb32c8d568f7ac793f9c17d0', '{"id":"sf-bcca/Kith/kith-ux-polisher","name":"kith-ux-polisher","description":{"zh":"Kith-ux-polisher是一个现代、用户友好的家族树应用，使用React和Python构建。它提供了直观的界面和强大的功能","ja":"Kith-ux-polisherは、AIエージェントを使用した家族樹アプリです。Node.jsとCLIをサポートし、開発者向けのツールとして最適化","ko":"Kith-ux-polisher는 최신의 가족 나무 애플리케이션으로 Python 및 React를 사용하여 개발되었습니다. 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스와 강력한 기능을 제공","es":"Kith es una aplicación de árbol genealógico moderna y fácil de usar, diseñada para ayudar a las familias a organizar su historia","fr":"Kith est une application d''arbre généalogique moderne et conviviale, conçue pour aider les familles à organiser leur histoire","de":"Kith ist eine moderne und benutzerfreundliche Genealogie-Anwendung, die dazu dient, Familien bei der Organisation ihrer Geschichte zu unterstützen","pt":"Kith é uma aplicação de árvore genealógica moderna e amigável. Melhore a experiência do usuário com Kith-UX-Polisher","ru":"Kith - современное и удобное приложение для создания дерева рода. Улучшите пользовательский опыт с помощью Kith-UX-Polisher","ar":"Kith هو تطبيق شجرة عائلة حديث وسهل الاستخدام. تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع Kith-UX-Polisher","en":"Kith is a modern, user friendly, family tree application."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Kith-ux-polisher：人工智能家族树应用","ja":"Kith-ux-polisher：AIエージェントによる家族樹アプリ","ko":"Kith-ux-polisher：AI 에이전트를 사용한 가족 나무 애플리케이션","es":"Herramienta de árbol genealógico Kith-ux-polisher","fr":"Outil d''arbre généalogique Kith-ux-polisher","de":"Kith-ux-polisher Genealogie-Tool","pt":"Kith-UX-Polisher: Ferramenta de Árvore Genealógica com IA","ru":"Kith-UX-Polisher: ИИ Агент для Создания Дерева Рода","ar":"Kith-UX-Polisher: أداة عائلة شجرة مع ضبط واجهة المستخدم","en":"kith-ux-polisher"},"description":{"zh":"Kith-ux-polisher是一个现代、用户友好的家族树应用，使用React和Python构建。它提供了直观的界面和强大的功能","ja":"Kith-ux-polisherは、AIエージェントを使用した家族樹アプリです。Node.jsとCLIをサポートし、開発者向けのツールとして最適化","ko":"Kith-ux-polisher는 최신의 가족 나무 애플리케이션으로 Python 및 React를 사용하여 개발되었습니다. 사용자 친화적인 인터페이스와 강력한 기능을 제공","es":"Kith es una aplicación de árbol genealógico moderna y fácil de usar, diseñada para ayudar a las familias a organizar su historia","fr":"Kith est une application d''arbre généalogique moderne et conviviale, conçue pour aider les familles à organiser leur histoire","de":"Kith ist eine moderne und benutzerfreundliche Genealogie-Anwendung, die dazu dient, Familien bei der Organisation ihrer Geschichte zu unterstützen","pt":"Kith é uma aplicação de árvore genealógica moderna e amigável. Melhore a experiência do usuário com Kith-UX-Polisher","ru":"Kith - современное и удобное приложение для создания дерева рода. Улучшите пользовательский опыт с помощью Kith-UX-Polisher","ar":"Kith هو تطبيق شجرة عائلة حديث وسهل الاستخدام. تحسين تجربة المستخدم مع Kith-UX-Polisher","en":"Kith is a modern, user friendly, family tree application."},"definition":{"en":"Kith is a modern, user friendly, family tree application."},"features":{"zh":["现代化的用户界面","强大的家族树构建功能","使用React和Python构建","支持Node.js和CLI","开发者向けのツール"],"ja":["AIエージェントを使用した家族樹构建","Node.jsとCLIをサポート","開発者向けのツールとして最適化","直观的界面","強大的家族樹アプリ"],"ko":["최신의 가족 나무 애플리케이션","Python 및 React를 사용하여 개발","사용자 친화적인 인터페이스","강력한 기능","開発者向けのツール"],"es":["Diseño moderno y fácil de usar","Tecnologías como React y Node.js","Integración con Agentes de IA","Organización de la historia familiar","Interfaz de usuario intuitiva"],"fr":["Conception moderne et conviviale","Technologies comme React et Node.js","Intégration avec des Agents de IA","Organisation de l''histoire familiale","Interface utilisateur intuitive"],"de":["Modernes und benutzerfreundliches Design","Technologien wie React und Node.js","Integration mit KI-Agents","Organisation der Familienhistorie","Intuitive Benutzeroberfläche"],"pt":["Desenvolvimento de árvore genealógica personalizada","Interface de usuário amigável e responsiva","Integração com IA para melhorar a experiência do usuário","Suporte a múltiplos dispositivos e plataformas","Código aberto e personalizável"],"ru":["Создание индивидуального дерева рода","Удобный и адаптивный интерфейс пользователя","Интеграция с ИИ для улучшения пользовательского опыта","Поддержка нескольких устройств и платформ","Открытый и настраиваемый код"],"ar":["بناء شجرة عائلة مخصصة","واجهة مستخدم سهلة الاستخدام ومتجاوبة","التكامل مع الذكاء الاصطناعي لتحسين تجربة المستخدم","دعم الأجهزة والمنصات المتعددة","الкод المفتوح والقابل للتخصيص"]},"keywords":{"zh":["如何使用Kith-ux-polisher","什么是家族树应用","Kith-ux-polisher安装","Kith-ux-polisher设置指南","Kith-ux-polisher替代品","Kith-ux-polisher vs 其他家族树应用"],"ja":["Kith-ux-polisherの使い方","AIエージェントとは","Kith-ux-polisherのインストール","Kith-ux-polisherの設定ガイド","Kith-ux-polisherの代替品","Kith-ux-polisher vs 他の家族樹アプリ"],"ko":["Kith-ux-polisher 사용 방법","AI 에이전트란","Kith-ux-polisher 설치","Kith-ux-polisher 설정 가이드","Kith-ux-polisher 대체품","Kith-ux-polisher vs 다른 가족 나무 애플리케이션"],"es":["cómo usar Kith-ux-polisher","qué es un árbol genealógico","Kith-ux-polisher alternativa","Kith-ux-polisher vs otras herramientas","instalación de Kith-ux-polisher","guía de configuración de Kith-ux-polisher","herramientas de árbol genealógico","Agentes de IA para la genealogía"],"fr":["comment utiliser Kith-ux-polisher","qu''est-ce qu''un arbre généalogique","Kith-ux-polisher alternative","Kith-ux-polisher vs d''autres outils","installation de Kith-ux-polisher","guide de configuration de Kith-ux-polisher","outils d''arbre généalogique","Agents de IA pour la généalogie"],"de":["wie man Kith-ux-polisher verwendet","was ist ein Genealogie-Tool","Kith-ux-polisher Alternative","Kith-ux-polisher vs andere Tools","Installation von Kith-ux-polisher","Setup-Anleitung für Kith-ux-polisher","Genealogie-Tools","KI-Agents für die Genealogie"],"pt":["como usar Kith-UX-Polisher","o que é Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher alternativa","Kith-UX-Polisher vs outras ferramentas","instalar Kith-UX-Polisher","guia de configuração do Kith-UX-Polisher","desenvolvimento de árvore genealógica","ferramentas de IA para árvore genealógica"],"ru":["как использовать Kith-UX-Polisher","что такое Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher альтернатива","Kith-UX-Polisher vs другие инструменты","установить Kith-UX-Polisher","руководство по настройке Kith-UX-Polisher","создание дерева рода","инструменты ИИ для дерева рода"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام Kith-UX-Polisher","ما هو Kith-UX-Polisher","بديل Kith-UX-Polisher","Kith-UX-Polisher مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت Kith-UX-Polisher","دليل إعداد Kith-UX-Polisher","بناء شجرة العائلة","أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لشجرة العائلة"]}},"owner":"sf-bcca","repo":"Kith","repoPath":"sf-bcca/Kith","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.093Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"kith-ux-polisher","description":"Enforces the Kith design system (Tailwind+Material), accessibility standards, and responsive behaviors. Use when creating new UI components, styling visualization charts (SVG/Canvas), or auditing UX consistency.","bodyPreview":"# Kith UX Polisher\n\nThis skill acts as the guardian of Kith''s visual identity and user experience.\n\n## Design System\n\n### 1. Core Aesthetics\n- **Rounded Corners**: Use `rounded-3xl` for main containers/modals, `rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for inputs/buttons.\n- **Shadows**: Use soft, colored shadows for depth (e.g., `shadow-lg shadow-primary/20`).\n- **Glassmorphism**: Use `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/80`) for overlays and sticky headers.\n\n### 2. Interact","body":"# Kith UX Polisher\n\nThis skill acts as the guardian of Kith''s visual identity and user experience.\n\n## Design System\n\n### 1. Core Aesthetics\n- **Rounded Corners**: Use `rounded-3xl` for main containers/modals, `rounded-2xl` for cards, `rounded-xl` for inputs/buttons.\n- **Shadows**: Use soft, colored shadows for depth (e.g., `shadow-lg shadow-primary/20`).\n- **Glassmorphism**: Use `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds (`bg-white/80`) for overlays and sticky headers.\n\n### 2. Interaction Patterns\n- **Modals**: Must have `animate-in fade-in zoom-in` entrance animations and close on backdrop click.\n- **Buttons**:\n    - Primary: `bg-primary text-white shadow-lg hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98]`\n    - Secondary: `bg-slate-100 text-slate-600 hover:bg-slate-200`\n- **Feedback**: All interactive elements must provide visual feedback (hover, active, focus states).\n\n### 3. Data Visualization (Trees & Charts)\n- **Consistency**: Use consistent node sizes (`w-40`, `h-16`) and stroke widths (`stroke-2`) across different tree views.\n- **Lines**: Use orthogonal (right-angle) connectors with rounded corners for hierarchy.\n- **Controls**: All charts must support Pan & Zoom interactions via consistent controls (top-right overlay).\n\n## Accessibility & Responsiveness\n\n### 1. Accessibility (a11y)\n- **Contrast**: Ensure text passes WCAG AA. Use `text-slate-500` for secondary text, never lighter unless on dark backgrounds.\n- **Labels**: All icon-only buttons MUST have an `aria-label` or `title`.\n- **Keyboard**: Ensure all interactive elements are focusable and have visible focus rings (`focus:ring-2`).\n\n### 2. Responsive Strategy\n- **Mobile First**: Design for touch targets (min 44px) on small screens.\n- **Overflow**: Complex charts should overflow with scroll (`overflow-auto`) on mobile rather than shrinking to illegibility.\n- **Navigation**: Use the bottom navigation bar (`BottomNav.tsx`) pattern for mobile views."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:32:18.861Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced UI/UX design system integration with Kith''s visual identity.","zh":"非常适合需要与Kith视觉身份集成高级UI/UX设计系统的前端代理。","ja":"Kithの視覚的なアイデンティティと統合された高度なUI/UXデザインシステムを必要とするフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Kith의 시각적 정체성과 통합된 고급 UI/UX 디자인 시스템이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes frontend que necesitan una integración avanzada del sistema de diseño de UI/UX con la identidad visual de Kith.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents frontend nécessitant une intégration avancée du système de conception d''UI/UX à l''identité visuelle de Kith.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die eine erweiterte Integration des UI/UX-Designsystems mit der visuellen Identität von Kith benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de integração avançada do sistema de design UI/UX com a identidade visual da Kith.","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым необходима продвинутая интеграция системы дизайна UI/UX с визуальной идентичностью Kith.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى دمج متقدم لنظام التصميم UI/UX مع الهوية البصرية لشركة Kith."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce a consistent design language using rounded corners, soft shadows, and glassmorphism, streamlining user experience with `backdrop-blur-md` and semi-transparent backgrounds like `bg-white/80`.","zh":"赋予代理人使用圆角、软阴影和玻璃化等一致的设计语言，通过`backdrop-blur-md`和半透明背景如`bg-white/80`简化用户体验。","ja":"エージェントに丸みを帯びた角、ソフトな影、ガラス化などの一貫したデザイン言語を使用して、`backdrop-blur-md`や`bg-white/80`などの半透明背景でユーザーエクスペリエンスを簡素化する力を与えます。","ko":"에이전트에게 일관된 디자인 언어를 사용하여丸무늬 모서리, 軟한 그림자, 유리화 등으로 `backdrop-blur-md`와 반투명 배경인 `bg-white/80`로 사용자 경험을 간소화하는力を 부여합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar un lenguaje de diseño coherente utilizando esquinas redondeadas, sombras suaves y glassmorphism, simplificando la experiencia del usuario con `backdrop-blur-md` y fondos semitransparentes como `bg-white/80`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer un langage de conception cohérent en utilisant des coins arrondis, des ombres douces et du glassmorphism, simplifiant l''expérience utilisateur avec `backdrop-blur-md` et des arrières-plans semi-transparents comme `bg-white/80`.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agenten, eine konsistente Designsprache mithilfe abgerundeter Ecken, weicher Schatten und Glassmorphismus anzuwenden, wodurch die Benutzeroberfläche mit `backdrop-blur-md` und halbtransparenten Hintergründen wie `bg-white/80` gestreamlined wird.","pt":"Permite que os agentes imponham uma linguagem de design consistente usando cantos arredondados, sombras suaves e glassmorphism, simplificando a experiência do usuário com `backdrop-blur-md` e fundos semi-transparentes como `bg-white/80`.","ru":"Позволяет агентам обеспечить согласованность языка дизайна, используя закругленные углы, мягкие тени и эффект стекла, упрощая опыт пользователя с помощью `backdrop-blur-md` и полупрозрачных фонов, таких как `bg-white/80`.","ar":"تمكن الوكلاء من فرض لغة تصميم متسقة باستخدام زوايا مدورة وأضواء ناعمة وتصميم زجاجي، وبذلك يبسطون تجربة المستخدم مع `backdrop-blur-md` وخلفيات شبه شفافة مثل `bg-white/80`."},"useCases":{"en":["Standardizing UI components with `rounded-3xl` and `rounded-2xl` classes","Enhancing modal and card designs with `shadow-lg` and `shadow-primary/20`","Implementing overlays with `backdrop-blur-md` for improved visual depth"],"zh":["使用`rounded-3xl`和`rounded-2xl`类标准化UI组件","使用`shadow-lg`和`shadow-primary/20`增强模态和卡片设计","使用`backdrop-blur-md`实现覆盖层以提高视觉深度"],"ja":["`rounded-3xl`と`rounded-2xl`クラスを使用してUIコンポーネントを標準化する","`shadow-lg`と`shadow-primary/20`を使用してモーダルとカードのデザインを強化する","`backdrop-blur-md`を使用してオーバーレイを実装して視覚的な深度を高める"],"ko":["`rounded-3xl`와 `rounded-2xl` 클래스를 사용하여 UI 컴포넌트를 표준화하는 것","`shadow-lg`와 `shadow-primary/20`를 사용하여 모달과 카드 디자인을 강화하는 것","`backdrop-blur-md`를 사용하여 오버레이를 구현하여 시각적 깊이를 높이는 것"],"es":["Establecer estándares para los componentes de UI con clases `rounded-3xl` y `rounded-2xl`","Mejorar los diseños de modales y tarjetas con `shadow-lg` y `shadow-primary/20`","Implementar superposiciones con `backdrop-blur-md` para una mayor profundidad visual"],"fr":["Standardiser les composants d''UI avec des classes `rounded-3xl` et `rounded-2xl`","Améliorer les conceptions de modales et de cartes avec `shadow-lg` et `shadow-primary/20`","Mettre en œuvre des superpositions avec `backdrop-blur-md` pour une plus grande profondeur visuelle"],"de":["Standardisieren von UI-Komponenten mit den Klassen `rounded-3xl` und `rounded-2xl`","Verbessern der Modal- und Karten-Designs mit `shadow-lg` und `shadow-primary/20`","Implementieren von Überlagerungen mit `backdrop-blur-md` für eine verbesserte visuelle Tiefe"],"pt":["Padronizar componentes da interface do usuário com classes `rounded-3xl` e `rounded-2xl`","Melhorar designs de modal e cartão com `shadow-lg` e `shadow-primary/20`","Implementar sobreposições com `backdrop-blur-md` para melhorar a profundidade visual"],"ru":["Стандартизировать компоненты пользовательского интерфейса с помощью классов `rounded-3xl` и `rounded-2xl`","Улучшить дизайн модальных окон и карточек с помощью `shadow-lg` и `shadow-primary/20`","Реализовать наложения с помощью `backdrop-blur-md` для улучшения визуальной глубины"],"ar":["توحيد مكونات واجهة المستخدم باستخدام فئات `rounded-3xl` و `rounded-2xl`","تحسين تصاميم النماذج والبطاقات باستخدام `shadow-lg` و `shadow-primary/20`","تنفيذ التأثيرات العلوية باستخدام `backdrop-blur-md` لتحسين العمق البصري"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Kith application integration","Limited to specific design system components like containers, modals, and cards"],"zh":["需要Kith应用程序集成","仅限于特定的设计系统组件，如容器、模态和卡片"],"ja":["Kithアプリケーションの統合が必要","コンテナ、モーダル、カードなどの特定のデザインシステムコンポーネントに限定される"],"ko":["Kith 애플리케이션 통합이 필요","컨테이너, 모달, 카드 등과 같은 특정 디자인 시스템 컴포넌트에만 제한"],"es":["Requiere integración con la aplicación Kith","Limitado a componentes específicos del sistema de diseño como contenedores, modales y tarjetas"],"fr":["Nécessite une intégration avec l''application Kith","Limité à des composants spécifiques du système de conception tels que des conteneurs, des modales et des cartes"],"de":["Benötigt eine Integration mit der Kith-Anwendung","Begrenzt auf bestimmte Designsystemkomponenten wie Container, Modale und Karten"],"pt":["Exige integração com aplicativo da Kith","Limitado a componentes específicos do sistema de design, como contêineres, modais e cartões"],"ru":["Требует интеграции с приложением Kith","Ограничен конкретными компонентами системы дизайна, такими как контейнеры, модальные окна и карточки"],"ar":["يتطلب تكاملًا مع تطبيق Kith","محدود بمكونات محددة من نظام التصميم، مثل الحاويات والنماذج والبطاقات"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"4936dd91d11dc69c2995d6b623aa11d07722c8fbcb32c8d568f7ac793f9c17d0","qualityScore":21}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('sphildreth/decentdb/nim', 'community', 'sphildreth', 'decentdb', 'sphildreth/decentdb', 'nim', 0, 0, 21, '2026-03-02T01:56:11.105Z', '2026-03-02T03:35:17.547Z', 'bbbb3a7cdc46fffe321239ab8a8882561ae6670a6fd9e03be7530164041fbb16', '{"id":"sphildreth/decentdb/nim","name":"nim","description":{"zh":"Nim AI智能代理以ACID为首要任务，其他功能也在不断开发中","ja":"Nim AIエージェントはACIDを第一にし，その他の機能も順次開発中","ko":"Nim AI 에이전트는 ACID를 우선하고 다른 기능도 점진적으로 개발 중","es":"Nim es una herramienta de AI que prioriza ACID, permitiendo a los desarrolladores crear soluciones escalables","fr":"Nim est un outil d''IA qui donne la priorité à ACID, permettant aux développeurs de créer des solutions évolutives","de":"Nim ist ein KI-Tool, das ACID priorisiert, damit Entwickler skalierbare Lösungen erstellen können","pt":"O Nim é uma ferramenta de IA que prioriza a consistência ACID, garantindo a integridade dos dados em seus projetos","ru":"Nim - это ИИ Агент, который отдаёт приоритет согласованности ACID, обеспечивая целостность данных в ваших проектах","ar":"نم هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تركز على الاتساق ACID، مما يضمن سلامة البيانات في مشاريعك","en":"ACID first. Everything else… eventually."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"Nim AI智能代理：ACID优先","ja":"Nim AIエージェント：ACIDを優先","ko":"Nim AI 에이전트: ACID 우선","es":"Herramientas de AI: Nim prioriza ACID","fr":"Outils d''IA : Nim donne la priorité à ACID","de":"KI-Tools: Nim priorisiert ACID","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: O que é Nim?","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Nim - основа ACID","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: نم - أولاً وقبل كل شيء","en":"nim"},"description":{"zh":"Nim AI智能代理以ACID为首要任务，其他功能也在不断开发中","ja":"Nim AIエージェントはACIDを第一にし，その他の機能も順次開発中","ko":"Nim AI 에이전트는 ACID를 우선하고 다른 기능도 점진적으로 개발 중","es":"Nim es una herramienta de AI que prioriza ACID, permitiendo a los desarrolladores crear soluciones escalables","fr":"Nim est un outil d''IA qui donne la priorité à ACID, permettant aux développeurs de créer des solutions évolutives","de":"Nim ist ein KI-Tool, das ACID priorisiert, damit Entwickler skalierbare Lösungen erstellen können","pt":"O Nim é uma ferramenta de IA que prioriza a consistência ACID, garantindo a integridade dos dados em seus projetos","ru":"Nim - это ИИ Агент, который отдаёт приоритет согласованности ACID, обеспечивая целостность данных в ваших проектах","ar":"نم هو أداة ذكاء اصطناعي تركز على الاتساق ACID، مما يضمن سلامة البيانات في مشاريعك","en":"ACID first. Everything else… eventually."},"definition":{"en":"ACID first. Everything else… eventually."},"features":{"zh":["ACID优先的开发","高性能的AI处理","多功能的开发工具","简单易用的CLI接口","支持多种编程语言"],"ja":["ACIDを優先した開発","高性能のAI処理","多機能の開発ツール","シンプルで使いやすいCLIインターフェース","多くのプログラミング言語をサポート"],"ko":["ACID 우선의 개발","고성능의 AI 처리","다기능의 개발 도구","간단하고 쉬운 CLI 인터페이스","多くの 프로그래밍 언어를 지원"],"es":["Priorización de ACID","Escalabilidad","Consistencia de datos","Flexibilidad para desarrolladores","Integración con herramientas de desarrollo"],"fr":["Priorité à ACID","Évolutivité","Cohérence des données","Flexibilité pour les développeurs","Intégration avec les outils de développement"],"de":["Priorisierung von ACID","Skalierbarkeit","Datenkonsistenz","Flexibilität für Entwickler","Integration mit Entwicklungstools"],"pt":["Priorização da consistência ACID","Garantia da integridade dos dados","Desenvolvimento de projetos confiáveis","Integração com tecnologias de IA","Suporte a desenvolvedores"],"ru":["Приоритет согласованности ACID","Обеспечение целостности данных","Разработка надёжных проектов","Интеграция с технологиями ИИ","Поддержка разработчиков"],"ar":["أولوية الاتساق ACID","ضمان سلامة البيانات","تطوير مشاريع موثوقة","التكامل مع تكنولوجيا الذكاء الاصطناعي","دعم المطورين"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Nim AI智能代理","ACID优先的开发工具","AI工具安装","Nim AI智能代理教程","如何使用Nim AI智能代理","Nim AI智能代理与其他AI工具的比较"],"ja":["Nim AIエージェント","ACIDを優先する開発ツール","AIエージェントのインストール","Nim AIエージェントのチュートリアル","Nim AIエージェントの使い方","Nim AIエージェントと他のAIエージェントの比較"],"ko":["Nim AI 에이전트","ACID 우선의 개발 도구","AI 에이전트 설치","Nim AI 에이전트 튜토리얼","Nim AI 에이전트 사용법","Nim AI 에이전트와 다른 AI 에이전트의 비교"],"es":["herramientas de AI","Nim","ACID","desarrollo de software","escalabilidad","consistencia de datos","cómo usar Nim","alternativas a Nim"],"fr":["outils d''IA","Nim","ACID","développement de logiciels","évolutivité","cohérence des données","comment utiliser Nim","alternatives à Nim"],"de":["KI-Tools","Nim","ACID","Softwareentwicklung","Skalierbarkeit","Datenkonsistenz","wie man Nim verwendet","Alternativen zu Nim"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","o que é nim","como usar nim","nim vs outros agentes","guia de instalação do nim","desenvolvimento de projetos com nim","ia e acide","nim e desenvolvedores"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","что такое nim","как использовать nim","nim vs другие агенты","руководство по установке nim","разработка проектов с nim","ИИ и acid","nim и разработчики"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","ما هو نم","كيفية استخدام نم","نم مقابل أدوات أخرى","دليل تثبيت نم","تطوير مشاريع مع نم","الذكاء الاصطناعي والاتساق","نم والمطورون"]}},"owner":"sphildreth","repo":"decentdb","repoPath":"sphildreth/decentdb","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.105Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"nim","description":"Guidance for making safe, minimal-diff Nim changes in DecentDB with tests and durability/isolation rules.","bodyPreview":"# Skill: Nim Specialist (DecentDB)\n\nYou are an expert Nim coding agent working in the DecentDB repository.\n\n## Mission\n\nImplement the user’s requested change in Nim with minimal diffs, preserving ACID durability and Snapshot Isolation semantics.\n\n## Hard constraints (must follow)\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md` first; follow its workflow and Definition of Done.\n- If the change could affect:\n  - persistent formats (db header/page layout/WAL frame format/postings format)\n  - checkpoint/truncation rules\n  - lo","body":"# Skill: Nim Specialist (DecentDB)\n\nYou are an expert Nim coding agent working in the DecentDB repository.\n\n## Mission\n\nImplement the user’s requested change in Nim with minimal diffs, preserving ACID durability and Snapshot Isolation semantics.\n\n## Hard constraints (must follow)\n\n- Read `AGENTS.md` first; follow its workflow and Definition of Done.\n- If the change could affect:\n  - persistent formats (db header/page layout/WAL frame format/postings format)\n  - checkpoint/truncation rules\n  - locking/concurrency semantics\n  - isolation guarantees\n  - SQL grammar/dialect behavior\n  then **STOP** and propose an ADR in `design/adr/` before implementing.\n- Do not add dependencies unless explicitly requested/approved.\n- No drive-by refactors. Keep diffs small and targeted.\n\n## Method (Nim-specific)\n\n1. **Orient**\n   - Find the existing entrypoints and patterns in `src/` and `tests/`.\n   - Prefer extending existing modules over introducing new utility modules.\n\n2. **Implement explicitly**\n   - Prefer straightforward procedures and data structures over macro-heavy solutions.\n   - Keep error handling consistent with repo strategy (see `design/adr/0010-error-handling-strategy.md`).\n\n3. **Performance discipline**\n   - Avoid accidental allocations in hot paths.\n     - Avoid repeated string concatenation in loops.\n     - Reuse buffers/sequences where appropriate.\n   - Avoid logging overhead unless gated and zero-cost when disabled.\n\n4. **Testing (required)**\n   - Add/adjust unit tests for main behavior + edge cases.\n   - If a change impacts durability/correctness invariants, add relevant crash/differential/property tests per `design/TESTING_STRATEGY.md`.\n\n5. **Validate**\n   - Run the narrowest relevant compile/test commands first.\n   - Do not ignore failing tests; fix failures caused by your change.\n\n## FFI / C ABI rules (only when applicable)\n\n- Use `{.exportc, cdecl, dynlib.}` for exported functions.\n- Prefer inputs as `(cstring, length)` for text/blob payloads.\n- Never return unstable pointers without clear lifetime rules; define ownership and invalidation points.\n- Assume statement handles are not safe for concurrent use across threads.\n\n## Deliverables\n\n- Code changes in Nim\n- Tests covering the new behavior\n- A brief report:\n  - files/symbols changed\n  - commands run\n  - any remaining risks or follow-ups\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:35:17.547Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Generation Agents specializing in systems programming with Nim, requiring expertise in ACID durability and Snapshot Isolation semantics.","zh":"适用于专门从事Nim系统编程的代码生成代理，需要在ACID耐用性和快照隔离语义方面具有专业知识。","ja":"Nimを用いたシステムプログラミングを専門とするコード生成エージェントに適しています。ACID耐久性とスナップショット分離セマンティクスに精通している必要があります。","ko":"Nim을 사용한 시스템 프로그래밍을 전문으로 하는 코드 생성 에이전트에 적합합니다. ACID 내구성 및 스냅샷 분리 의미론에 대한 전문 지식이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de generación de código que se especializan en programación de sistemas con Nim, que requieren experiencia en durabilidad ACID y semántica de aislamiento de instantáneas.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents de génération de code spécialisés dans la programmation système avec Nim, nécessitant une expertise dans la durabilité ACID et la sémantique d''isolement d''instantané.","de":"Ideal für Code-Generierungsagenten, die sich auf Systemprogrammierung mit Nim spezialisieren und Erfahrung in ACID-Haltbarkeit und Snapshot-Isolationssemantik erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Geração de Código especializados em programação de sistemas com Nim, que exigem conhecimento em durabilidade ACID e semântica de Isolamento de Instantâneo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов генерации кода, специализирующихся на системном программировании с помощью Nim, требующих знаний в области долговечности ACID и семантики изоляции снимка.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء مولدون للرمز المتخصصون في برمجة الأنظمة باستخدام Nim ، والذين يتطلبون الخبرة في متانة ACID و семантика عزل اللقطة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to implement user-requested changes in Nim with minimal diffs, preserving ACID durability and Snapshot Isolation semantics, while working within the DecentDB repository and adhering to AGENTS.md workflow and Definition of Done, utilizing persistent formats like db header/page layout/WAL frame format/postings format.","zh":"赋予代理在Nim中实施用户请求的更改的能力，尽量减少diff，同时保持ACID耐用性和快照隔离语义，在DecentDB存储库中工作并遵循AGENTS.md工作流和完成定义，使用诸如db头/页布局/WAL帧格式/帖子格式等持久格式。","ja":"エージェントに、Nimでユーザー要求の変更を実装する能力を与え、diffを最小限に抑えながら、ACID耐久性とスナップショット分離セマンティクスを保持します。DecentDBリポジトリ内で作業し、AGENTS.mdワークフローと完了の定義に従い、dbヘッダ/ページレイアウト/WALフレーム形式/投稿形式などの持続的な形式を使用します。","ko":"에이전트가 Nim에서 사용자 요청의 변경 사항을 구현할 수 있는 능력을 부여하여 diff를 최소화하면서 ACID 내구성 및 스냅샷 분리 의미론을 유지합니다. DecentDB 저장소에서 작업하며 AGENTS.md 워크플로 및 완료 정의를 따라 규칙을 최적화하고 db 헤더/페이지 레이아웃/WAL 프레임 형식/게시물 형식과 같은 지속 가능한 형식을 사용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes implementar cambios solicitados por el usuario en Nim con difuminaciones mínimas, preservando la durabilidad ACID y la semántica de aislamiento de instantáneas, mientras trabajan dentro del repositorio DecentDB y se adhieren al flujo de trabajo AGENTS.md y la definición de Done, utilizando formatos persistentes como formato de encabezado de base de datos/página/diseño de cuadro WAL/formato de publicaciones.","fr":"Permet aux agents de mettre en œuvre les modifications demandées par l''utilisateur dans Nim avec des diffusions minimales, en préservant la durabilité ACID et la sémantique d''isolement d''instantané, tout en travaillant dans le référentiel DecentDB et en respectant le flux de travail AGENTS.md et la définition de Done, en utilisant des formats persistants tels que le format d''en-tête de base de données/disposition de page/cadre WAL/format de publications.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, Benutzeranforderungen in Nim mit minimalen Diffs umzusetzen, während die ACID-Haltbarkeit und die Snapshot-Isolationssemantik erhalten bleiben, und zwar innerhalb des DecentDB-Repositorys und unter Einhaltung des AGENTS.md-Workflows und der Definition von Done, unter Verwendung von persistenten Formaten wie Datenbank-Header-/Seiten-/WAL-Rahmen-/Veröffentlichungsformat.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a implementar alterações solicitadas pelo usuário em Nim com diferenças mínimas, preservando a durabilidade ACID e a semântica de Isolamento de Instantâneo, trabalhando dentro do repositório DecentDB e aderindo ao fluxo de trabalho AGENTS.md e Definição de Concluído, utilizando formatos persistentes como formato de cabeçalho de banco de dados / layout de página / formato de frame WAL / formato de postagens.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью реализовывать изменения, запрошенные пользователем в Nim, с минимальными изменениями, сохраняя долговечность ACID и семантику изоляции снимка, работая в рамках репозитория DecentDB и придерживаясь рабочего процесса AGENTS.md и определения готовности, используя постоянные форматы, такие как формат заголовка базы данных / макет страницы / формат кадра WAL / формат публикаций.","ar":"يمكن للوكلاء تنفيذ التغييرات المطلوبة من قبل المستخدم في Nim مع فرق tối thiểu ، مع الحفاظ على متانة ACID و семантика عزل اللقطة ، والعمل داخل مستودع DecentDB و اتباع سير العمل AGENTS.md و تعريف الإنجاز ، باستخدام تنسيقات مستمرة مثل تنسيق رأس قاعدة البيانات / تخطيط الصفحة / تنسيق إطار WAL / تنسيق المنشورات."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing changes in Nim while maintaining ACID compliance","Preserving Snapshot Isolation semantics in DecentDB","Optimizing database checkpoint/truncation rules for performance"],"zh":["在Nim中实施更改，同时保持ACID兼容性","在DecentDB中保留快照隔离语义","优化数据库检查点/截断规则以提高性能"],"ja":["Nimで変更を実装しながらACID準拠を維持する","DecentDBでスナップショット分離セマンティクスを保持する","データベースのチェックポイント/トランケーションルールを最適化してパフォーマンスを向上させる"],"ko":["Nim에서 변경 사항을 구현하면서 ACID 호환성을 유지하는 것","DecentDB에서 스냅샷 분리 의미론을 유지하는 것","데이터베이스 체크포인트/트렁케이션 규칙을 최적화하여 성능을 향상시키는 것"],"es":["Implementar cambios en Nim mientras se mantiene la conformidad con ACID","Preservar la semántica de aislamiento de instantáneas en DecentDB","Optimizar las reglas de punto de control/truncamiento de la base de datos para el rendimiento"],"fr":["Mettre en œuvre des modifications dans Nim tout en maintenant la conformité avec ACID","Préserver la sémantique d''isolement d''instantané dans DecentDB","Optimiser les règles de point de contrôle/troncature de la base de données pour les performances"],"de":["Änderungen in Nim umsetzen, während die ACID-Konformität aufrechterhalten wird","Die Snapshot-Isolationssemantik in DecentDB erhalten","Datenbank-Checkpoint-/Trunkierungsregeln für die Leistung optimieren"],"pt":["Implementar alterações em Nim enquanto mantém a conformidade ACID","Preservar a semântica de Isolamento de Instantâneo no DecentDB","Otimizar regras de ponto de verificação / truncamento do banco de dados para desempenho"],"ru":["Реализовывать изменения в Nim, сохраняя при этом соответствие ACID","Сохранять семантику изоляции снимка в DecentDB","Оптимизировать правила контрольной точки / обрезки базы данных для производительности"],"ar":["تنفيذ التغييرات في Nim مع الحفاظ على مطابقة ACID","الحفاظ على семантика عزل اللقطة في DecentDB","تحسين قواعد التحقق / القطع من قاعدة البيانات للأداء"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires adherence to AGENTS.md workflow and Definition of Done","Limited to Nim programming language","Must consider effects on persistent formats and checkpoint/truncation rules"],"zh":["需要遵循AGENTS.md工作流和完成定义","仅限于Nim编程语言","必须考虑对持久格式和检查点/截断规则的影响"],"ja":["AGENTS.mdワークフローと完了の定義に従う必要がある","Nimプログラミング言語のみに限定される","持続的な形式とチェックポイント/トランケーションルールへの影響を考慮する必要がある"],"ko":["AGENTS.md 워크플로 및 완료 정의를 따라야 함","Nim 프로그래밍 언어에만限定됨","지속 가능한 형식 및 체크포인트/트렁케이션 규칙에 대한 영향을 고려해야 함"],"es":["Requiere la adhesión al flujo de trabajo AGENTS.md y la definición de Done","Limitado al lenguaje de programación Nim","Debe considerar los efectos en los formatos persistentes y las reglas de punto de control/truncamiento"],"fr":["Nécessite l''adhésion au flux de travail AGENTS.md et à la définition de Done","Limité au langage de programmation Nim","Doit prendre en compte les effets sur les formats persistants et les règles de point de contrôle/troncature"],"de":["Erfordert die Einhaltung des AGENTS.md-Workflows und der Definition von Done","Begrenzt auf die Programmiersprache Nim","Muss die Auswirkungen auf persistente Formate und Checkpoint-/Trunkierungsregeln berücksichtigen"],"pt":["Exige adesão ao fluxo de trabalho AGENTS.md e Definição de Concluído","Limitado à linguagem de programação Nim","Deve considerar os efeitos nos formatos persistentes e regras de ponto de verificação / truncamento"],"ru":["Требует соблюдения рабочего процесса AGENTS.md и определения готовности","Ограничен языком программирования Nim","Должен учитывать влияние на постоянные форматы и правила контрольной точки / обрезки"],"ar":["يتطلب اتباع سير العمل AGENTS.md و تعريف الإنجاز","محدود بلغة برمجة Nim","يجب مراعاة الآثار على التنسيقات المستمرة و قواعد التحقق / القطع"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"bbbb3a7cdc46fffe321239ab8a8882561ae6670a6fd9e03be7530164041fbb16","qualityScore":21}');
