"Optimisation pour Inertia.js et Laravel","Précognition de Laravel intégrée","Développement d''interfaces utilisateur personnalisées","Amélioration de l''accessibilité et des performances"],"de":["Zugängliche und anpassbare React-Aria-Komponenten","Optimierung für Inertia.js und Laravel","Laravel-Precognition integriert","Entwicklung von benutzerdefinierten Benutzeroberflächen","Verbesserung der Zugänglichkeit und Leistung"],"pt":["Componentes React Aria acessíveis","Otimização para Inertia.js","Integração com Laravel","Desenvolvimento com TailwindCSS","Criação de componentes UI personalizados","Melhoria da acessibilidade"],"ru":["Доступные компоненты React Aria","Оптимизация для Inertia.js","Интеграция с Laravel","Разработка с TailwindCSS","Создание пользовательских компонентов UI","Улучшение доступности"],"ar":["مكونات React Aria القابلة للوصول","تحسين الأداء ل Inertia.js","التكامل مع Laravel","التطوير مع TailwindCSS","إنشاء مكونات واجهة المستخدم المخصصة","تحسين إمكانية الوصول"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Tailwind CSS开发工具","React Aria组件开发","Inertia.js开发","Laravel Precognition功能","AI智能开发工具","如何使用Tailwind CSS","Tailwind CSS开发教程","React Aria组件开发最佳实践"],"ja":["Tailwind CSS開発ツール","React Ariaコンポーネント開発","Inertia.js開発","Laravel Precognition機能","AIエージェント開発ツール","Tailwind CSSの使い方","Tailwind CSS開発チュートリアル","React Ariaコンポーネント開発ベストプラクティス"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 개발 도구","React Aria 컴포넌트 개발","Inertia.js 개발","Laravel Precognition 기능","AI 에이전트 개발 도구","Tailwind CSS 사용법","Tailwind CSS 개발 튜토리얼","React Aria 컴포넌트 개발 최고의 실践"],"es":["cómo usar Tailwind CSS","qué es React Aria","alternativas a Tailwind CSS","Tailwind CSS vs Bootstrap","instalación de Tailwind CSS","guía de configuración de Tailwind CSS"],"fr":["comment utiliser Tailwind CSS","quoi est React Aria","alternatives à Tailwind CSS","Tailwind CSS vs Bootstrap","installation de Tailwind CSS","guide de configuration de Tailwind CSS"],"de":["wie man Tailwind CSS verwendet","was ist React Aria","Alternativen zu Tailwind CSS","Tailwind CSS vs Bootstrap","Installation von Tailwind CSS","Konfigurationsanleitung für Tailwind CSS"],"pt":["como usar TailwindCSS","o que é React Aria","TailwindCSS vs Bootstrap","instalar TailwindCSS","guia de configuração do Inertia.js","desenvolvimento web com Laravel","acessibilidade em componentes UI","otimização de desempenho com Inertia.js"],"ru":["как использовать TailwindCSS","что такое React Aria","TailwindCSS vs Bootstrap","установить TailwindCSS","руководство по настройке Inertia.js","веб-разработка с Laravel","доступность в компонентах UI","оптимизация производительности с Inertia.js"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام TailwindCSS","ما هي React Aria","TailwindCSS مقابل Bootstrap","تثبيت TailwindCSS","دليل إعداد Inertia.js","تطوير الويب مع Laravel","إمكانية الوصول في مكونات واجهة المستخدم","تحسين الأداء مع Inertia.js"]}},"owner":"dspangenberg","repo":"twc-ui","repoPath":"dspangenberg/twc-ui","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.970Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"tailwindcss-development","description":">-","bodyPreview":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns","body":"# Tailwind CSS Development\n\n## When to Apply\n\nActivate this skill when:\n\n- Adding styles to components or pages\n- Working with responsive design\n- Implementing dark mode\n- Extracting repeated patterns into components\n- Debugging spacing or layout issues\n\n## Documentation\n\nUse `search-docs` for detailed Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and documentation.\n\n## Basic Usage\n\n- Use Tailwind CSS classes to style HTML. Check and follow existing Tailwind conventions in the project before introducing new patterns.\n- Offer to extract repeated patterns into components that match the project''s conventions (e.g., Blade, JSX, Vue).\n- Consider class placement, order, priority, and defaults. Remove redundant classes, add classes to parent or child elements carefully to reduce repetition, and group elements logically.\n\n## Tailwind CSS v4 Specifics\n\n- Always use Tailwind CSS v4 and avoid deprecated utilities.\n- `corePlugins` is not supported in Tailwind v4.\n\n### CSS-First Configuration\n\nIn Tailwind v4, configuration is CSS-first using the `@theme` directive — no separate `tailwind.config.js` file is needed:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"CSS-First Config\" lang=\"css\">\n@theme {\n  --color-brand: oklch(0.72 0.11 178);\n}\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Import Syntax\n\nIn Tailwind v4, import Tailwind with a regular CSS `@import` statement instead of the `@tailwind` directives used in v3:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"v4 Import Syntax\" lang=\"diff\">\n- @tailwind base;\n- @tailwind components;\n- @tailwind utilities;\n+ @import \"tailwindcss\";\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Replaced Utilities\n\nTailwind v4 removed deprecated utilities. Use the replacements shown below. Opacity values remain numeric.\n\n| Deprecated | Replacement |\n|------------|-------------|\n| bg-opacity-* | bg-black/* |\n| text-opacity-* | text-black/* |\n| border-opacity-* | border-black/* |\n| divide-opacity-* | divide-black/* |\n| ring-opacity-* | ring-black/* |\n| placeholder-opacity-* | placeholder-black/* |\n| flex-shrink-* | shrink-* |\n| flex-grow-* | grow-* |\n| overflow-ellipsis | text-ellipsis |\n| decoration-slice | box-decoration-slice |\n| decoration-clone | box-decoration-clone |\n\n## Spacing\n\nUse `gap` utilities instead of margins for spacing between siblings:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Gap Utilities\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex gap-8\">\n    <div>Item 1</div>\n    <div>Item 2</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Dark Mode\n\nIf existing pages and components support dark mode, new pages and components must support it the same way, typically using the `dark:` variant:\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Dark Mode\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 text-gray-900 dark:text-white\">\n    Content adapts to color scheme\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Patterns\n\n### Flexbox Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Flexbox Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between gap-4\">\n    <div>Left content</div>\n    <div>Right content</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n### Grid Layout\n\n<code-snippet name=\"Grid Layout\" lang=\"html\">\n<div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-6\">\n    <div>Card 1</div>\n    <div>Card 2</div>\n    <div>Card 3</div>\n</div>\n</code-snippet>\n\n## Common Pitfalls\n\n- Using deprecated v3 utilities (bg-opacity-*, flex-shrink-*, etc.)\n- Using `@tailwind` directives instead of `@import \"tailwindcss\"`\n- Trying to use `tailwind.config.js` instead of CSS `@theme` directive\n- Using margins for spacing between siblings instead of gap utilities\n- Forgetting to add dark mode variants when the project uses dark mode"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:53:21.720Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing efficient CSS styling with Tailwind CSS v4 patterns and Inertia.js integration.","zh":"非常适合需要使用Tailwind CSS v4模式和Inertia.js集成来实现高效CSS样式的前端代理。","ja":"Tailwind CSS v4パターンとInertia.jsの統合を使用して効率的なCSSスタイリングが必要なフロントエンドエージェントに最適です。","ko":"Tailwind CSS v4 패턴과 Inertia.js 통합을 사용하여 효율적인 CSS 스타일링이 필요한 프론트엔드 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan un estilo de CSS eficiente con patrones de Tailwind CSS v4 e integración con Inertia.js.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend qui ont besoin d''un style CSS efficace avec des modèles Tailwind CSS v4 et une intégration Inertia.js.","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die ein effizientes CSS-Styling mit Tailwind CSS v4-Mustern und Inertia.js-Integration benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que necessitam de estilização de CSS eficiente com padrões do Tailwind CSS v4 e integração com Inertia.js.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов Frontend, которым необходима эффективная стилизация CSS с использованием шаблонов Tailwind CSS v4 и интеграции с Inertia.js.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء الواجهة الأمامية الذين يحتاجون إلى تنسيق CSS فعال باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS v4 وتكامل Inertia.js."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create DRY-er, more accessible React Aria components with optimized styling for responsive design, dark mode, and layout debugging using Tailwind CSS classes and Laravel''s Precognition feature.","zh":"赋予代理创建更干燥、更易访问的React Aria组件的能力，具有针对响应式设计、暗黑模式和布局调试的优化样式，使用Tailwind CSS类和Laravel的Precognition功能。","ja":"React AriaコンポーネントをよりDRYに、よりアクセスしやすくするためのエージェントの能力を提供し、レスポンシブデザイン、ダークモード、レイアウトデバッグの最適化されたスタイリングを使用して、Tailwind CSSクラスとLaravelのPrecognition機能を使用します。","ko":"React Aria 컴포넌트를 더 DRY하게, 더 접근하기 쉽게 만드는 에이전트의 능력을 제공하며, 반응형 디자인, 다크 모드, 레이아웃 디버깅을 위한 최적화된 스타일링을 사용하여 Tailwind CSS 클래스와 Laravel의 Precognition 기능을 사용합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear componentes de React Aria más secos y accesibles con un estilo optimizado para diseño responsivo, modo oscuro y depuración de diseño utilizando clases de Tailwind CSS y la función de Precognition de Laravel.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer des composants React Aria plus secs et plus accessibles avec un style optimisé pour la conception réactive, le mode sombre et le débogage de disposition en utilisant des classes Tailwind CSS et la fonction Precognition de Laravel.","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, trockenere und zugänglichere React-Aria-Komponenten mit optimiertem Styling für responsives Design, Dark-Mode und Layout-Debugging mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen und Laravels Precognition-Funktion zu erstellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar componentes do React Aria mais secos e acessíveis, com estilização otimizada para design responsivo, modo escuro e depuração de layout usando classes do Tailwind CSS e o recurso Precognition do Laravel.","ru":"Позволяет агентам создавать более сухие и доступные компоненты React Aria с оптимизированной стилизацией для адаптивного дизайна, темного режима и отладки макета с использованием классов Tailwind CSS и функции Precognition Laravel.","ar":"تمكّن الوكلاء من إنشاء مكونات React Aria أكثر جفافا وقابلية للوصول، مع تنسيق محسن لتصميم الاستجابة ووضع الإضاءة الخافتة وتصحيح أخطاء التخطيط باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS وميزة Precognition من Laravel."},"useCases":{"en":["Styling components with Tailwind CSS classes for consistent design","Implementing responsive design and dark mode features","Debugging spacing or layout issues with optimized Tailwind CSS patterns","Extracting repeated patterns into reusable components with Inertia.js"],"zh":["使用Tailwind CSS类实现一致的设计样式","实现响应式设计和暗黑模式功能","使用优化的Tailwind CSS模式调试间距或布局问题","使用Inertia.js将重复的模式提取为可重用的组件"],"ja":["Tailwind CSSクラスを使用して一貫したデザインスタイルを実現する","レスポンシブデザインとダークモード機能を実装する","最適化されたTailwind CSSパターンを使用して間隔またはレイアウトの問題をデバッグする","Inertia.jsを使用して繰り返しのパターンを再利用可能なコンポーネントに抽出する"],"ko":["Tailwind CSS 클래스를 사용하여 일관된 디자인 스타일을 구현하는 것","반응형 디자인과 다크 모드 기능을 구현하는 것","최적화된 Tailwind CSS 패턴을 사용하여 간격 또는 레이아웃 문제를 디버깅하는 것","Inertia.js를 사용하여 반복되는 패턴을 재사용 가능한 컴포넌트로 추출하는 것"],"es":["Estilar componentes con clases de Tailwind CSS para un diseño coherente","Implementar características de diseño responsivo y modo oscuro","Depurar problemas de espaciado o diseño con patrones de Tailwind CSS optimizados","Extraer patrones repetidos en componentes reutilizables con Inertia.js"],"fr":["Styler les composants avec des classes Tailwind CSS pour une conception cohérente","Mettre en œuvre des fonctionnalités de conception réactive et de mode sombre","Déboguer les problèmes d''espacement ou de disposition avec des modèles Tailwind CSS optimisés","Extraire des modèles répétés en composants réutilisables avec Inertia.js"],"de":["Komponenten mit Tailwind-CSS-Klassen für ein konsistentes Design stylen","Responsive-Design- und Dark-Mode-Features implementieren","Abstände- oder Layoutprobleme mit optimierten Tailwind-CSS-Mustern debuggen","Wiederholte Muster in wiederverwendbare Komponenten mit Inertia.js extrahieren"],"pt":["Estilização de componentes com classes do Tailwind CSS para design consistente","Implementação de design responsivo e recursos de modo escuro","Depuração de problemas de espaçamento ou layout com padrões do Tailwind CSS otimizados","Extração de padrões repetidos em componentes reutilizáveis com Inertia.js"],"ru":["Стилизация компонентов с использованием классов Tailwind CSS для последовательного дизайна","Реализация адаптивного дизайна и функций темного режима","Отладка проблем с расстоянием или макетом с использованием оптимизированных шаблонов Tailwind CSS","Извлечение повторяющихся шаблонов в многоразовые компоненты с помощью Inertia.js"],"ar":["تنسيق المكونات باستخدام فئات Tailwind CSS لتصميم متسق","تنفيذ تصميم استجابي وميزات وضع الإضاءة الخافتة","تصحيح أخطاء التباعد أو التخطيط باستخدام أنماط Tailwind CSS المحسنة","استخراج الأنماط المتكررة إلى مكونات قابلة لإعادة الاستخدام باستخدام Inertia.js"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires existing Tailwind CSS project conventions","Optimized for Inertia.js with Laravel''s Precognition feature"],"zh":["需要现有的Tailwind CSS项目约定","针对Inertia.js和Laravel的Precognition功能进行优化"],"ja":["既存のTailwind CSSプロジェクト規約が必要","Inertia.jsとLaravelのPrecognition機能に対して最適化されています"],"ko":["기존의 Tailwind CSS 프로젝트 규약이 필요","Inertia.js와 Laravel의 Precognition 기능을 위해 최적화됨"],"es":["Requiere convenciones de proyecto de Tailwind CSS existentes","Optimizado para Inertia.js con la función de Precognition de Laravel"],"fr":["Nécessite des conventions de projet Tailwind CSS existantes","Optimisé pour Inertia.js avec la fonction Precognition de Laravel"],"de":["Erfordert bestehende Tailwind-CSS-Projekt-Konventionen","Optimiert für Inertia.js mit Laravels Precognition-Funktion"],"pt":["Exige convenções de projeto existentes do Tailwind CSS","Otimizado para Inertia.js com o recurso Precognition do Laravel"],"ru":["Требует существующих соглашений проекта Tailwind CSS","Оптимизирован для Inertia.js с функцией Precognition Laravel"],"ar":["يتطلب اتفاقيات مشروع Tailwind CSS الحالية","مُحسّن ل Inertia.js مع ميزة Precognition من Laravel"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7d006586644836216d261284d194efb0dd041f07b6accb66d16ee926bc0db1c7","qualityScore":20}');
