verwendung von prompts","alternativen zu promptyard","wie man promptyard verwendet","installation von promptyard","einrichtungsanleitung für promptyard"],"pt":["ferramentas de ia","como usar promptyard","o que é promptyard","promptyard vs chatgpt","instalar promptyard","guia de configuração do promptyard","ferramentas de edição de itens de backlog","gerenciamento de prompts","otimização de prompts"],"ru":["ИИ агенты","как использовать promptyard","что такое promptyard","promptyard vs chatgpt","установить promptyard","руководство по настройке promptyard","инструменты редактирования элементов бэклога","управление промптами","оптимизация промптов"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","كيفية استخدام promptyard","ما هو promptyard","promptyard مقابل chatgpt","تثبيت promptyard","دليل إعداد promptyard","أدوات تحرير عناصر.Backlog","إدارة المروّضات","تحسين المروّضات"]}},"owner":"wmeints","repo":"promptyard","repoPath":"wmeints/promptyard","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.979Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"edit-backlog-item","description":"Use this skill when creating or editing issues on Github or when asked to write user-stories or record bugs.","bodyPreview":"## Edit Backlog Item\n\nUse this skill to create or edit issues on the Github repository for the project.\nYou should use this skill also when asked to write or edit user stories or bugs.\n\n## Managing user stories\n\n- User stories follow the template described in ./templates/user-story.md\n- Tasks in user stories should add value towards the goal. When you need to\n  complete multiple tasks to get a concrete runnable result, it should be one\n  task on the list instead of separate tasks.\n- Important: Y","body":"## Edit Backlog Item\n\nUse this skill to create or edit issues on the Github repository for the project.\nYou should use this skill also when asked to write or edit user stories or bugs.\n\n## Managing user stories\n\n- User stories follow the template described in ./templates/user-story.md\n- Tasks in user stories should add value towards the goal. When you need to\n  complete multiple tasks to get a concrete runnable result, it should be one\n  task on the list instead of separate tasks.\n- Important: You must adhere to the provided template.\n\n## Managing bugs\n\n- User stories follow the template described in ./templates/user-story.md\n- Tasks in user stories should add value towards the goal. When you need to\n  complete multiple tasks to get a concrete runnable result, it should be one\n  task on the list instead of separate tasks.\n- Important: You must adhere to the provided template.\n\n## Recording user stories and bugs\n\n- Important: record user stories and bugs in the GitHub repository associated with the codebase!\n- Use the label `kind:bug` for recording bugs on GitHub.\n- Use the label `kind:story` for recording user stories on GitHub."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:56:09.226Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Agile-focused AI Agents like AutoGPT and LangChain needing efficient Github repository management capabilities.","zh":"适用于像 AutoGPT 和 LangChain 这样的专注于敏捷的 AI Agent，需要高效的 Github 仓库管理能力。","ja":"Agile に焦点を当てた AutoGPT や LangChain のような AI エージェントに適しています。Github リポジトリの効率的な管理機能が必要です。","ko":"Agile에 중점을 둔 AutoGPT 및 LangChain과 같은 AI 에이전트에게 적합합니다. 효율적인 Github 리포지토리 관리 기능이 필요합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA enfocados en Agile como AutoGPT y LangChain que necesitan capacidades de gestión de repositorios de Github eficientes.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA axés sur Agile comme AutoGPT et LangChain nécessitant des capacités de gestion de référentiels Github efficaces.","de":"Ideal für agil-fokussierte KI-Agents wie AutoGPT und LangChain, die effiziente Github-Repository-Verwaltungsfunktionen benötigen.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA focados em Agile, como AutoGPT e LangChain, que necessitam de capacidades de gerenciamento de repositório Github eficientes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ, ориентированных на Agile, таких как AutoGPT и LangChain, требующих эффективных возможностей управления репозиторием Github.","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الذكيين التي تركز على Agile مثل AutoGPT و LangChain التي تحتاج إلى قدرات إدارة مخزن Github فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to create, edit, and manage Github issues, user stories, and bugs using Markdown templates, streamlining project backlog management and enhancing collaboration through Github protocols.","zh":"赋予代理创建、编辑和管理 Github 问题、用户故事和错误使用 Markdown 模板的能力，简化项目待办事项管理，并通过 Github 协议增强协作。","ja":"Github の問題、ユーザーストーリー、バグを Markdown テンプレートを使用して作成、編集、管理する能力をエージェントに与え、プロジェクトのバックログ管理を合理化し、Github のプロトコルを介してコラボレーションを強化します。","ko":"에이전트가 Markdown 템플릿을 사용하여 Github 문제, 사용자 스토리 및 버그를 생성, 편집 및 관리할 수 있는 기능을 제공하여 프로젝트 백로그 관리를 간소화하고 Github 프로토콜을 통해 협력을 강화합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a crear, editar y gestionar problemas de Github, historias de usuario y errores utilizando plantillas de Markdown, lo que simplifica la gestión de la lista de proyectos pendientes y mejora la colaboración a través de protocolos de Github.","fr":"Permet aux agents de créer, modifier et gérer les problèmes de Github, les histoires d''utilisateurs et les bogues en utilisant des modèles de Markdown, ce qui rationalise la gestion de la liste de projets en attente et améliore la collaboration via les protocoles de Github.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, Github-Probleme, Benutzerstories und Fehler mit Hilfe von Markdown-Vorlagen zu erstellen, zu bearbeiten und zu verwalten, wodurch die Verwaltung des Projekt-Backlogs rationalisiert und die Zusammenarbeit durch Github-Protokolle verbessert wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a criar, editar e gerenciar problemas do Github, histórias de usuário e bugs usando modelos de Markdown, otimizando a gestão da fila de projetos e melhorando a colaboração por meio dos protocolos do Github.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью создавать, редактировать и управлять проблемами Github, историями пользователей и ошибками с помощью шаблонов Markdown, оптимизируя управление проектной очередью и повышая сотрудничество через протоколы Github.","ar":"تمكين الوكلاء من إنشاء وتحرير و إدارة قضايا Github و قصص المستخدمين و الأخطاء باستخدام قوالب Markdown، و تحسين إدارة قائمة المشروع وتعزيز التعاون من خلال بروتوكولات Github."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating issue creation for prompt optimization tasks","Editing user stories to align with project goals and templates","Debugging and updating bug reports for seamless application integration"],"zh":["自动创建问题以优化提示任务","编辑用户故事以与项目目标和模板保持一致","调试和更新错误报告以实现无缝的应用程序集成"],"ja":["プロンプトの最適化タスクのための問題作成の自動化","プロジェクトの目標やテンプレートと一致するようにユーザーストーリーの編集","バグレポートのデバッグと更新によるアプリケーションのシームレスな統合"],"ko":["프롬프트 최적화 작업을 위한 문제 자동 생성","프로젝트 목표 및 템플릿과 일치하도록 사용자 스토리 편집","버그 보고서의 디버깅 및 업데이트를 통한 애플리케이션의無縫な統合"],"es":["Automatizar la creación de problemas para tareas de optimización de prompts","Editar historias de usuario para alinearlas con los objetivos y plantillas del proyecto","Depurar y actualizar informes de errores para una integración de aplicaciones sin problemas"],"fr":["Automatiser la création de problèmes pour les tâches d''optimisation des invites de commande","Modifier les histoires d''utilisateurs pour les aligner sur les objectifs et les modèles du projet","Déboguer et mettre à jour les rapports de bogues pour une intégration d''applications sans problème"],"de":["Automatisieren der Problemerstellung für Prompt-Optimierungsaufgaben","Bearbeiten von Benutzerstories, um sie mit den Projektzielen und -vorlagen in Einklang zu bringen","Fehlerberichte debuggen und aktualisieren, um eine nahtlose Anwendungsintegration zu ermöglichen"],"pt":["Automatizar a criação de problemas para tarefas de otimização de prompt","Editar histórias de usuário para alinhar com metas e modelos de projeto","Depurar e atualizar relatórios de bugs para integração de aplicativos sem interrupções"],"ru":["Автоматизировать создание проблем для задач оптимизации подсказок","Редактировать истории пользователей для согласования с целями и шаблонами проекта","Отлаживать и обновлять отчеты об ошибках для бесперебойной интеграции приложений"],"ar":["التحكم الالي في إنشاء المشكلات لأعمال تحسين البرومت","تحرير قصص المستخدمين لتنظيمها مع أهداف و قوالب المشروع","تصحيح الأخطاء و تحديث تقارير الأخطاء لدمج التطبيقات دون انقطاع"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Github repository access","Adheres to specific user story templates like ./templates/user-story.md","Primarily designed for text-based issue management"],"zh":["需要 Github 仓库访问权限","遵循特定的用户故事模板，如 ./templates/user-story.md","主要设计用于基于文本的问题管理"],"ja":["Github リポジトリへのアクセスが必要","特定のユーザーストーリーテンプレート（例： ./templates/user-story.md）に従う","主にテキストベースの問題管理に設計されている"],"ko":["Github 리포지토리에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","특정 사용자 스토리 템플릿(예: ./templates/user-story.md)을 따름","주로 텍스트 기반의 문제 관리를 위해 설계되었습니다"],"es":["Requiere acceso al repositorio de Github","Se adhiere a plantillas de historias de usuario específicas como ./templates/user-story.md","Está diseñado principalmente para la gestión de problemas basada en texto"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au référentiel de Github","Adhère à des modèles d''histoires d''utilisateurs spécifiques comme ./templates/user-story.md","Conçu principalement pour la gestion de problèmes basée sur le texte"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Github-Repository","Hält sich an bestimmte Benutzerstory-Vorlagen wie ./templates/user-story.md","Wurde primär für die textbasierte Fehlerverwaltung konzipiert"],"pt":["Exige acesso ao repositório Github","Adere a modelos de histórias de usuário específicos como ./templates/user-story.md","Projetado principalmente para gerenciamento de problemas baseado em texto"],"ru":["Требует доступа к репозиторию Github","Соблюдает конкретные шаблоны историй пользователей, такие как ./templates/user-story.md","В основном предназначен для управления проблемами на основе текста"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى مخزن Github","يلتزم بنماذج قصة المستخدم المحددة مثل ./templates/user-story.md","تم تصميمه في الأساس لإدارة المشكلات القائمة على النص"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"b9ba803337fd3a4b72ff4309415d0824f37df9c5adab44315c364e386cb3bfb0","qualityScore":20}');
INSERT OR REPLACE INTO skills (id, category, owner, repo, repo_path, name, stars, forks, quality_score, updated_at, last_synced, content_hash, data_json) VALUES ('nandemo-ya/kecs/LocalStack Service Tiers Reference', 'community', 'nandemo-ya', 'kecs', 'nandemo-ya/kecs', 'LocalStack Service Tiers Reference', 0, 0, 20, '2026-03-02T01:56:10.981Z', '2026-03-02T02:57:28.985Z', '9d5ce732e7150e9209725e74c3cefb0d0a3c170b052c7ac19146a465329db024', '{"id":"nandemo-ya/kecs/LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","name":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","description":{"zh":"LocalStack服务层参考提供KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service），帮助开发者更好地使用Amazon ECS兼容API","ja":"LocalStackサービス層リファレンスは、KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service）を提供し、Amazon ECS互換APIの使用を容易にします","ko":"로컬스택 서비스 티어 레퍼런스는 KECS（쿠버네티스 기반 ECS 호환 서비스）를 제공하여 아마존 ECS 호환 API 사용을 간소화합니다","es":"KECS es un servicio independiente que proporciona APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS en Kubernetes.","fr":"KECS est un service autonome qui fournit des API compatibles Amazon ECS sur Kubernetes.","de":"KECS ist ein eigenständiger Dienst, der Amazon ECS-kompatible APIs auf Kubernetes bereitstellt.","pt":"O KECS é um serviço autônomo que fornece APIs compatíveis com o Amazon ECS em execução no Kubernetes, permitindo a integração perfeita com o LocalStack.","ru":"KECS — это автономный сервис, обеспечивающий совместимые с Amazon ECS API на базе Kubernetes, что позволяет идеально интегрироваться с LocalStack.","ar":"KECS هو خدمة مستقلة توفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Amazon ECS على Kubernetes، مما يسمح بالدمج المثالي مع LocalStack.","en":"KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service) is a standalone service that provides Amazon ECS compatible APIs running on Kubernetes."},"seo":{"title":{"zh":"AIエージェント：LocalStack服务层参考","ja":"AIエージェント：LocalStackサービス層リファレンス","ko":"AI 에이전트: 로컬스택 서비스 티어 레퍼런스","es":"Herramientas de AI: Referencia de niveles de servicio de ...","fr":"Outils d''IA: Référence des niveaux de service LocalStack","de":"KI-Tools: LocalStack Service-Tiers Referenz","pt":"Ferramentas de IA: Referência de Níveis de Serviço do Loc...","ru":"ИИ Агенты: Справочник Уровней Служб LocalStack","ar":"أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي: مرجع مستويات الخدمة في LocalStack","en":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference"},"description":{"zh":"LocalStack服务层参考提供KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service），帮助开发者更好地使用Amazon ECS兼容API","ja":"LocalStackサービス層リファレンスは、KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service）を提供し、Amazon ECS互換APIの使用を容易にします","ko":"로컬스택 서비스 티어 레퍼런스는 KECS（쿠버네티스 기반 ECS 호환 서비스）를 제공하여 아마존 ECS 호환 API 사용을 간소화합니다","es":"KECS es un servicio independiente que proporciona APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS en Kubernetes.","fr":"KECS est un service autonome qui fournit des API compatibles Amazon ECS sur Kubernetes.","de":"KECS ist ein eigenständiger Dienst, der Amazon ECS-kompatible APIs auf Kubernetes bereitstellt.","pt":"O KECS é um serviço autônomo que fornece APIs compatíveis com o Amazon ECS em execução no Kubernetes, permitindo a integração perfeita com o LocalStack.","ru":"KECS — это автономный сервис, обеспечивающий совместимые с Amazon ECS API на базе Kubernetes, что позволяет идеально интегрироваться с LocalStack.","ar":"KECS هو خدمة مستقلة توفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Amazon ECS على Kubernetes، مما يسمح بالدمج المثالي مع LocalStack.","en":"KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service) is a standalone service that provides Amazon ECS compatible APIs running on Kubernetes."},"definition":{"en":"KECS (Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service) is a standalone service that provides Amazon ECS compatible APIs running on Kubernetes."},"features":{"zh":["提供KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service）","支持Amazon ECS兼容API","运行于Kubernetes之上","帮助开发者提高效率","提供灵活的服务层参考"],"ja":["KECS（Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service）を提供","Amazon ECS互換APIをサポート","Kubernetes上で動作","開発者の効率を向上させる","柔軟なサービス層リファレンスを提供"],"ko":["KECS（쿠버네티스 기반 ECS 호환 서비스） 제공","아마존 ECS 호환 API 지원","쿠버네티스에서 동작","개발자 효율성 향상","유연한 서비스 티어 레퍼런스 제공"],"es":["Compatibilidad con Amazon ECS","Ejecución en entornos de Kubernetes","APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS","Servicio independiente","Integración con KECS"],"fr":["Compatibilité avec Amazon ECS","Exécution dans des environnements Kubernetes","API compatibles avec Amazon ECS","Service autonome","Intégration avec KECS"],"de":["Kompatibilität mit Amazon ECS","Ausführung in Kubernetes-Umgebungen","Amazon ECS-kompatible APIs","Eigenständiger Dienst","Integration mit KECS"],"pt":["Fornece APIs compatíveis com o Amazon ECS","Executa em Kubernetes","Integração perfeita com o LocalStack","Serviço autônomo","Compatibilidade com o Amazon ECS"],"ru":["Обеспечивает совместимые с Amazon ECS API","Работает на базе Kubernetes","Идеально интегрируется с LocalStack","Автономный сервис","Совместимость с Amazon ECS"],"ar":["يوفر واجهات برمجة تطبيقات متوافقة مع Amazon ECS","يعمل على Kubernetes","الدمج المثالي مع LocalStack","خدمة مستقلة","التوافق مع Amazon ECS"]},"keywords":{"zh":["LocalStack服务层参考","KECS","Kubernetes","Amazon ECS","AIエージェント","如何使用LocalStack","LocalStack安装","LocalStack设置指南"],"ja":["LocalStackサービス層リファレンス","KECS","Kubernetes","Amazon ECS","AIエージェント","LocalStackの使い方","LocalStackインストール","LocalStack設定ガイド"],"ko":["로컬스택 서비스 티어 레퍼런스","KECS","쿠버네티스","아마존 ECS","AI 에이전트","로컬스택 사용법","로컬스택 설치","로컬스택 설정 가이드"],"es":["Herramientas de AI","LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","cómo usar LocalStack","qué es KECS","alternativas a LocalStack","instalación de LocalStack"],"fr":["Outils d''IA","LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","comment utiliser LocalStack","qu''est-ce que KECS","alternatives à LocalStack","installation de LocalStack"],"de":["KI-Tools","LocalStack","KECS","Amazon ECS","Kubernetes","wie man LocalStack verwendet","was ist KECS","Alternativen zu LocalStack","Installation von LocalStack"],"pt":["como usar KECS","o que é KECS","LocalStack alternative","KECS vs Amazon ECS","instalar LocalStack","guia de configuração do LocalStack","desenvolvimento de aplicativos com KECS","integração de KECS com Kubernetes"],"ru":["как использовать KECS","что такое KECS","альтернатива LocalStack","KECS vs Amazon ECS","установка LocalStack","руководство по настройке LocalStack","разработка приложений с KECS","интеграция KECS с Kubernetes"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام KECS","ما هو KECS","بديل LocalStack","KECS مقابل Amazon ECS","تثبيت LocalStack","دليل إعداد LocalStack","تطوير التطبيقات مع KECS","دمج KECS مع Kubernetes"]}},"owner":"nandemo-ya","repo":"kecs","repoPath":"nandemo-ya/kecs","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.981Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"LocalStack Service Tiers Reference","description":"Reference for LocalStack AWS service availability by tier (Free/Base/Ultimate). Essential for KECS development to understand which AWS-compatible services can be used locally without cost.","bodyPreview":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier","body":"# LocalStack Service Tiers Reference\n\nThis skill provides knowledge about LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers.\nKECS uses LocalStack for AWS-compatible services, relying on free tier services for ECS integrations.\n\n## Quick Reference\n\n### Key Insight for KECS Development\n\n**ECS is NOT available in LocalStack Free tier** - it requires Base tier ($39/mo).\nThis is one of the primary reasons KECS exists: to provide a free, local ECS-compatible environment.\n\n### Pricing Tiers\n\n| Tier | Price | Services |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| Free (Community) | $0 | 30+ services |\n| Base | $39/mo | 55+ services |\n| Ultimate | $89/mo | 110+ services |\n\n### Free Tier Services (Commonly Used with ECS)\n\nThese services are available for free and can be used with KECS:\n\n- **S3** - Object storage\n- **DynamoDB** - NoSQL database\n- **SQS** - Simple Queue Service\n- **SNS** - Simple Notification Service\n- **IAM** - Identity and Access Management\n- **SecretsManager** - Secrets management\n- **KMS** - Key Management Service\n- **SSM** - Systems Manager (Parameter Store)\n- **STS** - Security Token Service\n- **ACM** - Certificate Manager\n- **CloudWatch** - Monitoring (basic features)\n- **CloudWatch Logs** - Logging (basic features)\n- **Lambda** - Serverless functions (basic features)\n\n### Paid Tier Only Services (NOT Free)\n\nThese require LocalStack Base or Ultimate:\n\n- **ECS** - Elastic Container Service (Base+)\n- **ECR** - Elastic Container Registry (Base+)\n- **ELB/ALB** - Load Balancing (Base+)\n- **EC2** - Docker VM mode (Base+, Mock mode is free)\n\n## Detailed Documentation\n\nSee `service-tiers.md` for complete service tier information.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:57:28.985Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Cloud Agents requiring LocalStack service tier awareness for Amazon ECS compatible APIs on Kubernetes","zh":"非常适合需要 LocalStack 服务层级感知以在 Kubernetes 上使用 Amazon ECS 兼容 API 的云代理。","ja":"Kubernetes 上で Amazon ECS 互換 API を使用するために LocalStack サービス階層の認識を必要とするクラウドエージェントに理想的です。","ko":"Kubernetes에서 Amazon ECS 호환 API를 사용하기 위해 LocalStack 서비스 계층 인식이 필요한 클라우드 에이전트에 이상적입니다.","es":"Ideal para Cloud Agents que requieren conocimiento del nivel de servicio de LocalStack para APIs compatibles con Amazon ECS en Kubernetes","fr":"Idéal pour les Cloud Agents nécessitant une connaissance du niveau de service LocalStack pour les API compatibles avec Amazon ECS sur Kubernetes","de":"Ideal für Cloud Agents, die LocalStack Service-Tier-Bewusstsein für Amazon ECS-kompatible APIs auf Kubernetes benötigen","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Cloud que requerem conhecimento dos tiers de serviço do LocalStack para APIs compatíveis com Amazon ECS no Kubernetes","ru":"Идеально подходит для облачных агентов, требующих осведомленности об уровнях служб LocalStack для API, совместимых с Amazon ECS, в Kubernetes","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء السحابة الذين يتطلبون الوعي بمستويات خدمة LocalStack لواجهات برمجة التطبيقات المتوافقة مع Amazon ECS على Kubernetes"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to navigate LocalStack pricing tiers, leveraging KECS for free, local ECS-compatible environments and understanding ECS limitations in the LocalStack Free tier, while utilizing Base tier ($39/mo) for full ECS compatibility via Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service (KECS)","zh":"使代理能够导航 LocalStack 定价层级，利用 KECS 获取免费的本地 ECS 兼容环境，并了解 LocalStack 免费层中的 ECS 限制，同时利用基础层（每月 39 美元）通过基于 Kubernetes 的 ECS 兼容服务（KECS）获得完整的 ECS 兼容性。","ja":"エージェントが LocalStack の価格帯をナビゲートし、KECS を活用して無料のローカル ECS 互換環境を利用し、LocalStack 無料枠における ECS の制限を理解することを可能にし、同時にベース階層（月額 $39）を利用して Kubernetes ベースの ECS 互換サービス（KECS）経由で完全な ECS 互換性を実現します。","ko":"에이전트가 LocalStack 가격 책정 계층을 탐색하고, KECS를 활용하여 무료 로컬 ECS 호환 환경을 이용하며, LocalStack 무료 계층의 ECS 제한 사항을 이해할 수 있도록 하며, Kubernetes 기반 ECS 호환 서비스(KECS)를 통해 완전한 ECS 호환성을 위해 베이스 계층(월 $39)을 활용합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes navegar por los niveles de precios de LocalStack, aprovechando KECS para entornos locales y compatibles con ECS de forma gratuita, y comprender las limitaciones de ECS en el nivel gratuito de LocalStack, mientras utiliza el nivel Base ($39/mes) para una compatibilidad completa con ECS a través del Servicio Compatible con ECS basado en Kubernetes (KECS)","fr":"Permet aux agents de naviguer dans les niveaux de tarification de LocalStack, en tirant parti de KECS pour des environnements locaux compatibles ECS gratuits et en comprenant les limitations ECS dans le niveau gratuit de LocalStack, tout en utilisant le niveau Base (39 $/mois) pour une compatibilité ECS complète via le Service Compatible ECS basé sur Kubernetes (KECS)","de":"Ermöglicht Agents, die LocalStack Preis-Tiers zu navigieren, nutzt KECS für kostenlose, lokale ECS-kompatible Umgebungen und versteht die ECS-Einschränkungen im LocalStack Free Tier, während das Base Tier (39 $/Monat) für vollständige ECS-Kompatibilität über den Kubernetes-basierten ECS Compatible Service (KECS) genutzt wird","pt":"Capacita os agentes a navegar pelos tiers de preços do LocalStack, aproveitando o KECS para ambientes locais e compatíveis com ECS gratuitos e compreendendo as limitações do ECS no tier gratuito do LocalStack, enquanto utiliza o tier Base ($39/mês) para compatibilidade total com ECS por meio do Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service (KECS)","ru":"Позволяет агентам ориентироваться в ценовых уровнях LocalStack, используя KECS для бесплатных локальных сред, совместимых с ECS, и понимая ограничения ECS в бесплатном уровне LocalStack, при этом используя базовый уровень ($39/мес) для полной совместимости с ECS через Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service (KECS)","ar":"يمكّن الوكلاء من التنقل بين مستويات تسعير LocalStack، والاستفادة من KECS للحصول على بيئات محلية مجانية متوافقة مع ECS وفهم قيود ECS في المستوى المجاني لـ LocalStack، مع استخدام المستوى الأساسي (39 دولارًا/شهر) للحصول على التوافق الكامل مع ECS عبر Kubernetes-based ECS Compatible Service (KECS)"},"useCases":{"en":["Determining LocalStack service availability across pricing tiers","Debugging KECS integrations with Amazon ECS","Optimizing LocalStack costs by selecting the appropriate service tier"],"zh":["确定各定价层中 LocalStack 服务的可用性","调试 KECS 与 Amazon ECS 的集成","通过选择适当的服务层级来优化 LocalStack 成本"],"ja":["価格帯全体での LocalStack サービスの可用性の決定","Amazon ECS との KECS 統合のデバッグ","適切なサービス階層を選択することによる LocalStack コストの最適化"],"ko":["가격 책정 계층 전반에 걸친 LocalStack 서비스 가용성 확인","Amazon ECS와의 KECS 통합 디버깅","적절한 서비스 계층을 선택하여 LocalStack 비용 최적화"],"es":["Determinar la disponibilidad del servicio LocalStack en todos los niveles de precios","Depurar integraciones de KECS con Amazon ECS","Optimizar costos de LocalStack seleccionando el nivel de servicio apropiado"],"fr":["Déterminer la disponibilité des services LocalStack sur tous les niveaux de tarification","Déboguer les intégrations KECS avec Amazon ECS","Optimiser les coûts de LocalStack en sélectionnant le niveau de service approprié"],"de":["Bestimmung der LocalStack Serviceverfügbarkeit über alle Preis-Tiers hinweg","Debuggen von KECS-Integrationen mit Amazon ECS","Optimierung der LocalStack-Kosten durch Auswahl des geeigneten Service-Tiers"],"pt":["Determinar a disponibilidade de serviço do LocalStack em todos os tiers de preços","Depurar integrações do KECS com o Amazon ECS","Otimizar custos do LocalStack selecionando o tier de serviço apropriado"],"ru":["Определение доступности служб LocalStack по ценовым уровням","Отладка интеграций KECS с Amazon ECS","Оптимизация затрат на LocalStack путем выбора соответствующего уровня обслуживания"],"ar":["تحديد توفر خدمة LocalStack عبر مستويات التسعير","تصحيح أخطاء تكاملات KECS مع Amazon ECS","تحسين تكاليف LocalStack من خلال اختيار مستوى الخدمة المناسب"]},"limitations":{"en":["ECS not available in LocalStack Free tier","Requires Base tier ($39/mo) for ECS compatibility","Dependent on Kubernetes for KECS functionality"],"zh":["ECS 在 LocalStack 免费层中不可用","需要基础层（每月 39 美元）以获得 ECS 兼容性","KECS 功能依赖于 Kubernetes"],"ja":["ECS は LocalStack 無料枠では利用不可","ECS 互換性にはベース階層（月額 $39）が必要","KECS 機能は Kubernetes に依存"],"ko":["ECS는 LocalStack 무료 계층에서 사용 불가","ECS 호환성을 위해 베이스 계층(월 $39) 필요","KECS 기능은 Kubernetes에 종속됨"],"es":["ECS no está disponible en el nivel gratuito de LocalStack","Requiere el nivel Base ($39/mes) para compatibilidad con ECS","Depende de Kubernetes para la funcionalidad de KECS"],"fr":["ECS non disponible dans le niveau gratuit de LocalStack","Nécessite le niveau Base (39 $/mois) pour la compatibilité ECS","Dépend de Kubernetes pour la fonctionnalité KECS"],"de":["ECS ist im LocalStack Free Tier nicht verfügbar","Erfordert das Base Tier (39 $/Monat) für ECS-Kompatibilität","Abhängig von Kubernetes für die KECS-Funktionalität"],"pt":["ECS não disponível no tier gratuito do LocalStack","Requer o tier Base ($39/mês) para compatibilidade com ECS","Dependente do Kubernetes para a funcionalidade do KECS"],"ru":["ECS недоступен в бесплатном уровне LocalStack","Требуется базовый уровень ($39/мес) для совместимости с ECS","Зависит от Kubernetes для функциональности KECS"],"ar":["ECS غير متوفر في المستوى المجاني لـ LocalStack","يتطلب المستوى الأساسي (39 دولارًا/شهر) للحصول على التوافق مع ECS","يعتمد على Kubernetes لوظيفة KECS"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"9d5ce732e7150e9209725e74c3cefb0d0a3c170b052c7ac19146a465329db024","qualityScore":20}');
