iption":">","bodyPreview":"# Latitude Biome Authority — Vanilla Minecraft (Java 1.21.11)\n_Generated: 2026-01-31_\n\n## RULES (MANDATORY)\n- Every vanilla biome listed here **must exist** in at least one valid generation path.\n- Windsurf must **never invent, remove, or reassign** biomes outside this table.\n- If a biome is missing in-world, the cause is **tag omission or logic error**, not intentional rarity.\n- **Latitude bands are authoritative**; variants and overlays are secondary.\n- **Rarity is a design knob**, not a proba","body":"# Latitude Biome Authority — Vanilla Minecraft (Java 1.21.11)\n_Generated: 2026-01-31_\n\n## RULES (MANDATORY)\n- Every vanilla biome listed here **must exist** in at least one valid generation path.\n- Windsurf must **never invent, remove, or reassign** biomes outside this table.\n- If a biome is missing in-world, the cause is **tag omission or logic error**, not intentional rarity.\n- **Latitude bands are authoritative**; variants and overlays are secondary.\n- **Rarity is a design knob**, not a probability guarantee.\n- Caves, rivers, oceans, Nether, and End biomes are **not latitude-decided unless explicitly stated**.\n- Mountain / peak biomes are **overlays** and may restrict placement but **must not override latitude truth**.\n\n---\n\n## Latitude Bands\n\n* **Equator** — hottest + wettest  \n* **Tropics** — hot + wet-ish  \n* **Arid** — hot + dry  \n* **Temperate** — mild  \n* **Subpolar** — cold  \n* **Polar** — coldest  \n\n**Overlay: Mountain / Peaks**  \nOnly allowed when “mountainness” is true (height, slope, or climate params), regardless of latitude.\n\n---\n\n## Plains / general land\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Plains | Temperate | Common | Core mid-latitude flatland. |\n| Sunflower Plains | Temperate | Rare | Rare plains variant. |\n| Savanna | Arid ↔ Tropics | Uncommon | Warm transition biome. |\n| Savanna Plateau | Arid / Tropics | Uncommon | Highland warm biome. |\n| Snowy Plains | Subpolar | Common | Main cold flatland. |\n| Ice Spikes | Polar | Very rare | Cold extreme. |\n| Mushroom Fields | Any (special) | Very rare | Special-case island biome; not latitude-driven. |\n\n---\n\n## Forests / woodlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Forest | Temperate | Common | |\n| Birch Forest | Temperate | Common | |\n| Flower Forest | Temperate | Rare | Discovery biome. |\n| Dark Forest | Temperate | Uncommon | Dense canopy. |\n| Old Growth Birch Forest | Temperate | Rare | Large birch variant. |\n| Taiga | Temperate-high → Subpolar-low | Common | Key transition biome. |\n| Old Growth Pine Taiga | Temperate-high → Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Old Growth Spruce Taiga | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Snowy Taiga | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Pale Garden | Temperate (rare) | Very rare | Dark-forest-adjacent oddity. |\n\n---\n\n## Jungle family (warm + wet)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Jungle | Equator / Tropics | Uncommon | Dense near equator. |\n| Bamboo Jungle | Equator / Tropics | Rare | |\n| Sparse Jungle | Tropics | Uncommon | Transition biome. |\n| Mangrove Swamp | Equator / Tropics | Rare | Must not appear in cool bands. |\n\n---\n\n## Swamps / wetlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Swamp | Tropics ↔ Temperate-low | Uncommon | Warm temperate transition. |\n| Mangrove Swamp | Equator / Tropics | Rare | Warm-only swamp. |\n\n---\n\n## Sandy / dry / badlands\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Desert | Arid | Uncommon | |\n| Badlands | Arid | Rare | |\n| Wooded Badlands | Arid | Rare | |\n| Eroded Badlands | Arid | Very rare | Extreme terrain. |\n\n---\n\n## Mountains / highlands (overlay-only)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Meadow | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Grove | Temperate-high / Subpolar (overlay) | Uncommon | Must be explicitly preserved. |\n| Cherry Grove | Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Windswept Hills | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Windswept Forest | Temperate (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Windswept Gravelly Hills | Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Windswept Savanna | Arid / Tropics (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Peaks | Arid / Tropics / Temperate (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Jagged Peaks | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Frozen Peaks | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Rare | |\n| Snowy Slopes | Subpolar / Polar (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Shore | Any (adjacency overlay) | Uncommon | Mountains touching ocean only. |\n\n---\n\n## Caves (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Lush Caves | Any | Uncommon | |\n| Dripstone Caves | Any | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Dark | Any | Rare | |\n\n---\n\n## Beaches / shores (adjacency-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Beach | Equator / Tropics / Arid / Temperate | Common | |\n| Snowy Beach | Subpolar / Polar | Uncommon | |\n| Stony Shore | Any (overlay) | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## Rivers (temperature-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| River | Equator / Tropics / Arid / Temperate | Common | |\n| Frozen River | Subpolar / Polar | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## Oceans (temperature-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity | Notes |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| Warm Ocean | Equator / Tropics | Uncommon | |\n| Lukewarm Ocean | Tropics / Temperate-low | Uncommon | |\n| Ocean | Temperate | Common | |\n| Cold Ocean | Subpolar | Uncommon | |\n| Frozen Ocean | Polar | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Lukewarm Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Cold Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n| Deep Frozen Ocean | Depth overlay | Uncommon | |\n\n---\n\n## The Nether (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| Nether Wastes | N/A | Common |\n| Crimson Forest | N/A | Common |\n| Warped Forest | N/A | Common |\n| Soul Sand Valley | N/A | Uncommon |\n| Basalt Deltas | N/A | Uncommon |\n\n---\n\n## The End (not latitude-driven)\n\n| Biome | Band(s) | Rarity |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| The End | N/A | Special |\n| End Highlands | N/A | Common |\n| End Midlands | N/A | Common |\n| End Barrens | N/A | Common |\n| Small End Islands | N/A | Uncommon |\n| The Void | N/A | Special |\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:11:42.640Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Minecraft Modding Agents requiring deterministic latitude-based biome generation for globe-style worlds.","zh":"非常适合需要确定性纬度基准生物群系生成的Minecraft模组代理，适用于全球风格的世界。","ja":"Minecraft Moddingエージェントが決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオーム生成を必要とするグローブスタイルの世界に最適です。","ko":"정해진 위도 기반의 바이옴 생성이 필요한 Minecraft 모딩 에이전트에게 적합한 글로브 스타일의 세계입니다.","es":"Perfecto para agentes de modificación de Minecraft que requieren generación de biomas basada en latitud determinista para mundos de estilo global.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de modification de Minecraft nécessitant une génération de biomes basée sur la latitude déterministe pour les mondes de style global.","de":"Perfekt für Minecraft-Modding-Agents, die deterministische Längengrad-basierte Biome-Generierung für globale Welten erfordern.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Modding de Minecraft que exigem geração de biomas baseada em latitude determinística para mundos no estilo globo.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов моддинга Minecraft, требующих детерминированного поколения биомов на основе широты для глобусоподобных миров.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تعديل ماين كرافت الذي يتطلب توليد تضاريس جغرافية محددة بالاتجاه للعوالم على شكل كوكب."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to generate authoritative latitude bands for vanilla Minecraft biomes, ensuring consistent and predictable world generation using Java 1.21.11, while preventing Windsurf from inventing or removing biomes outside the defined table.","zh":"赋予代理生成权威的纬度带用于Vanilla Minecraft生物群系，确保使用Java 1.21.11的一致性和可预测的世界生成，同时防止Windsurf在定义表之外发明或删除生物群系。","ja":"エージェントがVanilla Minecraftのバイオームに対して権威ある緯度帯を生成できるようにし、Java 1.21.11を使用して一貫性と予測可能な世界生成を保証し、Windsurfが定義テーブル外でバイオームを発明または削除するのを防ぎます。","ko":"에이전트가 바닐라 Minecraft 바이옴에 권한 있는 위도帶를 생성할 수 있도록 하여 Java 1.21.11를 사용하여 일관성과 예측 가능한 세계 생성을 보장하며, Windsurf가 정의된 표 외부에서 바이옴을 발명하거나 삭제하는 것을 방지합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a generar bandas de latitud autorizadas para biomas de Minecraft vanilla, garantizando una generación de mundos coherente y predecible utilizando Java 1.21.11, mientras evita que Windsurf invente o elimine biomas fuera de la tabla definida.","fr":"Permet aux agents de générer des bandes de latitude autorisées pour les biomes Minecraft vanilla, assurant une génération de mondes cohérente et prévisible en utilisant Java 1.21.11, tout en empêchant Windsurf d''inventer ou de supprimer des biomes en dehors de la table définie.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, autorisierte Breitenbänder für Vanilla-Minecraft-Biome zu generieren, um eine konsistente und vorhersehbare Weltgenerierung mit Java 1.21.11 zu gewährleisten, während Windsurf daran gehindert wird, Biome außerhalb der definierten Tabelle zu erfinden oder zu entfernen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerarem bandas de latitude autoritárias para biomas de Minecraft vanilla, garantindo geração de mundo consistente e previsível usando Java 1.21.11, enquanto impede que o Windsurf invente ou remova biomas fora da tabela definida.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью генерировать авторитетные полосы широты для биомов Minecraft vanilla, обеспечивая последовательное и предсказуемое поколение мира с использованием Java 1.21.11, а также предотвращая изобретение или удаление биомов вне определенной таблицы Windsurf.","ar":"تمكّن العميل من توليد حزم خط عرض موثوقة لبيئات ماين كرافت الأصلية، مما يضمن توليد عالم متسق ومُقدّر باستخدام جافا 1.21.11، مع منع Windsurf من اختراع أو إزالة البيئات خارج الجدول المحدد."},"useCases":{"en":["Generating deterministic latitude-based biome bands for Minecraft Fabric mod development","Enforcing vanilla biome existence in at least one valid generation path","Debugging tag omission or logic errors causing missing biomes in-world"],"zh":["为Minecraft Fabric模组开发生成确定性纬度基准的生物群系带","强制执行香草生物群系在至少一个有效生成路径中的存在","调试标签省略或逻辑错误导致生物群系在世界中缺失"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド開発のための決定論的な緯度ベースのバイオーム帯の生成","バニラバイオームの少なくとも1つの有効な生成パスにおける存在を強制する","タグの省略またはロジックエラーによって引き起こされるバイオームの欠如をデバッグする"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 개발을 위한 정해진 위도 기반의 바이옴帶 생성","바닐라 바이옴이 적어도 하나의 유효한 생성 경로에서 존재하도록 강제 적용","태그 생략이나 논리 오류로 인해 발생하는 바이옴의 부재를 디버깅"],"es":["Generar bandas de biomas basadas en latitud determinista para el desarrollo de mods de Minecraft Fabric","Hacer cumplir la existencia de biomas vanilla en al menos un camino de generación válido","Depurar la omisión de etiquetas o errores de lógica que causan biomas que faltan en el mundo"],"fr":["Générer des bandes de biomes basées sur la latitude déterministe pour le développement de mods Minecraft Fabric","Faire respecter l''existence de biomes vanilla dans au moins un chemin de génération valide","Déboguer l''omission de balises ou les erreurs de logique qui provoquent des biomes manquants dans le monde"],"de":["Generieren deterministischer Längengrad-basierter Biome-Bänder für die Entwicklung von Minecraft Fabric-Mods","Durchsetzen der Existenz von Vanilla-Biomen in mindestens einem gültigen Generierungspfad","Fehlerbehebung bei fehlenden Etiketten oder Logikfehlern, die fehlende Biome in der Welt verursachen"],"pt":["Gerar bandas de biomas baseadas em latitude determinística para desenvolvimento de mod Fabric de Minecraft","Impor a existência de biomas vanilla em pelo menos um caminho de geração válido","Depurar a omissão de tags ou erros de lógica que causam biomas ausentes no mundo"],"ru":["Генерировать детерминированные полосы биомов на основе широты для разработки мода Fabric для Minecraft","Обеспечить существование биомов vanilla как минимум на одном допустимом пути генерации","Отладить пропуск тегов или ошибки логики, вызывающие отсутствие биомов в мире"],"ar":["توليد حزم بيئات جغرافية محددة بالاتجاه للعالم لتعديل ماين كرافت","إلزام وجود البيئات الأصلية في مسار توليد صحيح على الأقل","تصحيح خطأ إغفال الوسوم أو أخطاء المنطق التي تسبب في عدم وجود بيئات في العالم"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Minecraft Fabric mod environment","Limited to Java 1.21.11","Cannot invent, remove, or reassign biomes outside the defined table"],"zh":["需要Minecraft Fabric模组环境","仅限Java 1.21.11","不能在定义表之外发明、删除或重新分配生物群系"],"ja":["Minecraft Fabricモッド環境が必要","Java 1.21.11のみ","定義テーブル外でバイオームを発明、削除、または再割り当てすることはできない"],"ko":["Minecraft Fabric 모드 환경이 필요","Java 1.21.11만 해당","정의된 표 외부에서 바이옴을 발명, 삭제 또는 재할당할 수 없음"],"es":["Requiere entorno de mod de Minecraft Fabric","Limitado a Java 1.21.11","No puede inventar, eliminar o reasignar biomas fuera de la tabla definida"],"fr":["Nécessite un environnement de mod Minecraft Fabric","Limité à Java 1.21.11","Ne peut pas inventer, supprimer ou réaffecter des biomes en dehors de la table définie"],"de":["Benötigt Minecraft Fabric-Mod-Umgebung","Begrenzt auf Java 1.21.11","Kann keine Biome außerhalb der definierten Tabelle erfinden, entfernen oder neu zuweisen"],"pt":["Exige ambiente de mod Fabric de Minecraft","Limitado a Java 1.21.11","Não pode inventar, remover ou reatribuir biomas fora da tabela definida"],"ru":["Требует среды мода Fabric для Minecraft","Ограничен Java 1.21.11","Не может изобретать, удалять или переассоциировать биомы вне определенной таблицы"],"ar":["يتطلب بيئة تعديل Fabric لماين كرافت","محدود لجافا 1.21.11","لا يمكنه اختراع أو إزالة أو إعادة تخصيص البيئات خارج الجدول المحدد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"afa1a684f8fe9da6789d820ab8d3ef8fd40650d06bcaf20b0b938bbeff16dc8b","qualityScore":20}');
