"프로젝트의 유지 보수","개발 효율성","release-check 사용법","release-check 튜토리얼"],"es":["cómo usar release-check","qué es release-check","release-check alternativa","release-check vs Git","instalación de release-check","guía de configuración de release-check","herramientas de AI para desarrollo","release-check para Git y Packagist"],"fr":["comment utiliser release-check","qu''est-ce que release-check","alternative à release-check","release-check vs Git","installation de release-check","guide de configuration de release-check","outils d''IA pour le développement","release-check pour Git et Packagist"],"de":["wie man release-check verwendet","was ist release-check","release-check-Alternative","release-check vs Git","Installation von release-check","Einrichtungsanleitung für release-check","KI-Tools für die Entwicklung","release-check für Git und Packagist"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para desenvolvedores","release-check","segurança de exclusão de branches","análise de branches do GitHub","verificação de estatísticas de downloads do Packagist","guia de instalação do release-check","configuração do release-check"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для разработчиков","release-check","безопасность удаления веток","анализ общих веток GitHub","проверка статистики загрузок Packagist","руководство по установке release-check","настройка release-check"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي للمطورين","release-check","أمان حذف الفروع","تحليل الفروع العامة على GitHub","فحص إحصائيات التحميل من Packagist","دليل تثبيت أداة release-check","إعدادات أداة release-check"]}},"owner":"ivuorinen","repo":"branch-usage-checker","repoPath":"ivuorinen/branch-usage-checker","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:06:07Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"release-check","description":"Run full pre-release verification suite","bodyPreview":"# Pre-Release Verification\n\nRun the complete verification suite before a release.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `composer lint:all` — all linters must pass (PHPCS, EditorConfig, markdownlint)\n2. Run `composer test` — all tests must pass\n3. Run `composer build` — PHAR must build successfully\n4. Run `builds/branch-usage-checker --version` — smoke test the PHAR\n5. Run `git status` — working tree should be clean (no uncommitted changes)\n6. Report go/no-go summary with results of each step","body":"# Pre-Release Verification\n\nRun the complete verification suite before a release.\n\n## Steps\n\n1. Run `composer lint:all` — all linters must pass (PHPCS, EditorConfig, markdownlint)\n2. Run `composer test` — all tests must pass\n3. Run `composer build` — PHAR must build successfully\n4. Run `builds/branch-usage-checker --version` — smoke test the PHAR\n5. Run `git status` — working tree should be clean (no uncommitted changes)\n6. Report go/no-go summary with results of each step\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:53:45.085Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for PHP-based AI Agents requiring comprehensive pre-release verification and code quality checks.","zh":"适合需要全面预发布验证和代码质量检查的基于PHP的AI代理。","ja":"PHPベースのAIエージェントに適しており、包括的なリリース前検証とコード品質チェックが必要です。","ko":"전체적인 사전 릴리스 검증 및 코드 품질 확인이 필요한 PHP 기반 AI 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de IA basados en PHP que requieren una verificación y comprobación de calidad de código exhaustivas antes de su lanzamiento.","fr":"Idéal pour les agents d''IA basés sur PHP nécessitant une vérification et des contrôles de qualité de code complets avant leur publication.","de":"Ideal für PHP-basierte KI-Agents, die umfassende Prüfungen und Code-Qualitätschecks vor der Veröffentlichung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de IA baseados em PHP que exigem verificação abrangente pré-lançamento e verificações de qualidade de código.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов ИИ на основе PHP, требующих всесторонней предрелизной верификации и проверок качества кода.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل الذكاء الاصطناعي التي تعتمد على PHP التي تتطلب التحقق الشامل قبل الإصدار والتحقق من جودة الشيفرة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to ensure code integrity by running composer lint:all, composer test, and composer build, utilizing PHPCS, EditorConfig, and markdownlint for rigorous validation, and verifying PHAR builds with smoke tests using builds/branch-usage-checker.","zh":"通过运行composer lint:all、composer test和composer build，利用PHPCS、EditorConfig和markdownlint进行严格的验证，并使用builds/branch-usage-checker进行smoke测试来验证PHAR构建，赋予代理确保代码完整性的能力。","ja":"composer lint:all、composer test、composer buildを実行し、PHPCS、EditorConfig、markdownlintを使用して厳格な検証を行い、builds/branch-usage-checkerを使用してsmokeテストでPHARビルドを検証することで、コードの完全性を確保するエージェントの能力を提供します。","ko":"composer lint:all, composer test 및 composer build를 실행하고 PHPCS, EditorConfig 및 markdownlint를 사용하여 엄격한 검증을 수행하며 builds/branch-usage-checker를 사용하여 스모크 테스트로 PHAR 빌드를 확인하여 코드 무결성을 보장하는 에이전트의 능력을 제공합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes para garantizar la integridad del código ejecutando composer lint:all, composer test y composer build, utilizando PHPCS, EditorConfig y markdownlint para una validación rigurosa, y verificando las compilaciones PHAR con pruebas de humo usando builds/branch-usage-checker.","fr":"Permet aux agents de garantir l''intégrité du code en exécutant composer lint:all, composer test et composer build, en utilisant PHPCS, EditorConfig et markdownlint pour une validation rigoureuse, et en vérifiant les builds PHAR avec des tests de fumée à l''aide de builds/branch-usage-checker.","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, die Code-Integrität durch Ausführen von composer lint:all, composer test und composer build sicherzustellen, unter Verwendung von PHPCS, EditorConfig und markdownlint für eine strenge Überprüfung, und Überprüfung von PHAR-Builds mit Rauchtests unter Verwendung von builds/branch-usage-checker.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a garantir a integridade do código executando composer lint:all, composer test e composer build, utilizando PHPCS, EditorConfig e markdownlint para validação rigorosa, e verificando compilações PHAR com testes de fumaça usando builds/branch-usage-checker.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечить целостность кода путем выполнения composer lint:all, composer test и composer build, используя PHPCS, EditorConfig и markdownlint для строгой проверки, и проверки сборок PHAR с помощью тестов на дымность с использованием builds/branch-usage-checker.","ar":"تمكين الوكيل من ضمان سلامة الشيفرة من خلال تشغيل composer lint:all و composer test و composer build، باستخدام PHPCS و EditorConfig و markdownlint للتحقق الصارم، والتحقق من بناء PHAR باستخدام اختبارات الدخان باستخدام builds/branch-usage-checker."},"useCases":{"en":["Automating pre-release checks for PHP projects","Validating code quality with PHPCS and markdownlint","Verifying successful PHAR builds before deployment"],"zh":["自动执行PHP项目的预发布检查","使用PHPCS和markdownlint验证代码质量","部署前验证成功的PHAR构建"],"ja":["PHPプロジェクトのリリース前チェックを自動化する","PHPCSとmarkdownlintを使用してコード品質を検証する","デプロイ前に成功したPHARビルドを検証する"],"ko":["PHP 프로젝트의 사전 릴리스 확인을 자동화합니다","PHPCS 및 markdownlint를 사용하여 코드 품질을 확인합니다","배포 전에 성공적인 PHAR 빌드를 확인합니다"],"es":["Automatización de comprobaciones previas al lanzamiento para proyectos PHP","Validación de la calidad del código con PHPCS y markdownlint","Verificación de compilaciones PHAR exitosas antes de la implementación"],"fr":["Automatisation des vérifications préalables à la publication pour les projets PHP","Validation de la qualité du code avec PHPCS et markdownlint","Vérification de réussite des builds PHAR avant le déploiement"],"de":["Automatisierung von Prüfungen vor der Veröffentlichung für PHP-Projekte","Validierung der Code-Qualität mit PHPCS und markdownlint","Überprüfung von erfolgreichen PHAR-Builds vor der Bereitstellung"],"pt":["Automatizar verificações pré-lançamento para projetos PHP","Validar qualidade de código com PHPCS e markdownlint","Verificar compilações PHAR bem-sucedidas antes da implantação"],"ru":["Автоматизировать предрелизные проверки для проектов PHP","Проверять качество кода с помощью PHPCS и markdownlint","Проверять успешные сборки PHAR перед развертыванием"],"ar":["تأتمة التحقق قبل الإصدار لمشاريع PHP","التحقق من جودة الشيفرة باستخدام PHPCS و markdownlint","التحقق من بناء PHAR الناجح قبل النشر"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Composer installation","PHP environment necessary","Git repository access needed"],"zh":["需要Composer安装","需要PHP环境","需要Git仓库访问"],"ja":["Composerのインストールが必要","PHP環境が必要","Gitリポジトリへのアクセスが必要"],"ko":["Composer 설치가 필요합니다","PHP 환경이 필요합니다","Git 저장소 액세스가 필요합니다"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Composer","Entorno PHP necesario","Acceso al repositorio Git necesario"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Composer","Environnement PHP nécessaire","Accès au référentiel Git nécessaire"],"de":["Benötigt Composer-Installation","PHP-Umgebung erforderlich","Zugriff auf Git-Repository erforderlich"],"pt":["Exige instalação do Composer","Ambiente PHP necessário","Acesso ao repositório Git necessário"],"ru":["Требует установки Composer","Необходимо окружение PHP","Требуется доступ к репозиторию Git"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Composer","بيئة PHP ضرورية","دخول إلى مستودع Git ضروري"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"d9727706f3a977d397304473e89e8794a345ee0b1b9d8389fa6bd97aa22943af","qualityScore":20}');
