eitung für KI-Tools","Konfiguration von e2e-Tests"],"pt":["e2e-testing","ferramentas de teste de ponta a ponta","colecionadores de bobbleheads","qualidade do site","confiabilidade do site","como usar e2e-testing","o que é e2e-testing"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для тестирования сайта","инструменты для тестирования сайта","коллекционеры бобблхедов","качество сайта","надежность сайта","как использовать ИИ Агенты","что такое ИИ Агенты"],"ar":["أدوات اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","أدوات اختبار الموقع","مجموعة بوبل هيد","جودة الموقع","موثوقية الموقع","كيفية استخدام أدوات اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية","ما هي أدوات اختبار النهاية إلى النهاية"]}},"owner":"JasonPaff","repo":"head-shakers","repoPath":"JasonPaff/head-shakers","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.915Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"e2e-testing","description":"Enforces project E2E testing conventions using Playwright with custom fixtures, Page Object Model, and authentication contexts.","bodyPreview":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Work","body":"# E2E Testing Skill\n\n## Purpose\n\nThis skill provides end-to-end testing conventions using Playwright. E2E tests validate complete user flows with browser automation.\n\n## Activation\n\nThis skill activates when:\n\n- Creating or modifying files in `tests/e2e/specs/`\n- Testing complete user flows\n- Working with Playwright\n- Creating or modifying Page Object Model classes\n- Working with authentication contexts\n\n## File Patterns\n\n- `tests/e2e/specs/**/*.spec.ts`\n- `tests/e2e/pages/**/*.page.ts`\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Detect E2E test work (file path contains `tests/e2e/`)\n2. Load `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md`\n3. Also load `testing-base` skill for shared conventions\n4. Apply Playwright patterns with custom fixtures\n5. Use Page Object Model for reusable interactions\n\n## Key Patterns (REQUIRED)\n\n### Custom Fixtures\n\n- Use fixtures from `tests/e2e/fixtures/base.fixture.ts`\n- Available: `adminPage`, `userPage`, `newUserPage` (authenticated contexts)\n- Available: `adminFinder`, `userFinder`, `newUserFinder` (ComponentFinder instances)\n\n### Page Object Model\n\n- Extend `BasePage` class for page objects\n- Define `url` property for navigation\n- Use `byTestId` helper for data-testid lookups\n\n### ComponentFinder\n\n- Use for standardized `data-testid` lookups\n- Methods: `feature()`, `form()`, `ui()`, `layout()`, `tableCell()`\n\n### Test Organization\n\n- Place in appropriate `tests/e2e/specs/{category}/` folder\n- Categories: smoke, public, user, admin, onboarding\n\n## References\n\n- `references/E2E-Testing-Conventions.md` - Complete E2E testing conventions\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:24:43.234Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Frontend Agents needing advanced end-to-end testing capabilities with Playwright","zh":"适用于需要 Playwright 高级端到端测试能力的 Frontend Agents","ja":"Playwright を使用して高度な端末テスト能力を必要とする Frontend Agents に適しています","ko":"Playwright 를 사용하여 고급 엔드 투 엔드 테스트 기능을 필요로 하는 Frontend Agents 에 적합합니다","es":"Perfecto para agentes Frontend que necesitan capacidades de prueba de extremo a extremo avanzadas con Playwright","fr":"Parfait pour les agents Frontend ayant besoin de capacités de test de bout en bout avancées avec Playwright","de":"Perfekt für Frontend-Agents, die erweiterte End-to-End-Testfunktionen mit Playwright benötigen","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes Frontend que precisam de capacidades de teste de ponta a ponta avançadas com Playwright","ru":"Идеально для агентов Frontend, которым требуются расширенные возможности тестирования от начала до конца с Playwright","ar":"مثالي للوكلاء الأماميين الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات اختبار متقدمة من النهاية إلى النهاية مع Playwright"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to automate complete user flows with browser automation, utilizing Page Object Model classes and authentication contexts, all while leveraging Playwright for seamless testing of web applications","zh":"Empowers agents to automate complete user flows with browser automation, utilizing Page Object Model classes and authentication contexts, all while leveraging Playwright for seamless testing of web applications","ja":"Empowers agents to automate complete user flows with browser automation, utilizing Page Object Model classes and authentication contexts, all while leveraging Playwright for seamless testing of web applications","ko":"Empowers agents to automate complete user flows with browser automation, utilizing Page Object Model classes and authentication contexts, all while leveraging Playwright for seamless testing of web applications","es":"Habilita a los agentes a automatizar flujos de usuario completos con automatización de navegador, utilizando clases de modelo de objeto de página y contextos de autenticación, todo mientras aprovecha Playwright para una prueba de aplicaciones web sin problemas","fr":"Permet aux agents d''automatiser des flux d''utilisateurs complets avec une automatisation de navigateur, en utilisant des classes de modèle d''objet de page et des contextes d''authentification, le tout en exploitant Playwright pour un test sans problème des applications web","de":"Ermächtigt Agents, komplette Benutzerflüsse mit Browser-Automatisierung zu automatisieren, indem Page Object Model-Klassen und Authentifizierungskontexte verwendet werden, all dies während Playwright für ein nahtloses Testen von Webanwendungen genutzt wird","pt":"Habilita os agentes a automatizar fluxos de usuário completos com automação de navegador, utilizando classes de modelo de objeto de página e contextos de autenticação, tudo isso aproveitando o Playwright para testes sem problemas de aplicativos web","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью автоматизировать полные пользовательские потоки с помощью автоматизации браузера, используя классы модели объекта страницы и контексты аутентификации, все это при помощи Playwright для бесперебойного тестирования веб-приложений","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء القدرة على توفير تدفقات مستخدم كاملة مع автоматизация المتصفح، باستخدام فئات نموذج كائن الصفحة وسياقات المصادقة، كل ذلك مع الاستفادة من Playwright لاختبار تطبيقات الويب دون مشاكل"},"useCases":{"en":["Automating user flow testing for web applications","Generating Page Object Model classes for efficient testing","Debugging authentication contexts in end-to-end tests"],"zh":["Automating user flow testing for web applications","Generating Page Object Model classes for efficient testing","Debugging authentication contexts in end-to-end tests"],"ja":["Automating user flow testing for web applications","Generating Page Object Model classes for efficient testing","Debugging authentication contexts in end-to-end tests"],"ko":["Automating user flow testing for web applications","Generating Page Object Model classes for efficient testing","Debugging authentication contexts in end-to-end tests"],"es":["Automatización de pruebas de flujo de usuario para aplicaciones web","Generación de clases de modelo de objeto de página para pruebas eficientes","Depuración de contextos de autenticación en pruebas de extremo a extremo"],"fr":["Automatisation des tests de flux d''utilisateur pour les applications web","Génération de classes de modèle d''objet de page pour des tests efficaces","Débogage des contextes d''authentification dans les tests de bout en bout"],"de":["Automatisierung von Benutzerfluss-Tests für Webanwendungen","Generierung von Page Object Model-Klassen für effiziente Tests","Fehlerbehebung von Authentifizierungskontexten in End-to-End-Tests"],"pt":["Automatizar testes de fluxo de usuário para aplicativos web","Gerar classes de modelo de objeto de página para testes eficientes","Depurar contextos de autenticação em testes de ponta a ponta"],"ru":["Автоматизировать тестирование пользовательского потока для веб-приложений","Генерировать классы модели объекта страницы для эффективного тестирования","Отлаживать контексты аутентификации в тестах от начала до конца"],"ar":["أتمتة اختبار تدفق المستخدم لتطبيقات الويب","генерировать فئات نموذج كائن الصفحة لاختبارات فعالة","تصحيح سياقات المصادقة في اختبارات من النهاية إلى النهاية"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to testing web applications with browser automation","Needs access to files in ''tests/e2e/specs/'' and ''tests/e2e/pages/'' directories"],"zh":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to testing web applications with browser automation","Needs access to files in ''tests/e2e/specs/'' and ''tests/e2e/pages/'' directories"],"ja":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to testing web applications with browser automation","Needs access to files in ''tests/e2e/specs/'' and ''tests/e2e/pages/'' directories"],"ko":["Requires Playwright installation","Limited to testing web applications with browser automation","Needs access to files in ''tests/e2e/specs/'' and ''tests/e2e/pages/'' directories"],"es":["Requiere instalación de Playwright","Limitado a la prueba de aplicaciones web con automatización de navegador","Necesita acceso a archivos en los directorios ''tests/e2e/specs/'' y ''tests/e2e/pages/''"],"fr":["Nécessite l''installation de Playwright","Limité au test d''applications web avec une automatisation de navigateur","A besoin d''un accès aux fichiers dans les répertoires ''tests/e2e/specs/'' et ''tests/e2e/pages/''"],"de":["Benötigt Playwright-Installation","Begrenzt auf das Testen von Webanwendungen mit Browser-Automatisierung","Benötigt Zugriff auf Dateien in den Verzeichnissen ''tests/e2e/specs/'' und ''tests/e2e/pages/''"],"pt":["Requer instalação do Playwright","Limitado a testar aplicativos web com automação de navegador","Necessita acesso a arquivos nos diretórios ''tests/e2e/specs/'' e ''tests/e2e/pages/''"],"ru":["Требует установку Playwright","Ограничен тестированием веб-приложений с помощью автоматизации браузера","Требует доступа к файлам в директориях ''tests/e2e/specs/'' и ''tests/e2e/pages/''"],"ar":["يتطلب تثبيت Playwright","محدود باختبار تطبيقات الويب مع أتمتة المتصفح","يحتاج إلى الوصول إلى الملفات في الدلائل ''tests/e2e/specs/'' و ''tests/e2e/pages/''"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"7e98c04e562089716aa5213864ee0f19cbdf3565603f565a8da13aa9ac51c279","qualityScore":18}');
