mage NixOS from live media; progressively disclose per-hardware steps. Trigger when in a live/rescue shell preparing a fresh install.","bodyPreview":"# NixOS Install (incremental)\n\nStart here; branch into sub-skills (e.g., `apple-silicon`) when the hardware requires it.\n\nMeta: only record steps we have actually performed; after each new verified step, update this skill or the appropriate sub-skill.\n\n## Steps we have confirmed\n- Hardware-specific install commands live in sub-skills (e.g., see `apple-silicon` for macbookpro2025).\n\n## To-do (fill in after we perform them)\n- Entirely replace our hacky installer with the declarative approach descr","body":"# NixOS Install (incremental)\n\nStart here; branch into sub-skills (e.g., `apple-silicon`) when the hardware requires it.\n\nMeta: only record steps we have actually performed; after each new verified step, update this skill or the appropriate sub-skill.\n\n## Steps we have confirmed\n- Hardware-specific install commands live in sub-skills (e.g., see `apple-silicon` for macbookpro2025).\n\n## To-do (fill in after we perform them)\n- Entirely replace our hacky installer with the declarative approach described by Michael Stapelberg (2025-06-01) for new systems: https://michael.stapelberg.ch/posts/2025-06-01-nixos-installation-declarative/ — adopt once we’ve run it end-to-end.\n- ARM/PinePhone installer\n\n## References\n- See sub-skill references (e.g., `apple-silicon/links.md`) and open only when blocked.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:44:39.247Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for System Administration Agents requiring declarative configuration management with NixOS","zh":"非常适合需要使用 NixOS 进行声明性配置管理的系统管理代理","ja":"NixOS を使用した宣言的構成管理を必要とするシステム管理エージェントに最適","ko":"NixOS를 사용하여 선언적 구성 관리가 필요한 시스템 관리 에이전트에 적합","es":"Perfecto para Agentes de Administración de Sistemas que requieren gestión de configuración declarativa con NixOS","fr":"Parfait pour les agents d''administration système nécessitant une gestion de configuration déclarative avec NixOS","de":"Perfekt für Systemadministration-Agenten, die eine deklarative Konfigurationsverwaltung mit NixOS erfordern","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Administração de Sistemas que exigem gerenciamento de configuração declarativo com NixOS","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов системного администрирования, требующих декларативного управления конфигурацией с NixOS","ar":"مثالي لعميل إدارة النظام الذي يتطلب إدارة التكوين الإعلاني مع NixOS"},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to manage Linux installations using the Nix package manager, enabling declarative configuration and reproducible environments with hardware-specific install commands for devices like Apple Silicon","zh":"赋予代理管理 Linux 安装的能力，使用 Nix 包管理器，实现声明性配置和可复现的环境，并为 Apple Silicon 等设备提供硬件特定安装命令","ja":"エージェントに Linux インストールを管理する能力を与え、Nix パッケージマネージャーを使用して宣言的構成と再現可能な環境を実現し、Apple Silicon などのデバイスにハードウェア特定のインストールコマンドを提供","ko":"에이전트가 Linux 설치를 관리할 수 있도록 해주며, Nix 패키지 관리자를 사용하여 선언적 구성 및 재현 가능한 환경을 제공하고, Apple Silicon 등의 장치에 대한 하드웨어 특정 설치 명령을 제공","es":"Habilita a los agentes a gestionar instalaciones de Linux utilizando el administrador de paquetes Nix, permitiendo una configuración declarativa y entornos reproducibles con comandos de instalación específicos para hardware como Apple Silicon","fr":"Permet aux agents de gérer les installations Linux en utilisant le gestionnaire de paquets Nix, permettant une configuration déclarative et des environnements reproductibles avec des commandes d''installation spécifiques pour le matériel comme Apple Silicon","de":"Ermächtigt Agenten, Linux-Installationen mit dem Nix-Paketmanager zu verwalten, ermöglicht eine deklarative Konfiguration und reproduzierbare Umgebungen mit hardware-spezifischen Installationsbefehlen für Geräte wie Apple Silicon","pt":"Habilita os agentes a gerenciarem instalações Linux usando o gerenciador de pacotes Nix, permitindo configuração declarativa e ambientes reprodutíveis com comandos de instalação específicos de