ospectivas","integrar agente IA com Discord","exportar transcrições JSON"],"ru":["ИИ агент для Discord","транскрипция встреч в Discord","как записывать разговоры в Discord","бот для транскрипции для разработчиков","автоматизация технической документации","ИИ инструмент для ретроспектив","интеграция ИИ агента с Discord","экспорт транскрипций JSON"],"ar":["أداة ذكاء اصطناعي لـ Discord","نسخ اجتماعات Discord","كيفية تسجيل محادثات Discord","بوت النسخ للمطورين","أتمتة التوثيق الفني","أداة ذكاء اصطناعي للمراجعات","دمج أداة الذكاء الاصطناعي مع Discord","تصدير نسخ JSON"]}},"owner":"Chronote-gg","repo":"Chronote","repoPath":"Chronote-gg/Chronote","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.994Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"investigate-and-plan","description":"Investigate errors, incidents, or product ideas using both internet research and repo-wide codebase research, then propose a concrete changeset plan with clarifying questions before any implementation. Use when a user asks to investigate, root-cause, or plan changes, or when an Issue or PR is referenced and needs a plan.","bodyPreview":"# Investigate And Plan\n\n## Overview\n\nInvestigate the request, research external sources and the codebase, and produce a plan for a changeset before writing code. Ask open clarifying questions with defaults, then implement only after the plan is agreed.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Confirm scope and gather context\n\n- Identify the exact error, feature idea, or decision to investigate.\n- If a PR or Issue is referenced, use the GitHub CLI to fetch details and comments.\n- List the codebase areas to inspect,","body":"# Investigate And Plan\n\n## Overview\n\nInvestigate the request, research external sources and the codebase, and produce a plan for a changeset before writing code. Ask open clarifying questions with defaults, then implement only after the plan is agreed.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1) Confirm scope and gather context\n\n- Identify the exact error, feature idea, or decision to investigate.\n- If a PR or Issue is referenced, use the GitHub CLI to fetch details and comments.\n- List the codebase areas to inspect, including backend, frontend, bot, infra, scripts, tests, docs, and configuration.\n\n### 2) Research\n\n- Use web.run for internet research, then cite sources for any external facts.\n- Search the codebase broadly with targeted deep dives into relevant subsystems.\n- Capture findings, constraints, and risks, including any existing TODOs or comments.\n\n### 3) Propose the changeset\n\n- Provide a concrete plan with files to touch, key edits, data migrations, and test updates.\n- Call out assumptions and viable alternatives.\n- Ask open questions that block implementation, and provide defaults for each question.\n- Do not write code yet.\n\n### 4) Implement after agreement\n\n- Wait for the plan to be accepted or adjusted.\n- Implement the agreed changes, keeping the scope aligned to the plan.\n- If new information changes the plan, pause and confirm the update.\n\n### 5) Validate\n\n- Run the repo check command, prefer `yarn run check` unless a no-auto-fix run is required.\n- Ensure tests, build, lint, end-to-end, and complexity or code stats pass as required by the project.\n- Report command outcomes and any remaining gaps.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:03:54.857Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Code Analysis Agents requiring thorough investigation and planning capabilities for effective changeset management.","zh":"适用于需要彻底调查和规划能力以有效管理更改集的代码分析代理。","ja":"コード分析エージェントが徹底的な調査と計画能力を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"코드 분석 에이전트가 철저한 조사와 계획 능력을 필요로 하는 경우에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Análisis de Código que requieren una investigación y planificación exhaustivas para una gestión eficaz de conjuntos de cambios.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents d''Analyse de Code nécessitant une enquête et une planification approfondies pour une gestion efficace des jeux de modifications.","de":"Ideal für Code-Analyse-Agents, die eine gründliche Untersuchung und Planung für eine effektive Änderungsverwaltung erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Análise de Código que requerem investigação aprofundada e capacidades de planejamento para gerenciamento eficaz de conjuntos de alterações.","ru":"Идеально для Агентов Анализа Кодов, требующих тщательного расследования и возможностей планирования для эффективного управления наборами изменений.","ar":"مثالي لعميل تحليل الشفرة الذي يتطلب تحقيقًا شاملاً وقدرات التخطيط لإدارة تغييرات فعالة."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to meticulously investigate requests, research external sources and codebases, and produce detailed plans for changesets using GitHub CLI and open clarifying questions, ensuring seamless implementation and agreement.","zh":"赋予代理商密切调查请求、研究外部来源和代码库，并使用 GitHub CLI 生成详细的更改集计划和澄清问题，确保无缝实施和协议。","ja":"エージェントが要求を慎重に調査し、外部ソースとコードベースを調査し、GitHub CLI を使用して変更セットの詳細な計画と明確化された質問を生成し、シームレスな実装と合意を確保する。","ko":"에이전트가 요청을 신중하게 조사하고 외부 소스 및 코드베이스를 조사하며 GitHub CLI를 사용하여 변경 세트에 대한 자세한 계획과 명확한 질문을 생성하여 무결점 구현 및协议을 보장합니다.","es":"Habilita a los agentes a investigar meticulosamente las solicitudes, investigar fuentes y código externos, y producir planes detallados para conjuntos de cambios utilizando GitHub CLI y plantear preguntas aclaratorias, garantizando una implementación y acuerdo sin problemas.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enquêter minutieusement sur les demandes, de rechercher des sources et des codebases externes, et de produire des plans détaillés pour les jeux de modifications à l''aide de GitHub CLI et de poser des questions éclaircissantes, garantissant une mise en œuvre et un accord sans heurts.","de":"Ermächtigt die Agents, Anfragen sorgfältig zu untersuchen, externe Quellen und Codebases zu recherchieren und detaillierte Pläne für Änderungssätze mit GitHub CLI und klärende Fragen zu erstellen, um eine reibungslose Implementierung und Einigung sicherzustellen.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar meticulosamente as solicitações, pesquisar fontes externas e repositórios de código, e produzir planos detalhados para conjuntos de alterações usando GitHub CLI e abrir perguntas esclarecedoras, garantindo implementação e acordo sem problemas.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью тщательно расследовать запросы, исследовать внешние источники и базы кода, и производить подробные планы для наборов изменений с использованием GitHub CLI и задавать разъясняющие вопросы, обеспечивая бесперебойную реализацию и соглашение.","ar":"يمنح الوكلاء khảية التحقيق المeticulous في الطلبات، والبحث في المصادر الخارجية وقواعد الشفرة، وإنتاج خطط مفصلة للتعديلات باستخدام GitHub CLI وفتح أسئلة توضيحية، مما يضمن التنفيذ والتافق دون مشاكل."},"useCases":{"en":["Investigating feature requests","Debugging issues with GitHub CLI","Planning changesets for codebase updates"],"zh":["调查功能请求","使用 GitHub CLI 调试问题","为代码库更新规划更改集"],"ja":["機能リクエストの調査","GitHub CLI を使用した問題のデバッグ","コードベースの更新のための変更セットの計画"],"ko":["기능 요청 조사","GitHub CLI를 사용한 문제 디버깅","코드베이스 업데이트를 위한 변경 세트 계획"],"es":["Investigación de solicitudes de características","Depuración de problemas con GitHub CLI","Planificación de conjuntos de cambios para actualizaciones del código"],"fr":["Enquête sur les demandes de fonctionnalités","Débogage des problèmes avec GitHub CLI","Planification des jeux de modifications pour les mises à jour du codebase"],"de":["Untersuchung von Funktionsanforderungen","Fehlerbehebung bei Problemen mit GitHub CLI","Planung von Änderungssätzen für Codebase-Aktualisierungen"],"pt":["Investigação de solicitações de recursos","Depuração de problemas com GitHub CLI","Planejamento de conjuntos de alterações para atualizações de repositório de código"],"ru":["Расследование запросов на функции","Отладка проблем с GitHub CLI","Планирование наборов изменений для обновлений базы кода"],"ar":["تحقيق في طلبات الميزات","تصحيح أخطاء مع GitHub CLI","تخطيط مجموعات التعديلات لتحديثات قاعدة الشفرة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires GitHub CLI access","Dependent on quality of external sources and codebase documentation"],"zh":["需要 GitHub CLI 访问","依赖于外部来源和代码库文档的质量"],"ja":["GitHub CLI へのアクセスが必要","外部ソースとコードベースのドキュメントの品質に依存"],"ko":["GitHub CLI 액세스가 필요","외부 소스 및 코드베이스 문서의 품질에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a GitHub CLI","Dependiente de la calidad de las fuentes y la documentación del código externo"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès à GitHub CLI","Dépendante de la qualité des sources et de la documentation du codebase externe"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf GitHub CLI","Abhängig von der Qualität externer Quellen und Codebase-Dokumentation"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao GitHub CLI","Dependente da qualidade das fontes externas e da documentação do repositório de código"],"ru":["Требует доступа к GitHub CLI","Зависит от качества внешних источников и документации базы кода"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى GitHub CLI","يعتمد على جودة المصادر الخارجية وتوثيق قاعدة الشفرة"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"17288fe84b952637175e5560bbc78a2e1ea5aa2b2483de59eb539b10f50385e8","qualityScore":18}');
