achine learning","Intégration avec des outils de développement tels que React et Node.js","Compatibilité avec CLI et Agent","Prise en charge des clusters Kubernetes haute disponibilité"],"de":["Automatische Erkennung von Deployments-Fehlern","Analyse von Log-Daten und Deployments-Metriken","Lösungsempfehlungen basierend auf Machine Learning","Integration mit Entwicklungstools wie React und Node.js","Kompatibilität mit CLI und Agent","Unterstützung für hochverfügbare Kubernetes-Cluster"],"pt":["Identificação de problemas de deploy","Resolução automática de problemas","Integração com o Kubernetes","Análise de logs e métricas","Suporte a múltiplos ambientes"],"ru":["Обнаружение проблем развертывания","Автоматическое решение проблем","Интеграция с Kubernetes","Анализ логов и метрик","Поддержка нескольких сред"],"ar":["التعرف على مشاكل التوزيع","حل المشاكل تلقائيًا","التكامل مع كيوبيرنتس","تحليل السجلات والبيانات","دعم بيئات متعددة"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Kubernetes集群部署","AIエージェント","Kubernetes集群故障部署","Kubernetes集群优化","Kubernetes集群资源利用","Kubernetes集群部署日志","Kubernetes集群配置","Kubernetes集群自动化"],"ja":["Kubernetesクラスターデプロイ","AIエージェント","Kubernetesクラスターホームエディション","Kubernetesクラスターオプティマイズ","Kubernetesクラスターリソース","Kubernetesクラスターデプロイログ","Kubernetesクラスターコンフィグ","Kubernetesクラスターアウトメーション"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터 배포","AI 에이전트","Kubernetes 클러스터 홈 에디션","Kubernetes 클러스터 최적화","Kubernetes 클러스터 리소스","Kubernetes 클러스터 배포 로그","Kubernetes 클러스터 구성","Kubernetes 클러스터 자동화"],"es":["herramientas de AI para despliegues fallidos","despliegues fallidos en Kubernetes","solución de problemas de despliegue","Kubernetes Cluster Home Edition","cómo usar herramientas de AI para despliegues","alternativas a herramientas de despliegue","despliegue de aplicaciones en Kubernetes","guía de instalación de herramientas de AI","configuración de herramientas de AI para despliegues"],"fr":["outils d''IA pour déploiements échoués","déploiements échoués sur Kubernetes","résolution de problèmes de déploiement","Kubernetes Cluster Home Edition","comment utiliser des outils d''IA pour les déploiements","alternatives aux outils de déploiement","déploiement d''applications sur Kubernetes","guide d''installation d''outils d''IA","configuration d''outils d''IA pour les déploiements"],"de":["KI-Tools für fehlgeschlagene Deployments","fehlgeschlagene Deployments in Kubernetes","Fehlerbehebung bei Deployments","Kubernetes Cluster Home Edition","wie man KI-Tools für Deployments verwendet","Alternativen zu Deployments-Tools","Deployments von Anwendungen in Kubernetes","Installationsanleitung für KI-Tools","Konfiguration von KI-Tools für Deployments"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA para Kubernetes","como usar Failing Deployments","o que é Failing Deployments","Failing Deployments vs outros agentes","instalar Failing Deployments","guia de configuração do Failing Deployments"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты для Kubernetes","как использовать Failing Deployments","что такое Failing Deployments","Failing Deployments против других агентов","установить Failing Deployments","руководство по настройке Failing Deployments"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي لكيوبيرنتس","كيفية استخدام فشل التوزيع","ما هو فشل التوزيع","فشل التوزيع مقابل أدوات أخرى","تثبيت فشل التوزيع","دليل إعداد فشل التوزيع"]}},"owner":"damacus","repo":"home-ops","repoPath":"damacus/home-ops","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:11.119Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"failing-deployments","description":"Investigates failing Kubernetes pods and Flux HelmReleases to identify root causes of deployment issues in the home-ops cluster.","bodyPreview":"# Failing Deployments Agent\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for investigating and reporting on failing deployments within the Kubernetes cluster.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify Failing Pods\nList all pods across all namespaces that are NOT in `Running` or `Completed` states.\n- Command: `kubectl get pods -A | grep -v -E \"Running|Completed|NAME\"`\n\n### 2. Identify Failing HelmReleases\nCheck Flux HelmReleases for failures or stalled states.\n- Command: `flux get helmreleases -A | grep -v -E","body":"# Failing Deployments Agent\n\nThis skill provides a structured workflow for investigating and reporting on failing deployments within the Kubernetes cluster.\n\n## Workflow\n\n### 1. Identify Failing Pods\nList all pods across all namespaces that are NOT in `Running` or `Completed` states.\n- Command: `kubectl get pods -A | grep -v -E \"Running|Completed|NAME\"`\n\n### 2. Identify Failing HelmReleases\nCheck Flux HelmReleases for failures or stalled states.\n- Command: `flux get helmreleases -A | grep -v -E \"True|NAME\"`\n\n### 3. Deep Dive into Failures\nFor each failing resource identified:\n- **Pods**:\n    - Describe the pod: `kubectl describe pod <pod_name> -n <namespace>`\n    - Check recent logs: `kubectl logs <pod_name> -n <namespace> --tail=50 --all-containers`\n    - Look for events: `kubectl get events -n <namespace> --field-selector involvedObject.name=<pod_name>`\n- **HelmReleases**:\n    - Describe the release: `kubectl describe helmrelease <release_name> -n <namespace>`\n    - Check the associated Kustomization or Source if applicable.\n\n### 4. Report Findings\nConsolidate the information and report back to the main thread with:\n- Resource Name and Namespace.\n- Current Status.\n- Error message or Reason for failure (from `describe`).\n- Relevant log snippets that pinpoint the issue.\n- Potential fix or next steps."},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T03:38:39.181Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for DevOps Agents needing advanced Kubernetes cluster monitoring and troubleshooting capabilities.","zh":"非常适合需要高级 Kubernetes 集群监控和故障排除能力的 DevOps Agent。","ja":"DevOps エージェントが Kubernetes クラスターの高度な監視とトラブルシューティング機能を必要とする場合に最適です。","ko":"고급 Kubernetes 클러스터 모니터링 및 문제 해결 기능이 필요한 DevOps 에이전트에게 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para agentes de DevOps que necesitan capacidades avanzadas de monitorización y resolución de problemas de clústeres de Kubernetes.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents DevOps ayant besoin de capacités avancées de surveillance et de dépannage de clusters Kubernetes.","de":"Perfekt für DevOps-Agents, die erweiterte Überwachungs- und Fehlerbehebungsfunktionen für Kubernetes-Cluster benötigen.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes DevOps que precisam de capacidades avançadas de monitoramento e solução de problemas de clusters Kubernetes.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов DevOps, которым необходимы расширенные возможности мониторинга и устранения неполадок кластеров Kubernetes.","ar":"مثالي لعميل DevOps الذين يحتاجون إلى إمكانيات متقدمة لمراقبة وحل مشاكل مجموعة Kubernetes."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to investigate and report on failing deployments within Kubernetes clusters using kubectl and Flux HelmReleases, providing real-time insights into pod states and HelmRelease failures.","zh":"赋予代理调查和报告 Kubernetes 集群中失败的部署的能力，使用 kubectl 和 Flux HelmReleases 提供对 pod 状态和 HelmRelease 故障的实时洞察。","ja":"kubectl と Flux HelmReleases を使用して、Kubernetes クラスター内のデプロイメントの失敗を調査して報告するエージェントをEmpowerします。ポッドの状態と HelmRelease の失敗に関するリアルタイムの洞察を提供します。","ko":"kubectl 및 Flux HelmReleases를 사용하여 Kubernetes 클러스터 내에서 실패한 배포를 조사하고 보고하는 에이전트를 Empower합니다. 포드 상태 및 HelmRelease 실패에 대한 실시간洞察를 제공합니다.","es":"Empodera a los agentes para investigar e informar sobre implementaciones fallidas dentro de clústeres de Kubernetes utilizando kubectl y Flux HelmReleases, proporcionando información en tiempo real sobre los estados de los pods y los fallos de HelmReleases.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''enquêter et de faire rapport sur les déploiements en échec au sein des clusters Kubernetes en utilisant kubectl et Flux HelmReleases, fournissant des informations en temps réel sur l''état des pods et les échecs de HelmReleases.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agents, fehlgeschlagene Deployments innerhalb von Kubernetes-Clustern mit kubectl und Flux HelmReleases zu untersuchen und darüber zu berichten, und liefert Echtzeit-Einblicke in Pod-Zustände und HelmRelease-Fehler.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a investigar e relatar sobre implantações com falha dentro de clusters Kubernetes usando kubectl e Flux HelmReleases, fornecendo insights em tempo real sobre estados de pod e falhas de HelmRelease.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью расследовать и сообщать о неудачных развертываниях внутри кластеров Kubernetes с помощью kubectl и Flux HelmReleases, обеспечивая реальные представления о состояниях подов и неудачах HelmRelease.","ar":"يمنح العميل القدرة على التحقيق في الإبلاغ عن عمليات النشر الفاشلة داخل مجموعات Kubernetes باستخدام kubectl و Flux HelmReleases، ويوفر رؤى في الوقت الفعلي حول حالات pod وأخطاء HelmRelease."},"useCases":{"en":["Identifying failing pods across all namespaces","Debugging stalled or failed HelmReleases","Automating deployment failure reporting and analysis"],"zh":["跨所有命名空间识别失败的 pod","调试停滞或失败的 HelmReleases","自动化部署故障报告和分析"],"ja":["すべての名前空間の失敗したポッドを特定する","停止または失敗した HelmReleases をデバッグする","デプロイメントの失敗の報告と分析を自動化する"],"ko":["모든 네임스페이스에서 실패한 포드를 식별하는 것","중단되거나 실패한 HelmReleases를 디버깅하는 것","배포 실패 보고 및 분석 자동화"],"es":["Identificación de pods con fallos en todos los namespaces","Depuración de HelmReleases estancados o fallidos","Automatización de informes y análisis de fallos de implementación"],"fr":["Identification des pods en échec dans tous les namespaces","Débogage des HelmReleases bloqués ou en échec","Automatisation de la création de rapports et de l''analyse des échecs de déploiement"],"de":["Identifizierung fehlgeschlagener Pods in allen Namespaces","Debugging von hängengebliebenen oder fehlgeschlagenen HelmReleases","Automatisierung der Berichterstattung und Analyse von Deployment-Fehlern"],"pt":["Identificar pods com falha em todos os namespaces","Depurar HelmReleases paralisados ou com falha","Automatizar relatórios de falha de implantação e análise"],"ru":["Определение неудачных подов во всех namespace","Отладка застывших или неудачных HelmReleases","Автоматизация отчетности о неудачных развертываниях и анализ"],"ar":["تحديد pods الفاشلة في جميع النطاقات","تصحيح HelmReleases المحظورة أو الفاشلة","توفير تقارير آليّة عن فشل النشر والتحليل"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires kubectl access to Kubernetes cluster","Limited to Flux HelmReleases for Helm deployment monitoring"],"zh":["需要 kubectl 访问 Kubernetes 集群","仅限 Flux HelmReleases 进行 Helm 部署监控"],"ja":["Kubernetes クラスターへの kubectl アクセスが必要","Flux HelmReleases でのみ Helm デプロイメントの監視が可能"],"ko":["Kubernetes 클러스터에 대한 kubectl 액세스가 필요","Flux HelmReleases에서만 Helm 배포 모니터링이 가능"],"es":["Requiere acceso de kubectl al clúster de Kubernetes","Limitado a Flux HelmReleases para la monitorización de implementaciones de Helm"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès kubectl au cluster Kubernetes","Limité aux Flux HelmReleases pour la surveillance des déploiements Helm"],"de":["Erfordert kubectl-Zugriff auf den Kubernetes-Cluster","Beschränkt sich auf Flux HelmReleases für die Helm-Deployment-Überwachung"],"pt":["Requer acesso kubectl ao cluster Kubernetes","Limitado a Flux HelmReleases para monitoramento de implantação Helm"],"ru":["Требует доступа kubectl к кластеру Kubernetes","Ограничен до Flux HelmReleases для мониторинга развертывания Helm"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى kubectl لمجموعة Kubernetes","محدود بـ Flux HelmReleases لمراقبة نشر Helm"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"2241dc286efc0b531ba87208841e619986a7c3668bd9cabd73bcf8830b905db2","qualityScore":18}');
