},"keywords":{"zh":["AI智能代理","onboard工具","VSC Codex","Q/A MAS","AI开发","AI模型管理","onboard安装","onboard设置指南"],"ja":["AIエージェント","onboardツール","VSC Codex","Q/A MAS","AI開発","AIモデル管理","onboardのインストール","onboardの設定ガイド"],"ko":["AI 에이전트","onboard 도구","VSC Codex","Q/A MAS","AI 개발","AI 모델 관리","onboard 설치","onboard 설정 가이드"],"es":["herramientas de inteligencia artificial","onboard para Q/A MAS","VSC Codex","cómo usar Onboard","alternativas a Onboard","Onboard vs otras herramientas","instalación de Onboard","guía de configuración de Onboard"],"fr":["outils d''intelligence artificielle","Onboard pour Q/A MAS","VSC Codex","comment utiliser Onboard","alternatives à Onboard","Onboard vs autres outils","installation d''Onboard","guide de configuration d''Onboard"],"de":["KI-Tools","Onboard für Q/A-MAS","VSC Codex","wie man Onboard verwendet","Alternativen zu Onboard","Onboard vs andere Tools","Onboard-Installation","Onboard-Konfigurationsanleitung"],"pt":["ferramentas de IA","desenvolvimento de ferramentas de Q/A MAS","VSC Codex","Onboard","Q/A MAS","desenvolvedores","ferramentas de teste e depuração"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты","разработка инструментов Q/A MAS","VSC Codex","Onboard","Q/A MAS","разработчики","инструменты тестирования и отладки"],"ar":["أدوات الذكاء الاصطناعي","تطوير أدوات Q/A MAS","VSC Codex","اللوحة Onboard","Q/A MAS","مطوري البرامج","أدوات الاختبار والتصحيح"]}},"owner":"MykolaPinchuk","repo":"QAMAS","repoPath":"MykolaPinchuk/QAMAS","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-01T02:12:36.557Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"onboard","description":"Deterministic onboarding for this repo (read minimal index files first, then bounded discovery).","bodyPreview":"When invoked (or when the user says `Onboard`), do this exactly:\n\n1) Read (in order, if present):\n- `agents.md` (if not already in context)\n- `repo_workflow.md`\n- `onboarding.md`\n- `HANDOFF.md`\n- `REPO_MAP.md`\n- `a2a_notes.md`\n- `README.md` (focus on \"For agents\")\n- `QAMAS_PRD.md`\n- `QAMAS_IMPLEMENTATION.md`\n\n2) Bounded discovery:\n- Identify up to 10 additional files needed for the current slice.\n- Print the list (file path + 1-line reason each).\n- Open only those files after listing them.\n- Do","body":"When invoked (or when the user says `Onboard`), do this exactly:\n\n1) Read (in order, if present):\n- `agents.md` (if not already in context)\n- `repo_workflow.md`\n- `onboarding.md`\n- `HANDOFF.md`\n- `REPO_MAP.md`\n- `a2a_notes.md`\n- `README.md` (focus on \"For agents\")\n- `QAMAS_PRD.md`\n- `QAMAS_IMPLEMENTATION.md`\n\n2) Bounded discovery:\n- Identify up to 10 additional files needed for the current slice.\n- Print the list (file path + 1-line reason each).\n- Open only those files after listing them.\n- Do not perform broad repo scans.\n\n3) Output contract:\n- 5 bullets: current state summary\n- 3 options: next slice choices (each 1-2 bullets)\n- files read (including the bounded discovery list)\n- unknowns/risks (<= 5 bullets)\n\n4) Log:\n- Append an entry to `agent_logs/current.md` with intent and next steps.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-01T03:21:46.727Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Ideal for Knowledge Retrieval Agents requiring comprehensive onboarding processes through markdown files like agents.md, onboarding.md, and README.md.","zh":"适用于需要通过markdown文件（如agents.md、onboarding.md和README.md）进行全面入职流程的知识检索代理。","ja":"マークダウンファイル（例：agents.md、onboarding.md、README.md）を介した包括的なオンボーディングプロセスを必要とするナレッジリトリーバルエージェントに最適です。","ko":"마크다운 파일(예: agents.md, onboarding.md, README.md)을 통해 포괄적인 온보딩 프로세스가 필요한 지식 검색 에이전트에 적합합니다.","es":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperación de Conocimiento que requieren procesos de incorporación exhaustivos a través de archivos markdown como agents.md, onboarding.md y README.md.","fr":"Idéal pour les Agents de Recherche de Connaissances nécessitant des processus d''intégration complets via des fichiers markdown tels que agents.md, onboarding.md et README.md.","de":"Ideal für Wissensabruf-Agenten, die umfassende Onboarding-Prozesse durch Markdown-Dateien wie agents.md, onboarding.md und README.md erfordern.","pt":"Ideal para Agentes de Recuperação de Conhecimento que exigem processos de integração abrangentes por meio de arquivos markdown, como agents.md, onboarding.md e README.md.","ru":"Идеально для агентов поиска знаний, требующих комплексных процессов адаптации через файлы markdown, такие как agents.md, onboarding.md и README.md.","ar":"مثالي لعمليات وكيل استرجاع المعرفة التي تتطلب عمليات إعداد شاملة من خلال ملفات markdown مثل agents.md و onboarding.md و README.md."},"recommendation":{"en":"Enables agents to perform bounded discovery of up to 10 additional files, such as repo_workflow.md and QAMAS_PRD.md, facilitating efficient knowledge acquisition through markdown file analysis and VSC Codex integration.","zh":"使代理能够执行最多10个额外文件（如repo_workflow.md和QAMAS_PRD.md）的有界发现，通过对markdown文件的分析和VSC Codex集成，实现高效的知识获取。","ja":"エージェントが最大10個の追加ファイル（例：repo_workflow.md、QAMAS_PRD.md）に対する境界付きの発見を実行できるようにし、マークダウンファイルの分析とVSC Codexの統合を通じて効率的なナレッジの取得を促進します。","ko":"에이전트가 최대 10개의 추가 파일(예: repo_workflow.md, QAMAS_PRD.md)에 대한 경계있는 발견을 수행할 수 있도록 하여 마크다운 파일 분석 및 VSC Codex 통합을 통해 효율적인 지식 습득을促進합니다.","es":"Permite a los agentes realizar un descubrimiento limitado de hasta 10 archivos adicionales, como repo_workflow.md y QAMAS_PRD.md, lo que facilita la adquisición eficiente de conocimientos a través del análisis de archivos markdown y la integración de VSC Codex.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''effectuer une découverte limitée d''un maximum de 10 fichiers supplémentaires, tels que repo_workflow.md et QAMAS_PRD.md, ce qui facilite l''acquisition efficace de connaissances via l''analyse de fichiers markdown et l''intégration de VSC Codex.","de":"Ermöglicht es Agenten, eine begrenzte Entdeckung von bis zu 10 zusätzlichen Dateien wie repo_workflow.md und QAMAS_PRD.md durchzuführen, was eine effiziente Wissensakquise durch Markdown-Dateianalyse und VSC-Codex-Integration ermöglicht.","pt":"Permite que os agentes realizem descoberta limitada de até 10 arquivos adicionais, como repo_workflow.md e QAMAS_PRD.md, facilitando a aquisição eficiente de conhecimento por meio da análise de arquivos markdown e integração com o VSC Codex.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выполнять ограниченное открытие до 10 дополнительных файлов, таких как repo_workflow.md и QAMAS_PRD.md, облегчая эффективное приобретение знаний посредством анализа файлов markdown и интеграции с VSC Codex.","ar":"يمكن للوكيلاء أداء اكتشاف محدود لما يصل إلى 10 ملفات إضافية، مثل repo_workflow.md و QAMAS_PRD.md، وتسهيل اكتساب المعرفة بفعالية من خلال تحليل ملفات markdown ودمج VSC Codex."},"useCases":{"en":["Onboarding new agents through automated markdown file reading","Identifying essential files for knowledge acquisition using bounded discovery","Streamlining agent workflow by focusing on critical files like HANDOFF.md and REPO_MAP.md"],"zh":["通过自动化的markdown文件阅读来入职新代理","使用有界发现来识别知识获取所需的必备文件","通过关注关键文件（如HANDOFF.md和REPO_MAP.md）来优化代理工作流程"],"ja":["自動化されたマークダウンファイルの読み取りを通じて新しいエージェントをオンボードする","境界付きの発見を使用してナレッジ取得に必要な必須ファイルを識別する","重要なファイル（例：HANDOFF.md、REPO_MAP.md）に焦点を当てることでエージェントのワークフローを最適化する"],"ko":["자동화된 마크다운 파일 읽기를 통해 새로운 에이전트를 온보딩하는 것","경계있는 발견을 사용하여 지식 습득에 필요한 필수 파일을 식별하는 것","중요한 파일(예: HANDOFF.md, REPO_MAP.md)에 초점을 맞추어 에이전트의 워크플ロー 최적화"],"es":["Incorporación de nuevos agentes a través de la lectura automática de archivos markdown","Identificación de archivos esenciales para la adquisición de conocimientos utilizando la exploración limitada","Optimización del flujo de trabajo del agente centrándose en archivos críticos como HANDOFF.md y REPO_MAP.md"],"fr":["Intégration de nouveaux agents via la lecture automatisée de fichiers markdown","Identification de fichiers essentiels pour l''acquisition de connaissances en utilisant la découverte limitée","Optimisation du flux de travail de l''agent en se concentrant sur des fichiers critiques comme HANDOFF.md et REPO_MAP.md"],"de":["Onboarding neuer Agenten durch automatisierte Markdown-Dateilesung","Identifizierung wesentlicher Dateien für die Wissensakquise unter Verwendung der begrenzten Entdeckung","Optimierung des Agenten-Workflows durch Fokussierung auf kritische Dateien wie HANDOFF.md und REPO_MAP.md"],"pt":["Integração de novos agentes por meio da leitura automatizada de arquivos markdown","Identificação de arquivos essenciais para aquisição de conhecimento usando descoberta limitada","Otimização do fluxo de trabalho do agente, focando em arquivos críticos como HANDOFF.md e REPO_MAP.md"],"ru":["Интеграция новых агентов посредством автоматического чтения файлов markdown","Определение необходимых файлов для приобретения знаний с помощью ограниченного открытия","Оптимизация рабочего процесса агента, сосредоточив внимание на критических файлах, таких как HANDOFF.md и REPO_MAP.md"],"ar":["دمج وكيلاء جدد من خلال قراءة الملفات التلقائية markdown","تحديد الملفات الأساسية لاكتساب المعرفة باستخدام الاكتشاف المحدود","تحسين تدفق عمل الوكيل من خلال التركيز على الملفات الحيوية مثل HANDOFF.md و REPO_MAP.md"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to specific markdown files","Limited to reading up to 10 additional files during bounded discovery","Dependent on VSC Codex for repository workflow"],"zh":["需要访问特定的markdown文件","有界发现过程中最多只能读取10个额外文件","依赖VSC Codex进行仓库工作流程"],"ja":["特定マークダウンファイルへのアクセスが必要","境界付きの発見の際に最大10個の追加ファイルしか読み取れない","リポジトリのワークフローにVSC Codexに依存している"],"ko":["특정 마크다운 파일에 대한 액세스가 필요합니다","경계있는 발견 중 최대 10개의 추가 파일만 읽을 수 있습니다","仓库 워크플로에 VSC Codex에 의존"],"es":["Requiere acceso a archivos markdown específicos","Limitado a la lectura de hasta 10 archivos adicionales durante la exploración limitada","Dependiente de VSC Codex para el flujo de trabajo del repositorio"],"fr":["Nécessite l''accès à des fichiers markdown spécifiques","Limité à la lecture d''un maximum de 10 fichiers supplémentaires lors de la découverte limitée","Dépendant de VSC Codex pour le flux de travail du référentiel"],"de":["Erfordert Zugriff auf bestimmte Markdown-Dateien","Begrenzt auf das Lesen von bis zu 10