éveloppement de logiciels agile"],"de":["wie man spectr-apply verwendet","was ist spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklung","Alternativen zu spectr-apply","spectr-apply vs kiro","Installation von spectr-apply","Konfigurationsanleitung für spectr-apply","Software-Entwicklungstools","agile Software-Entwicklung"],"pt":["como usar spectr-apply","o que é desenvolvimento dirigido por especificações","alternativas para openspec","spectr-apply vs kiro","instalar spectr-apply","guia de configuração do spectr-apply"],"ru":["как использовать spectr-apply","что такое разработка на основе спецификаций","альтернативы для openspec","spectr-apply vs kiro","установить spectr-apply","гид по настройке spectr-apply"],"ar":["كيفية استخدام spectr-apply","ما هو التطوير الموجه بالمواصفات","بديل لبرنامج openspec","spectr-apply مقابل kiro","تثبيت spectr-apply","دليل إعداد spectr-apply"]}},"owner":"connerohnesorge","repo":"spectr","repoPath":"connerohnesorge/spectr","stars":3,"forks":2,"updatedAt":"2026-02-04T14:23:44Z","topics":["bubbletea","cli","golang","kiro","kong-cli","openspec","sdd","spec-driven-development","tui"],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"spectr-apply","description":"Apply or accept a change proposal and implement its tasks","bodyPreview":"# Change Proposal Application/Acceptance Process\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Favor straightforward, minimal implementations first and add complexity only\n  when it is requested or clearly required.\n- Keep changes tightly scoped to the requested outcome.\n- Refer to `spectr/AGENTS.md` and `spectr/project.md` (located inside\n  the `spectr/` directory—run `ls spectr`) for project and\n  Spectr conventions or clarifications.\n\n## Steps\n\nTrack these steps as TODOs and complete them one by one.\n\n1. Run `spectr acc","body":"# Change Proposal Application/Acceptance Process\n\n## Guardrails\n\n- Favor straightforward, minimal implementations first and add complexity only\n  when it is requested or clearly required.\n- Keep changes tightly scoped to the requested outcome.\n- Refer to `spectr/AGENTS.md` and `spectr/project.md` (located inside\n  the `spectr/` directory—run `ls spectr`) for project and\n  Spectr conventions or clarifications.\n\n## Steps\n\nTrack these steps as TODOs and complete them one by one.\n\n1. Run `spectr accept <id>` to convert `tasks.md` to `tasks.jsonc` format for\n   stable task tracking. Note: Both `tasks.md` (human-readable source) and\n   `tasks.jsonc` (runtime source of truth) coexist after accept—update task\n   statuses in `tasks.jsonc`.\n2. Read `spectr/changes/<id>/proposal.md`, `design.md` (if present), and\n   `tasks.jsonc` to confirm scope and acceptance criteria.\n3. Work through tasks sequentially, keeping edits minimal and focused on the\n   requested change. Update the task status in `tasks.jsonc` after verifying\n   the work.\n4. Confirm completion before updating statuses—make sure every item in\n   `tasks.jsonc` is finished.\n5. Verify/Update all task status in `tasks.jsonc` after all work is done. Tasks\n   have status values: `pending`, `in_progress`, `completed`.\n6. Read `spectr/changes/` and `spectr/specs/` directories when additional\n   context is required.\n\n## Reference\n\n- Read `spectr/changes/<id>/proposal.md` for proposal details.\n- Read `spectr/changes/<id>/specs/<capability>/spec.md` for delta specs.\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-02-27T13:14:32.545Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Development Agents needing validatable spec driven development capabilities inspired by openspec and kiro.","zh":"非常适合需要基于 openspec 和 kiro 的可验证规范驱动开发能力的开发代理","ja":"openspec と kiro にインスパイアされた検証可能な仕様駆動開発機能を必要とする開発エージェントに最適","ko":"openspec 및 kiro 에서 영감을 얻은 유효한 사양驱动 개발 기능이 필요한 개발 에이전트에게 완벽","es":"Perfecto para agentes de desarrollo que necesitan capacidades de desarrollo dirigidas por especificaciones validables inspiradas en openspec y kiro.","fr":"Parfait pour les agents de développement ayant besoin de capacités de développement pilotées par des spécifications validables inspirées par openspec et kiro.","de":"Perfekt für Entwicklungsmittel, die validierbare spezifikationsgetriebene Entwicklungsfunktionen benötigen, die von openspec und kiro inspiriert sind.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Desenvolvimento que necessitam de capacidades de desenvolvimento orientadas por especificações validáveis inspiradas por openspec e kiro.","ru":"Идеально подходит для агентов разработки, которым необходимы возможности разработки, управляемые спецификациями с возможностью проверки, вдохновленные openspec и kiro.","ar":"مثالي لعميل التطوير الذين يحتاجون إلى قدرات تطوير مدفوعة بالمواصفات الصالحة للتأكد مستوحاة من openspec و kiro."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to enforce straightforward, minimal implementations and manage change proposals using openspec and kiro conventions, while referring to Spectr project guidelines and agent specifications in `spectr/AGENTS.md` and `spectr/project.md`.","zh":"赋予代理能力以执行直接、最小化的实现，并使用 openspec 和 kiro 约定管理变更提案，同时参考 Spectr 项目指南和 `spectr/AGENTS.md` 及 `spectr/project.md` 中的代理规格","ja":"エージェントに、openspec と kiro の規約を使用して変更提案を管理し、直接的で最小限の実装を強制する能力を与え、同時に `spectr/AGENTS.md` と `spectr/project.md` に記載された Spectr プロジェクトのガイドラインとエージェントの仕様を参照する","ko":"에이전트가 openspec 및 kiro 규약을 사용하여 변경 제안을 관리하고 직접적이고 최소한의 구현을 시행하도록(enable) 하며, 동시에 `spectr/AGENTS.md` 및 `spectr/project.md` 에記述された Spectr 프로젝트 가이드라인 및 에이전트 사양을 참조","es":"Habilita a los agentes a aplicar implementaciones directas y mínimas, y a gestionar propuestas de cambios utilizando las convenciones de openspec y kiro, mientras se refiere a las pautas del proyecto Spectr y las especificaciones del agente en `spectr/AGENTS.md` y `spectr/project.md`.","fr":"Permet aux agents d''appliquer des implémentations simples et minimales, et de gérer les propositions de changements en utilisant les conventions d''openspec et kiro, tout en se référant aux directives du projet Spectr et aux spécifications de l''agent dans `spectr/AGENTS.md` et `spectr/project.md`.","de":"Ermöglicht es Mitteln, einfache und minimale Implementierungen durchzusetzen und Änderungsvorschläge unter Verwendung der openspec- und kiro-Konventionen zu verwalten, während auf die Richtlinien des Spectr-Projekts und die Agentspezifikationen in `spectr/AGENTS.md` und `spectr/project.md` verwiesen wird.","pt":"Habilita os agentes a impor implementações diretas e mínimas e gerenciar propostas de alteração usando as convenções openspec e kiro, ao mesmo tempo em que se refere às diretrizes do projeto Spectr e especificações do agente em `spectr/AGENTS.md` e `spectr/project.md`.","ru":"Наделяет агентов возможностью обеспечивать прямые и минимальные реализации, а также управлять предложениями по изменению, используя конвенции openspec и kiro, при этом ссылаясь на руководство проекта Spectr и спецификации агентов в `spectr/AGENTS.md` и `spectr/project.md`.","ar":"يمكن الوكيل من فرض تنفيذ مباشر وحد أدنى وإدارة مقترحات التغيير باستخدام اتفاقيات openspec و kiro، في الوقت نفسه يشير إلى إرشادات مشروع Spectr ومواصفات الوكيل في `spectr/AGENTS.md` و `spectr/project.md`."},"useCases":{"en":["Applying change proposals with validatable specs","Managing openspec and kiro inspired development","Enforcing Spectr project conventions"],"zh":["应用具有可验证规范的变更提案","管理 openspec 和 kiro 启发的开发","强制执行 Spectr 项目约定"],"ja":["検証可能な仕様を持つ変更提案の適用","openspec と kiro にインスパイアされた開発の管理","Spectr プロジェクトの規約の強制"],"ko":["유효한 사양을 갖는 변경 제안의 적용","openspec 및 kiro 에서 영감을 얻은 개발 관리","Spectr 프로젝트 규약의 시행"],"es":["Aplicar propuestas de cambios con especificaciones validables","Gestionar el desarrollo inspirado en openspec y kiro","Hacer cumplir las convenciones del proyecto Spectr"],"fr":["Appliquer des propositions de changements avec des spécifications validables","Gérer le développement inspiré par openspec et kiro","Faire respecter les conventions du projet Spectr"],"de":["Änderungsvorschläge mit validierbaren Spezifikationen anwenden","Die von openspec und kiro inspirierte Entwicklung verwalten","Die Konventionen des Spectr-Projekts durchsetzen"],"pt":["Aplicação de propostas de alteração com especificações validáveis","Gerenciamento do desenvolvimento inspirado por openspec e kiro","Enforce de convenções do projeto Spectr"],"ru":["Применение предложений по изменению с проверяемыми спецификациями","Управление разработкой, вдохновленной openspec и kiro","Приведение в исполнение конвенций проекта Spectr"],"ar":["تطبيق مقترحات التغيير ذات المواصفات الصالحة للتأكد","إدارة التطوير المستوحى من openspec و kiro","إنفاذ اتفاقيات مشروع Spectr"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires access to `spectr/` directory","Favors minimal implementations over complexity"],"zh":["需要访问 `spectr/` 目录","偏爱最小化实现而非复杂性"],"ja":["`spectr/` ディレクトリへのアクセスが必要","複雑さよりも最小限の実装を優先"],"ko":["`spectr/` 디렉토리에 대한 액세스가 필요","복잡성보다 최소한의 구현을 선호"],"es":["Requiere acceso al directorio `spectr/`","Favorece implementaciones mínimas sobre la complejidad"],"fr":["Nécessite un accès au répertoire `spectr/`","Préfère les implémentations minimales à la complexité"],"de":["Benötigt Zugriff auf das Verzeichnis `spectr/`","Bevorzugt minimale Implementierungen gegenüber Komplexität"],"pt":["Requer acesso ao diretório `spectr/`","Favorece implementações mínimas em vez de complexidade"],"ru":["Требует доступа к каталогу `spectr/`","Предпочитает минимальные реализации вместо сложности"],"ar":["يتطلب الوصول إلى الدليل `spectr/`","يفضل التنفيذ الأدنى بدلاً من التعقيد"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"1c0c89270b43b9a17f4ad673bc3363e4777830ea6f4ae32fc567a690a28c25d5","qualityScore":15}');
