":["Connexion à des bases de données SQL","Modèles de connecteur SQL pour Outils d''IA","Intégration avec le SDK Atlan","Développement d''applications exemple","Compatibilité avec plusieurs bases de données"],"de":["Verbindung zu SQL-Datenbanken","Muster für den SQL-Connector für KI-Agents","Integration mit dem Atlan-SDK","Entwicklung von Beispielanwendungen","Kompatibilität mit mehreren Datenbanken"],"pt":["Crie conectores SQL personalizados para aplicações de IA","Use o SDK de Aplicativos Atlan para desenvolver aplicações de IA","Integre conectores SQL com outras ferramentas de IA","Aprenda a usar padrões de design de conectores SQL","Desenvolva aplicações de IA escaláveis e seguras"],"ru":["Создавайте пользовательские коннекторы SQL для приложений ИИ","Используйте SDK приложений Atlan для разработки приложений ИИ","Интегрируйте коннекторы SQL с другими инструментами ИИ","Узнайте, как использовать шаблоны проектирования коннекторов SQL","Разрабатывайте масштабируемые и безопасные приложения ИИ"],"ar":["أنشئ متصلات SQL مخصصة لتطبيقات AI","استخدم SDK تطبيقات Atlan لتنمية تطبيقات AI","ادمج متصلات SQL مع أدوات AI أخرى","تعلم كيفية استخدام أنماط تصميم متصلات SQL","تنمية تطبيقات AI قابلة للتوسيع والأمن"]},"keywords":{"zh":["Atlan SQL Connector 模式","Atlan Application SDK","使用 Atlan Application SDK 构建示例应用","Atlan SQL Connector 模式 vs 其他工具","Atlan SQL Connector 模式 安装","Atlan SQL Connector 模式 设置指南"],"ja":["Atlan SQL Connector パターン","Atlan Application SDK","Atlan Application SDK を使用してサンプルアプリを構築する","Atlan SQL Connector パターン vs 他のツール","Atlan SQL Connector パターン インストール","Atlan SQL Connector パターン 設定ガイド"],"ko":["Atlan SQL Connector 패턴","Atlan Application SDK","Atlan Application SDK 를 사용하여 샘플 애플리케이션을 구축하는","Atlan SQL Connector 패턴 vs 다른 도구","Atlan SQL Connector 패턴 설치","Atlan SQL Connector 패턴 설정 가이드"],"es":["cómo utilizar Atlan","patrones de conector SQL","Agentes de IA","desarrollo de aplicaciones","Atlan vs otros conectores","instalación de Atlan","guía de configuración de Atlan"],"fr":["comment utiliser Atlan","modèles de connecteur SQL","Outils d''IA","développement d''applications","Atlan vs autres connecteurs","installation d''Atlan","guide de configuration d''Atlan"],"de":["wie man Atlan verwendet","Muster für den SQL-Connector","KI-Agents","Entwicklung von Anwendungen","Atlan vs andere Connectoren","Installation von Atlan","Konfigurationsleitfaden für Atlan"],"pt":["conectores SQL Atlan","IA Ferramentas","SDK de Aplicativos Atlan","como usar conectores SQL","aplicativos de IA","padrões de design de conectores SQL","desenvolvimento de aplicações de IA","integração de conectores SQL","segurança de aplicações de IA"],"ru":["ИИ Агенты Atlan","коннекторы SQL","SDK приложений Atlan","как использовать коннекторы SQL","приложения ИИ","шаблоны проектирования коннекторов SQL","разработка приложений ИИ","интеграция коннекторов SQL","безопасность приложений ИИ"],"ar":["اتلان- AI أدوات","متصلات SQL","SDK تطبيقات Atlan","كيفية استخدام متصلات SQL","تطبيقات AI","أنماط تصميم متصلات SQL","تنمية تطبيقات AI","تكامل متصلات SQL","أمن تطبيقات AI"]}},"owner":"atlanhq","repo":"atlan-sample-apps","repoPath":"atlanhq/atlan-sample-apps","stars":0,"forks":0,"updatedAt":"2026-03-02T01:56:10.923Z","topics":[],"category":"community","skillMd":{"name":"atlan-sql-connector-patterns","description":"Select and apply the correct SQL connector implementation pattern (SDK-default minimal or source-specific custom). Use when building or extending SQL metadata/query extraction connectors.","bodyPreview":"# Atlan SQL Connector Patterns\n\nChoose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Use `references/decision-tree.md` to choose `postgres-minimal` or `redshift-custom`.\n2. Implement required components for selected path.\n3. Verify auth, preflight, workflow map, and transformation behavior against references.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if requirements imply source-specific behavior or SDK override risk.\n5. Hand off to `atlan-e2e-contract-validator` for co","body":"# Atlan SQL Connector Patterns\n\nChoose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently.\n\n## Workflow\n1. Use `references/decision-tree.md` to choose `postgres-minimal` or `redshift-custom`.\n2. Implement required components for selected path.\n3. Verify auth, preflight, workflow map, and transformation behavior against references.\n4. Run `atlan-fact-verification-gate` if requirements imply source-specific behavior or SDK override risk.\n5. Hand off to `atlan-e2e-contract-validator` for contract generation.\n\n## Rules\n- Default to minimal path unless requirements justify custom path.\n- For custom path, explicitly document why SDK defaults are insufficient.\n- Reuse source-specific patterns only when corresponding requirements are present.\n\n## References\n- Decision tree: `references/decision-tree.md`\n- Shared verification map: `../_shared/references/verification-sources.md`\n"},"lastSynced":"2026-03-02T02:26:28.676Z","agentAnalysis":{"suitability":{"en":"Perfect for Data Integration Agents needing standardized Atlan SQL connector patterns for postgres-minimal or redshift-custom implementations.","zh":"适用于需要标准化Atlan SQL连接器模式的数据集成代理，尤其是postgres-minimal或redshift-custom实现。","ja":"Atlan SQLコネクタパターンを標準化する必要があるデータ統合エージェントに適しています。特に、postgres-minimalまたはredshift-customの実装に適しています。","ko":"데이터 통합 에이전트에게 표준화된 Atlan SQL 커넥터 패턴이 필요한 경우 적합합니다. 특히, postgres-minimal 또는 redshift-custom 구현에 적합합니다.","es":"Perfect for Data Integration Agents needing standardized Atlan SQL connector patterns for postgres-minimal or redshift-custom implementations.","fr":"Perfect for Data Integration Agents needing standardized Atlan SQL connector patterns for postgres-minimal or redshift-custom implementations.","de":"Perfect for Data Integration Agents needing standardized Atlan SQL connector patterns for postgres-minimal or redshift-custom implementations.","pt":"Perfeito para Agentes de Integração de Dados que necessitam de padrões padronizados de conector SQL do Atlan para implementações postgres-minimal ou redshift-custom.","ru":"Идеально подходит для Агентов Интеграции Данных, которым требуются стандартизированные шаблоны коннектора SQL Atlan для реализаций postgres-minimal или redshift-custom.","ar":"مثالي لوكلاء تكامل البيانات الذين يحتاجون إلى أنماط موحدة لموصل Atlan SQL لتنفيذات postgres-minimal أو redshift-custom."},"recommendation":{"en":"Empowers agents to choose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently, utilizing references like decision trees and verifying auth, preflight, and transformation behavior against established standards, leveraging tools such as atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","zh":"赋予代理选择合适的连接器策略并一致地实现它，利用诸如决策树的参考，并验证身份验证、预检和转换行为是否符合既定的标准，利用诸如atlan-fact-verification-gate和atlan-e2e-contract-validator的工具。","ja":"エージェントが適切なコネクタ戦略を選択し、一貫して実装できるようにします。決策ツリーなどの参考を利用し、認証、事前フライト、および変換の動作を既定の標準に対して検証します。atlan-fact-verification-gateやatlan-e2e-contract-validatorなどのツールを利用します。","ko":"에이전트가 올바른 커넥터 전략을 선택하여 일관되게 구현할 수 있도록 합니다. 결정 트리와 같은 참조를 사용하여 인증, 사전 비행 및 변환 동작을 설정된 표준과 비교하고 atlan-fact-verification-gate 및 atlan-e2e-contract-validator와 같은 도구를 사용합니다.","es":"Empowers agents to choose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently, utilizing references like decision trees and verifying auth, preflight, and transformation behavior against established standards, leveraging tools such as atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","fr":"Empowers agents to choose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently, utilizing references like decision trees and verifying auth, preflight, and transformation behavior against established standards, leveraging tools such as atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","de":"Empowers agents to choose the right connector strategy and implement it consistently, utilizing references like decision trees and verifying auth, preflight, and transformation behavior against established standards, leveraging tools such as atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","pt":"Capacita os agentes a escolher a estratégia de conector correta e implementá-la de forma consistente, utilizando referências como árvores de decisão e verificando o comportamento de autenticação, preflight e transformação em relação aos padrões estabelecidos, aproveitando ferramentas como atlan-fact-verification-gate e atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","ru":"Позволяет агентам выбирать правильную стратегию коннектора и последовательно ее реализовывать, используя такие ссылки, как деревья решений, и проверяя поведение аутентификации, предварительной проверки (preflight) и преобразования в соответствии с установленными стандартами, используя такие инструменты, как atlan-fact-verification-gate и atlan-e2e-contract-validator.","ar":"يمكن الوكلاء من اختيار استراتيجية الموصل الصحيحة وتنفيذها بشكل متسق، باستخدام مراجع مثل أشجار القرار والتحقق من سلوك المصادقة والفحص المسبق (preflight) والتحويل مقابل المعايير الموضوعة، والاستفادة من أدوات مثل atlan-fact-verification-gate و atlan-e2e-contract-validator."},"useCases":{"en":["Implementing postgres-minimal connector for streamlined data access","Customizing redshift-custom connector for specific data transformation needs","Verifying auth and preflight behavior for secure data integration","Validating transformation behavior against expected outcomes"],"zh":["为简化数据访问实现postgres-minimal连接器","为满足特定数据转换需求自定义redshift-custom连接器","验证身份验证和预检行为以确保安全的数据集成","验证转换行为是否符合预期结果"],"ja":["ストリームライン化されたデータアクセスのためにpostgres-minimalコネクタを実装する","特定のデータ変換ニーズに応じてredshift-customコネクタをカスタマイズする","セキュアなデータ統合のために認証および事前フライトの動作を検証する","期待される結果と一致する変換動作を検証する"],"ko":["데이터 접근을 간소화하기 위해 postgres-minimal 커넥터 구현","특정 데이터 변환 요구 사항에 맞게 redshift-custom 커넥터 맞춤 설정","보안 데이터 통합을 위해 인증 및 사전 비행 동작 검증","예상 결과와 일치하는 변환 동작을 확인"],"es":["Implementing postgres-minimal connector for streamlined data access","Customizing redshift-custom connector for specific data transformation needs","Verifying auth and preflight behavior for secure data integration","Validating transformation behavior against expected outcomes"],"fr":["Implementing postgres-minimal connector for streamlined data access","Customizing redshift-custom connector for specific data transformation needs","Verifying auth and preflight behavior for secure data integration","Validating transformation behavior against expected outcomes"],"de":["Implementing postgres-minimal connector for streamlined data access","Customizing redshift-custom connector for specific data transformation needs","Verifying auth and preflight behavior for secure data integration","Validating transformation behavior against expected outcomes"],"pt":["Implementação do conector postgres-minimal para acesso simplificado a dados","Personalização do conector redshift-custom para necessidades específicas de transformação de dados","Verificação do comportamento de autenticação e preflight para integração segura de dados","Validação do comportamento de transformação em relação aos resultados esperados"],"ru":["Реализация коннектора postgres-minimal для оптимизированного доступа к данным","Настройка коннектора redshift-custom для конкретных потребностей преобразования данных","Проверка поведения аутентификации и предварительной проверки (preflight) для безопасной интеграции данных","Проверка поведения преобразования на соответствие ожидаемым результатам"],"ar":["تنفيذ موصل postgres-minimal للوصول المبسط إلى البيانات","تخصيص موصل redshift-custom لاحتياجات تحويل بيانات محددة","التحقق من سلوك المصادقة والفحص المسبق (preflight) لتكامل بيانات آمن","التحقق من صحة سلوك التحويل مقابل النتائج المتوقعة"]},"limitations":{"en":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Limited to postgres-minimal and redshift-custom connector strategies","Needs atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator for comprehensive validation"],"zh":["需要Atlan Application SDK","仅限postgres-minimal和redshift-custom连接器策略","需要atlan-fact-verification-gate和atlan-e2e-contract-validator进行全面验证"],"ja":["Atlan Application SDKが必要","postgres-minimalおよびredshift-customコネクタ戦略のみ","包括的な検証のためにatlan-fact-verification-gateおよびatlan-e2e-contract-validatorが必要"],"ko":["Atlan Application SDK 필요","postgres-minimal 및 redshift-custom 커넥터 전략만 가능","전체 검증을 위해 atlan-fact-verification-gate 및 atlan-e2e-contract-validator 필요"],"es":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Limited to postgres-minimal and redshift-custom connector strategies","Needs atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator for comprehensive validation"],"fr":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Limited to postgres-minimal and redshift-custom connector strategies","Needs atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator for comprehensive validation"],"de":["Requires Atlan Application SDK","Limited to postgres-minimal and redshift-custom connector strategies","Needs atlan-fact-verification-gate and atlan-e2e-contract-validator for comprehensive validation"],"pt":["Requer o Atlan Application SDK","Limitado às estratégias de conector postgres-minimal e redshift-custom","Necessita do atlan-fact-verification-gate e do atlan-e2e-contract-validator para validação abrangente"],"ru":["Требуется Atlan Application SDK","Ограничено стратегиями коннекторов postgres-minimal и redshift-custom","Требуются atlan-fact-verification-gate и atlan-e2e-contract-validator для комплексной проверки"],"ar":["يتطلب Atlan Application SDK","يقتصر على استراتيجيات موصل postgres-minimal و redshift-custom","يحتاج إلى atlan-fact-verification-gate و atlan-e2e-contract-validator للتحقق الشامل"]},"version":3},"contentHash":"89e1e1206f17a7bc4b2259f7f3ee8662588affd482af92b71d2ef1ab13200873","qualityScore":15}');
